posite the shire hall in glyndŵr street agincourt square monmouth wales it dates from the mid-17th century and as one of the major inns in monmouth was reputedly visited by charles i of england in 1645',datetime('now')),('Q104542547','Duck House Chinese Restaurant','Duck House Chinese Restaurant',45.5093,-122.6825,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Duck House Chinese Restaurant','duck house chinese restaurant chinese restaurant in portland oregon restaurant chinese cuisine duck house chinese restaurant or simply duck house is a chinese restaurant in portland oregon in the united states the 100-seat restaurant opened in 2016',datetime('now')),('Q104579930','My Father''s Place','My Father''s Place',45.5188,-122.6609,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'My Father''s Place (Portland, Oregon)','my father''s place bar and restaurant in portland restaurant cuisine of the united states my father''s place is a restaurant and dive bar in the buckman neighborhood of portland oregon housed in the new logus block a building complex completed in 1872 included on the national register of historic places the diner has a game room and lounge and attracts a diverse clientele',datetime('now')),('Q104632336','Ribe Bryghus','Ribe Bryghus',55.33059,8.77223,'DK','brewery',2006,13.17,NULL,'ribe bryghus microbrewery',datetime('now')),('Q104720637','Hospoda U Tichánků','Hospoda U Tichánků|hospoda U Tichánků',50.646669,15.417819,'CZ','pub',NULL,13.17,NULL,'hospoda u tichánků pub',datetime('now')),('Q104759115','De Langenberg','De Langenberg',52.041167,5.691389,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,12.0,NULL,'de langenberg restaurant in ede netherlands restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q104766277','まるかつ','まるかつ',34.658875,135.819839,'JP','restaurant',NULL,12.0,NULL,'まるかつ restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q10478907','East','East',59.335706,18.072414,'SE','restaurant',1989,12.0,NULL,'east restaurant in sweden restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q10480745','Ekorren','Ekorren',59.322222,18.124722,'SE','cafe',1897,15.0,NULL,'ekorren caf