andmark diner restaurant in flower hill new york diner the landmark diner also referred to as the landmark is a diner located in the incorporated village of flower hill in nassau county on long island in new york united states it became the first double-decker diner in the united states after being rebuilt a couple of lots to the east in 2009',datetime('now')),('Q104866809','Miceli''s','Miceli''s',34.101333,-118.336028,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Miceli''s','miceli''s restaurant in california u s restaurant italian cuisine miceli''s is an italian restaurant located at 1646 n las palmas avenue half a block south of hollywood boulevard in hollywood california',datetime('now')),('Q104868296','Fogón Cocina Mexicana','Fogón Cocina Mexicana',47.615404,-122.324263,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Fogón Cocina Mexicana','fogón cocina mexicana restaurant in seattle washington u s restaurant mexican cuisine fogón cocina mexicana is a mexican restaurant in seattle''s capitol hill neighborhood in the united states',datetime('now')),('Q104868911','Taix','Taix',34.0782,-118.2614,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Taix (restaurant)','taix french restaurant in los angeles california u s restaurant french cuisine taix formerly les freres taix was a french restaurant in los angeles california founded in 1927 the restaurant complex located at 1911 sunset boulevard in the city''s echo park neighborhood featured open and private dining rooms banquet halls and a cocktail lounge with live music called the 321 lounge',datetime('now')),('Q104869040','Cloudwater Brew Co','Cloudwater Brew Co|Cloudwater Brew Co.',53.47805,-2.22166,'GB','brewery',2014,12.0,'Cloudwater Brew Co','cloudwater brew co craft brewery based in manchester brewery business cloudwater brew co is an independent craft brewery based in manchester england established in 2014 the brewery began making beer the following year and quickly gained a reputation for the quality of its products',datetime('now')),('Q104876024','The Original Di