ant)','titanic restaurant restaurant titanic was a restaurant near piccadilly circus within the regent palace hotel in london that was open between december 1998 and january 2002 it was operated by chef marco pierre white as a joint venture with the forte group',datetime('now')),('Q14680520','Kai Restaurant','Kai Restaurant',33.2667,-111.992,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Kai Restaurant','kai restaurant restaurant restaurant kai restaurant is a forbes travel guide 5-star restaurant in chandler arizona it specializes in native regional cuisine of central arizona with locally sourced heirloom ingredients sometimes from the gila river indian reservation',datetime('now')),('Q14681350','Opal''s Steak House','Opal''s Steak House',34.5297,-93.0489,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Opal''s Steak House','opal''s steak house restaurant opal''s steak house is a historic building located at 871 park avenue in hot springs arkansas opal''s steak house was constructed between 1946 and 1948 to serve tourists visiting the thermal springs in hot springs its location on park avenue served travelers on nearby u s route 70 the main highway between little rock and hot springs',datetime('now')),('Q14682460','Imperial Dynasty restaurant','Imperial Dynasty restaurant',36.333273,-119.646889,'US','restaurant',1883,15.0,'Imperial Dynasty (restaurant)','imperial dynasty restaurant restaurant in california restaurant french cuisine the imperial dynasty restaurant was a gourmet restaurant in hanford california the restaurant was founded in 1883 in hanford''s chinatown and was run by the same family for four generations having started as a simple noodle house in the 19th century',datetime('now')),('Q14683418','Moss Beach Distillery','Moss Beach Distillery',37.5178,-122.513,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Moss Beach Distillery','moss beach distillery restaurant in california restaurant moss beach distillery is a restaurant in moss beach california located on a cliff which overlooks the pacific ocean it is of