as considered a downtown minneapolis landmark for 80 years',datetime('now')),('Q1470310','Weißes Rössl','Weißes Rössl',47.73738,13.44812,'AT','restaurant',NULL,13.17,NULL,'weißes rössl restaurant hotel',datetime('now')),('Q14704654','Lake McDonald Lodge Coffee Shop','Lake McDonald Lodge Coffee Shop',48.617683,-113.876435,'US','cafe',1965,19.85,'Lake McDonald Lodge Coffee Shop','lake mcdonald lodge coffee shop café the lake mcdonald lodge coffee shop is a visitor services building in the lake mcdonald district of glacier national park montana the coffee shop was built in 1965 as part of the national park service''s mission 66 program to upgrade visitor facilities in order to increase visitor dining capacity',datetime('now')),('Q14704806','Bassett Lodge and Range Cafe','Bassett Lodge and Range Cafe',42.5853,-99.5378,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Bassett Lodge and Range Cafe','bassett lodge and range cafe bassett nebraska listed on the nrhp restaurant hotel building the bassett lodge and range cafe located at 205 clark in bassett nebraska usa was built during 1949 51 it was designed by local architect and lumberyard owner thomas j galleher in moderne style',datetime('now')),('Q14705189','Landrum''s Hamburger System No. 1','Landrum''s Hamburger System No. 1',39.5117,-119.805,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Landrum''s Hamburger System No. 1','landrum''s hamburger system no 1 restaurant in nevada united states of america restaurant the landrum''s hamburger system no 1 at 1300 s virginia st',datetime('now')),('Q14706188','Blue Hill Restaurant','Blue Hill Restaurant',40.732,-73.9996,'US','restaurant',2000,19.02,'Blue Hill (restaurant)','blue hill restaurant restaurant in new york city restaurant family meal at blue hill formerly known as blue hill and also known as blue hill new york is a restaurant in new york city''s greenwich village blue hill was established in april 2000 and is owned by dan david and laureen barber',datetime('now')),('Q14706883','Manganaros','Manganaros',40.7555,-73.9945,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Manganaro''s','manganaros restaurant in new york city usa restaurant italian cuisine manganaro''s grosseria italiana commonly referred to as manganaro''s was an italian market and deli on ninth avenue in the hell''s kitchen neighborhood of manhattan new york city it opened in 1893 and operated for 119 years helping to introduce the hero sandwich to americans',datetime('now')),('Q14707228','Roberta''s','Roberta''s|羅伯塔',40.7049,-73.9334,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Roberta''s','roberta''s new american pizzeria in brooklyn new york restaurant roberta''s is a new american pizzeria in brooklyn new york located in the neighborhood of east williamsburg it is known for its wood oven cooked pizza and hipster vibe',datetime('now')),('Q14707266','Saint Vitus','Saint Vitus',40.7368,-73.9552,'US','bar',2011,19.85,'Saint Vitus (venue)','saint vitus bar and music venue in brooklyn new york bar music venue saint vitus also called saint vitus bar is a bar and music venue located in the bushwick neighborhood of brooklyn new york the original location opened in greenpoint in april 2011 and the 2 500 square feet 230 m2 venue was known for its heavy metal atmosphere',datetime('now')),('Q14707433','The Embers (NYC Club)','The Embers (NYC Club)|The Embers',40.7588,-73.9699,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'The Embers (nightclub)','the embers nyc club embers nightclub jazz club the embers was a 1950s and 1960s-era new york city restaurant and nightclub formerly located at 161 east 54th street between 3rd and lexington avenues it was opened in late 1951 by former jazz musician ralph watkins who had also been involved with clubs such as bop city and royal roost and featured many notable jazz acts over the years including marian mcpartland dorothy donegan joe bushkin george shearing jonah jones red norvo george barnes and carl kress and the erroll garner trio',datetime('now')),('Q14707831','Zabar''s','Zabar''s|ゼイバーズ',40.78483,-73.97966,'US','restaurant',1934,27.64,'Zabar''s','zabar''s specialty food store in new york city supermarket appetizing store zabar''s zay-barz is an appetizing store at 2245 broadway and 80th street on the upper west side of manhattan in new york city founded by louis and lillian zabar it is known for its selection of bagels smoked fish olives and cheeses',datetime('now')),('Q14708943','Jake''s Famous Crawfish','Jake''s Famous Crawfish',45.5225,-122.683,'US','restaurant',1892,16.17,'Jake''s Famous Crawfish','jake''s famous crawfish seafood restaurant in portland oregon restaurant seafood jake''s famous crawfish is a seafood restaurant in downtown portland oregon founded in 1892 by jacob jake lewis freiman it is housed in the whitney and gray building completed in 1910',datetime('now')),('Q1470977','Rief-Haus','Rief-Haus',48.0062,9.74228,'DE','pub',NULL,12.0,NULL,'rief-haus building in ingoldingen tübingen government region bade-württemberg germany gasthaus',datetime('now')),('Q14710109','Netherland Inn','Netherland Inn',36.5511,-82.5947,'US','pub',NULL,12.0,'Netherland Inn','netherland inn historic buildings in kingsport tennessee united states inn the netherland inn and complex is a historic house museum in kingsport tennessee united states built in 1802 to serve as a boat yard for salt distribution the property was eventually sold and in 1818 it became the netherland inn serving travelers en route from middle tennessee to western kentucky',datetime('now'));
INSERT INTO institutions VALUES ('Q14711311','Scholz Garten','Scholz Garten',30.2778,-97.7364,'US','beer_hall',NULL,13.17,'Scholz Garten','scholz garten historic place in austin travis county texas beer garden scholz garten also known as scholz beer garden is a beer garden and restaurant in downtown austin texas and one of the oldest operating businesses in texas among the texas businesses that predate scholz garten are the daily news in galveston 1842 the excelsior hotel in jefferson 1858 the menger hotel in san antonio 1859 and imperial sugar in sugar land 1842',datetime('now')),('Q14711947','29 Diner','29 Diner',38.8581,-77.3086,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'29 Diner','29 diner united states historic place restaurant the 29 diner is a diner in the city of fairfax virginia the diner was located at 10536 fairfax boulevard u s route 29 u s route 50 a short distance west of the boulevard''s intersection with chain bridge road virginia state route 123',datetime('now')),('Q14712303','Fairfax Arms','Fairfax Arms',38.6686,-77.2356,'US','pub',NULL,13.17,'Fairfax Arms','fairfax arms place in virginia listed on national register of historic places tavern inn the fairfax arms also known as the colchester inn is a historic inn and tavern located at colchester fairfax county virginia it was built in the mid-18th century and is a 1 1 2-story three-bay brick building measuring approximately 25 feet by 32 feet',datetime('now')),('Q14712717','Little Grill Collective','Little Grill Collective',38.4561,-78.8643,'US','restaurant',2003,19.85,'Little Grill Collective','little grill collective restaurant in rockingham virginia restaurant the little grill is a restaurant in harrisonburg virginia the establishment opened in june 2003 it was a worker owned collective from 2003 to 2022',datetime('now')),('Q14713089','Powell''s Tavern','Powell''s Tavern',37.5825,-77.6603,'US','pub',NULL,12.0,'Powell''s Tavern','powell''s tavern place in virginia listed on national register of historic places tavern inn powell''s tavern is a historic inn and tavern located at manakin goochland county virginia the earliest section was built about 1808 with additions made by 1815 and 1820',datetime('now')),('Q14713604','Canlis','Canlis',47.64308,-122.34675,'US','restaurant',1950,12.0,'Canlis','canlis fine-dining restaurant in seattle restaurant new american cuisine canlis is a fine dining restaurant serving new american and pacific northwest cuisine in seattle washington situated in the queen anne neighborhood the restaurant has views of gas works park and the cascade mountains',datetime('now')),('Q14715437','Charlie''s Kitchen','Charlie''s Kitchen',42.3725,-71.1215,'US','restaurant',1951,13.17,'Charlie''s Kitchen','charlie''s kitchen restaurant in harvard square restaurant charlie''s kitchen the double cheeseburger king is a restaurant serving american fare with new england specialties in the harvard square neighborhood of cambridge massachusetts charlie s houses bars on two separate floors additionally a front patio and backyard beer garden are open seasonally',datetime('now')),('Q14715497','Groton Inn','Groton Inn',42.6067,-71.5686,'US','pub',1787,15.0,'Groton Inn','groton inn inn in groton united states of america inn the groton inn is an inn at 128 main street in groton massachusetts until 2011 it was an inn consisting of three historic structures and was believed to be the oldest operating inn in the nation',datetime('now')),('Q14715714','Miss Florence Diner','Miss Florence Diner',42.3353,-72.6717,'US','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'Miss Florence Diner','miss florence diner diner the miss florence diner is a historic diner at 99 main street in the florence section of northampton massachusetts it was manufactured in 1941 by the worcester lunch car company and is one of four diners in the city',datetime('now')),('Q14744170','Stoombierbrouwerij De Keyzer','Stoombierbrouwerij De Keyzer',50.8485,5.699445,NULL,'brewery',NULL,12.0,NULL,'stoombierbrouwerij de keyzer brewery museum