nd victoria australia is a remodelled 19th-century pub which has been a live music venue since the 1940s and since 1995 a popular rock music venue and rooftop bar',datetime('now')),('Q14935088','Devonshire Arms Hotel','Devonshire Arms Hotel',-37.806945,144.976111,'AU','pub',1843,16.17,'Devonshire Arms Hotel, Fitzroy','devonshire arms hotel heritage listed hotel in fitzroy victoria australia pub hotel the devonshire arms hotel is a former pub located at 38 fitzroy street fitzroy in the state of victoria australia it operated as a hotel from 1843 to 1920',datetime('now')),('Q1493519','Ratskeller Leipzig','Ratskeller Leipzig',51.336639,12.373,'DE','restaurant',NULL,13.17,NULL,'ratskeller leipzig building in leipzig saxony germany restaurant ratskeller',datetime('now')),('Q14935785','C Restaurant','C Restaurant',-31.955048,115.859334,'AU','restaurant',2001,12.0,'C Restaurant','c restaurant revolving restaurant on 33rd floor in perth western australia restaurant c restaurant is a revolving restaurant located at level 33 of st martins tower in perth western australia the only revolving restaurant in perth it completes a full 360-degree rotation in 90 minutes and offers views of the swan river the suburbs and the hills',datetime('now')),('Q14935801','Greenhouse','Greenhouse',-31.954722,115.8575,'AU','restaurant',2009,12.0,'Greenhouse (restaurant)','greenhouse restaurant in western australia australia restaurant greenhouse was an eco-friendly bar and restaurant at 100 st georges terrace in perth western australia with a concept that included being well designed and completely waste free the restaurant featured a vegetable garden on the roof a zero-carbon footprint and ground its own organic flour',datetime('now')),('Q14935902','Restaurant Amusé','Restaurant Amusé',-31.955,115.873889,'AU','restaurant',2007,13.17,'Restaurant Amusé','restaurant amusé restaurant in western australia australia restaurant heritage site double house restaurant amusé was a restaurant in east perth 