romontory above obersalzberg near berchtesgaden in southeastern germany completed in 1938 it was commissioned by the nazi party for official and social functions and was visited by adolf hitler on at least 14 documented occasions',datetime('now')),('Q1620922','Regensburg Sausage Kitchen','Regensburg Sausage Kitchen|Historische Wurstkuchl|历史香肠厨房|ヒストーリッシェ・ヴルストキュッヘ|Историческая сосисочная Регенсбурга',49.021,12.0976,'DE','restaurant',NULL,36.0,'Historische Wurstkuchl','regensburg sausage kitchen restaurant in regensburg germany fast food restaurant built structure historische wurstkuchl german for ''historic sausage kitchen'' is a restaurant in regensburg germany this is notable as perhaps the oldest continuously open public restaurant in the world',datetime('now')),('Q1622954','Hofbrauhaus Arolsen','Hofbrauhaus Arolsen|Hofbrauhaus Heinrich Brüne|ホフブロイハウス・アロルセン',51.381556,9.019331,'DE','brewery',1131,22.02,'Hofbrauhaus Arolsen','hofbrauhaus arolsen trademark brewery trademark hofbrauhaus arolsen or royal brewery arolsen is the oldest brewery in the hesse federal state located in bad arolsen town germany recent company name is hofbrauhaus heinrich brüne gmbh & co',datetime('now')),('Q1622974','Edegger-Tax bakery','Edegger-Tax bakery|Hofbäckerei Edegger-Tax|Boulangerie de la Cour',47.072475,15.439653,'AT','bakery',NULL,19.85,'Edegger-Tax','edegger-tax bakery bakery in graz austria bakery hofbäckerei edegger-tax is the oldest operating bakery in graz austria founded in 1569 the bakery is famous for its decorated shop facade on the hofgasse street',datetime('now')),('Q16238096','Nick''s','Nick''s',40.8266,-73.9434,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Nick''s','nick''s jazz tavern in new york city jazz club nick''s nick''s tavern was a tavern and jazz club located in the greenwich village neighborhood of the borough in manhattan new york city which peaked in popularity during the 1940s and 1950s it was notable for its position because most popular jazz clubs at this time were locat