edmoe nebo is a three-level revolving restaurant in the ostankino tv tower in moscow russia the restaurant consists of three halls bronze silver and gold occupying three separate floors at altitudes of 328 334 m 1 076 1 096 ft above the ground',datetime('now')),('Q16707717','Black Lion','Black Lion|The Black Lion',51.5438,-0.199868,'GB','pub',NULL,24.64,'Black Lion, Kilburn','black lion pub in kilburn london pub the black lion is a grade ii listed public house at 274 kilburn high road kilburn london it is on the campaign for real ale''s national inventory of historic pub interiors',datetime('now')),('Q16707726','Crocker''s Folly','Crocker''s Folly',51.5259,-0.1749,'GB','pub|restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Crocker''s Folly','crocker''s folly public house at 24 aberdeen place st john''s wood london restaurant pub crocker''s folly is a grade ii listed public house at 24 aberdeen place st john''s wood london it was built in 1898 in a northern renaissance style and was previously called the crown',datetime('now')),('Q16707728','Druid''s Head','Druid''s Head',51.4092,-0.306458,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Druid''s Head, Kingston upon Thames','druid''s head pub in kingston upon thames greater london england uk pub the druid''s head is a grade ii listed public house at 3 market place kingston upon thames london built in the 17th and early 18th centuries it originally consisted of two pubs the druid and the hog''s head',datetime('now')),('Q16707729','Eastbrook','Eastbrook',51.551,0.163222,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'Eastbrook, Dagenham','eastbrook pub in dagenham london united kingdom pub the eastbrook is a grade ii listed public house at dagenham road dagenham london in listing it at grade ii historic england note its smart neo-georgian exterior with good detailing and materials design quality contrasting aesthetic in the oak and walnut bars which epitomises the pluralistic approach to design in the inter-war years and nostalgia for ''merrie england'' planning an archetypal inter-war improved road house with a range of rooms for different functions and clientele intactness virtually unaltered high-quality interior complete with',datetime('now')),('Q16707737','Half Moon','Half Moon',51.45275,-0.10089,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Half Moon, Herne Hill','half moon public house at 10 half moon lane herne hill london pub hotel the half moon is a grade ii listed public house at 10 half moon lane herne hill london it is one of only 270 pubs on the campaign for real ale''s national inventory of historic pub interiors was frequented by the poet and writer dylan thomas and was a noteworthy live music venue for nearly 50 years hosting three gigs by u2 in 1980',datetime('now')),('Q16707742','Hoop and Grapes','Hoop and Grapes',51.5142,-0.074177,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Hoop and Grapes, Aldgate High Street','hoop and grapes pub on aldgate high street city of london pub the hoop and grapes is a grade ii listed public house at aldgate high street in the city of london',datetime('now')),('Q16707743','King''s Head','King''s Head',51.450287,-0.240766,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'King''s Head, Roehampton','king''s head pub in roehampton london pub the king''s head is a grade ii listed public house at 1 roehampton high street roehampton london sw15 4hl it dates back to the 17th century although altered and extended since then',datetime('now')),('Q16707746','London Apprentice, Isleworth','London Apprentice, Isleworth',51.4711,-0.32087,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'London Apprentice, Isleworth','london apprentice isleworth pub in isleworth london pub the london apprentice is a grade ii listed public house at 62 church street isleworth london the present building dates to the early 18th century recorded as a licensed inn by 1731',datetime('now')),('Q16707750','Montague Arms','Montague Arms',51.449953,-0.240088,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Montague Arms','montague arms pub in roehampton london pub the montague arms is a grade ii listed building at 3 medfield street roehampton london previously a public house it dates to the 17th century although has been altered since',datetime('now')),('Q16707752','Museum Tavern','Museum Tavern',51.518197,-0.125841,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Museum Tavern','museum tavern camden greater london wc1b pub the museum tavern is a grade ii listed public house at 49 great russell street bloomsbury london it was built from about 1855 64 by william finch hill and edward lewis paraire',datetime('now')),('Q16707771','The Tabard','The Tabard',51.4957,-0.254605,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Tabard, Chiswick','the tabard pub in chiswick london borough of hounslow england uk pub the block of three buildings containing the tabard public house formerly the tabard inn is a grade ii listed structure in chiswick london the block with a row of seven gables in its roof was designed by norman shaw in 1880 as part of the community focus of the bedford park garden suburb',datetime('now')),('Q16707773','The Flying Horse','The Flying Horse|The Tottenham|토트넘',51.5166,-0.130808,'GB','pub',NULL,28.39,'The Flying Horse','the flying horse pub on oxford street london pub the flying horse is a grade ii listed public house at 6 oxford street marylebone in the city of westminster it was built in the 19th century and is the last remaining pub on oxford street',datetime('now')),('Q16707776','Town of Ramsgate','Town of Ramsgate',51.503367,-0.062084,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Town of Ramsgate','town of ramsgate pub in wapping london pub the town of ramsgate public house is located at the centre of the ancient hamlet of wapping in the london borough of tower hamlets',datetime('now')),('Q16707778','Wells Tavern','Wells Tavern',51.5586,-0.173611,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Wells Tavern, Hampstead','wells tavern pub in hampstead london pub the wells tavern is a grade ii listed public house at 30 well walk hampstead london it was built in about 1849',datetime('now')),('Q16707781','White Lion','White Lion',51.465737,-0.21466,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The White Lion, Putney','white lion pub in putney london pub the white lion is a grade ii listed public house in putney in the london borough of wandsworth',datetime('now')),('Q16707782','The Widow''s Son, London','The Widow''s Son, London',51.5222,-0.018008,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Widow''s Son, London','the widow''s son london pub in bromley-by-bow england pub the widow''s son is a grade ii listed public house at 75 devons road in bromley-by-bow east london it was built in the early 19th century possibly 1848 and the existing building is supposedly on the site of an old widow''s cottage',datetime('now')),('Q16712611','Freken Bock (Cafe)','Freken Bock (Cafe)|Фрекен Бок',47.210749,38.932113,'RU','cafe',2009,24.64,'Freken Bock (Cafe)','freken bock cafe art-café in rostov oblast russia café freken bock russian фрекен бок is an art-cafe in taganrog created near the parents'' house and the monument of faina ranevskaya in 2009',datetime('now')),('Q16763786','Q16763786','',49.648762,6.112665,'LU','cafe|restaurant',NULL,13.17,NULL,'q16763786 restaurant lieu-dit café',datetime('now')),('Q16774456','Ballsaal Lindengarten','Ballsaal Lindengarten',51.078889,13.7575,'DE','brewery',NULL,13.17,NULL,'ballsaal lindengarten building in dresden saxony germany brewery event venue ballroom',datetime('now')),('Q16820254','''t Schulten Hues','''t Schulten Hues',52.1392,6.19494,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,24.0,'''t Schulten Hues','''t schulten hues restaurant in zutphen netherlands restaurant ''t schulten hues was a restaurant in zutphen netherlands it was a fine dining restaurant that was awarded one michelin star for the period 2005 2018',datetime('now')),('Q16825547','Capt. William Bull Tavern','Capt. William Bull Tavern',41.7811,-73.1612,'US','pub',1760,15.0,'Captain William Bull Tavern','capt william bull tavern historic inn at 571 torrington road in litchfield connecticut inn the captain william bull tavern is a historic inn at 571 torrington road route 202 in litchfield connecticut it is part of the tollgate hill inn and restaurant and is listed on the national register of historic places',datetime('now')),('Q16826522','B.T.''s Smokehouse','B.T.''s Smokehouse',42.111281,-72.094434,'US','restaurant',2007,12.0,'B.T.''s Smokehouse','b t ''s smokehouse smokehouse restaurant in massachusetts restaurant b t ''s smokehouse is a restaurant that specializes in dry-rubbed and slow-smoked barbecue and is located in the downtown section of sturbridge massachusetts the restaurant smokes about 9 000 pounds 4 100 kg of meat per week with brisket being 2 000 pounds 910 kg to 3 000 pounds 1 400 kg of that total',datetime('now')),('Q16830904','Colbitzer Heide-Brauerei','Colbitzer Heide-Brauerei',52.316675,11.610535,'DE','brewery',1872,22.85,NULL,'colbitzer heide-brauerei brewery trademark business enterprise',datetime('now')),('Q16831519','Schwarzer Adler','Schwarzer Adler|Gaststätte Schwarzer Adler',52.677714,13.588564,'DE','pub',NULL,12.0,NULL,'schwarzer adler restaurant in bernau bei berlin brandenburg germany inn',datetime('now')),('Q16836639','El Willy','El Willy',31.2306,121.494,'CN','restaurant',2008,19.02,'El Willy','el willy restaurant in shanghai china restaurant spanish cuisine el willy is a spanish restaurant in shanghai china it opened in january 2008 and is operated by chef willy trullas moreno who is from spain',datetime('now')),('Q16836694','Elements','Elements',40.355,-74.669,'US','restaurant',2008,12.0,'Elements (restaurant)','elements restaurant in princeton usa restaurant new american cuisine elements is a new american fine dining restaurant located in princeton new jersey which reopened on august 11 2015 at its new location on witherspoon street in downtown princeton the restaurant originally opened in 2008 on bayard lane in princeton and closed in 2014 while the new location was developed',datetime('now')),('Q16843498','Blue Wall Cafe','Blue Wall Cafe',42.3916,-72.5267,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Blue Wall Cafe','blue wall cafe restaurant the blue wall is a former dive bar and current food court at the university of massachusetts amherst opening inside the murray d lincoln campus center in the 1970s the bar made upwards of 600 000 in the late 1970s over 2 300 000 in 2013 dollars and went through 1 800 kegs a year',datetime('now')),('Q16844191','Holderness Inn','Holderness Inn',43.7314,-71.59,'US','pub',NULL,12.0,'Holderness Inn','holderness inn inn hotel the holderness inn is a former 19th century hotel on united states route 3 in holderness new hampshire built in 1895 96 it is the only such building standing in the squam lake area from a period when there were a significant number of resort hotels around the lake',datetime('now')),('Q16844402','Bono''s Restaurant and Deli','Bono''s Restaurant and Deli',34.1064,-117.469,'US','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Bono''s Restaurant and Deli','bono''s restaurant and deli restaurant bono''s restaurant and deli was a historic restaurant located at 15395 foothill boulevard in fontana california the restaurant opened in 1936 to serve travelers on u s route 66 which then passed in front of the site it originally operated as a produce stand',datetime('now'));
