house in shimabara japan barbershop café historic building',datetime('now')),('Q16874280','Paris Cafe','Paris Cafe',40.7073,-74.0016,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Paris Cafe','paris cafe wikimedia disambiguation page restaurant cuisine of the united states paris cafe may refer to',datetime('now')),('Q16890109','CC Slaughters','CC Slaughters',45.5247,-122.673,'US','bar',NULL,13.17,'CC Slaughters','cc slaughters gay bar and nightclub gay bar venue cc slaughters is a gay bar and nightclub located in portland oregon and puerto vallarta mexico the portland bar is located in the old town chinatown neighborhood and the puerto vallarta bar is located in zona romántica',datetime('now')),('Q16890674','Corky''s','Corky''s',34.1624,-118.449,'US','restaurant',1958,13.17,'Corky''s','corky''s restaurant building in los angeles california restaurant corky''s was a restaurant that operated in the sherman oaks neighborhood of los angeles california from 1958 to 2019 it originally opened as stanley burke''s coffee shop in 1958',datetime('now')),('Q16891401','The Fox Inn, Hanwell','The Fox Inn, Hanwell',51.5044,-0.343403,'GB','pub',1848,16.17,'The Fox Inn, Hanwell','the fox inn hanwell pub in london uk pub the fox inn is a public house in green lane hanwell in the london borough of ealing built in 1848 it is a largely unspoilt and original mid-victorian pub',datetime('now')),('Q16892363','Hoagie Haven','Hoagie Haven',40.3522,-74.6519,'US','restaurant',1974,12.0,'Hoagie Haven','hoagie haven restaurant in new jersey united states restaurant north american cuisine hoagie haven also known as haven or the haven is an eatery located in princeton new jersey founded in 1974 in 1976 emily and george roussos purchased the restaurant and retained the name hoagie haven',datetime('now')),('Q16892514','Hubbell House','Hubbell House',44.0669,-92.755,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Hubbell House','hubbell house restaurant in minnesota usa restaurant the hubbell house in mantorville minnesota united states is one of the oldest working restaurants in the state of minnesota it is a contributing property to the mantorville historic district which is listed on the national register of historic places',datetime('now')),('Q16892740','The Ivy (Los Angeles)','The Ivy (Los Angeles)',34.0757,-118.384,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'The Ivy (United States)','the ivy los angeles restaurant in los angeles restaurant the ivy is a restaurant located at 113 n robertson boulevard in los angeles founded and owned by chef richard irving and interior designer lynn von kersting they run the restaurant alongside their daughter india von kersting irving',datetime('now')),('Q16892897','Jess & Jim''s Steakhouse','Jess & Jim''s Steakhouse',38.8823,-94.5892,'US','restaurant',1938,15.0,'Jess & Jim''s Steakhouse','jess & jim''s steakhouse steakhouse in kansas city steakhouse steakhouse jess & jim''s steakhouse is a steakhouse restaurant located on 135th street in martin city missouri founded in 1938 jess & jim''s has been ranked numerous times by national publications as one of the best steakhouses in the united states',datetime('now')),('Q16894221','Lisbon Inn','Lisbon Inn',44.2131,-71.9128,'US','pub',NULL,12.0,'Lisbon Inn','lisbon inn inn hotel the lisbon inn formerly the moulton is a historic former hotel building on united states route 302 in lisbon new hampshire located at the southern end of lisbon''s central business district the 1901 three story wood-frame building is an imposing presence with queen anne-style pyramidal roof turrets at the corners of the main facade',datetime('now')),('Q16894326','London Coffee House','London Coffee House',39.9495,-75.1422,'US','cafe',NULL,13.17,'London Coffee House (Philadelphia)','london coffee house café london coffee house often called the old london coffee house was a philadelphia coffee house and merchants exchange in the colonial-era province of pennsylvania located at the southwest corner of market formerly high street and front streets it was one block west of the delaware river waterfront',datetime('now')),('Q16894357','Lovett''s by Lafayette Brook','Lovett''s by Lafayette Brook',44.2044,-71.7236,'US','pub',1820,15.0,'Lovett''s by Lafayette Brook','lovett''s by lafayette brook inn in franconia new hampshire inn lovett''s by lafayette brook or lovett''s inn is a historic farmstead and inn at 1474 profile road new hampshire route 18 in franconia new hampshire united states it is one of a few surviving early 20th century hostelries in the state dating to a period when many large and more elaborate hotels stood that have succumbed to fire or demolition',datetime('now')),('Q16895037','Melody Inn','Melody Inn',39.8256,-86.1595,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Melody Inn (nightclub)','melody inn bar and live music venue in indianapolis indiana u s restaurant the melody inn also known as the mel is a bar and live music club in the butler-tarkington neighborhood of indianapolis indiana united states it is estimated that over 7 000 bands and musical acts have played the melody inn since 2001',datetime('now')),('Q16895229','Missouri Pacific Railway Van Noy Eating House','Missouri Pacific Railway Van Noy Eating House',33.6281,-91.395,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Missouri Pacific Railway Van Noy Eating House','missouri pacific railway van noy eating house restaurant the missouri pacific railway van noy eating house is a historic restaurant building at the corner of seamans drive and railroad street in mcgehee arkansas us the single-story brick building was constructed c 1910 by the missouri pacific railroad and housed a dining establishment operated by the van noy railway news and hotel company',datetime('now')),('Q16895543','Murano','Murano|慕拉諾餐廳',51.50712,-0.14727,'GB','restaurant',2008,13.17,'Murano (restaurant)','murano restaurant in the united kingdom restaurant murano is a restaurant situated in london england it was opened in august 2008 by chefs angela hartnett and gordon ramsay',datetime('now')),('Q16895775','The New Penny','The New Penny',53.794582,-1.54172,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The New Penny','the new penny pub in leeds west yorkshire united kingdom pub the new penny is a gay pub in the calls area of leeds west yorkshire',datetime('now')),('Q16896253','Otto''s Sausage Kitchen','Otto''s Sausage Kitchen',45.479,-122.61974,'US','restaurant',1922,16.17,'Otto''s Sausage Kitchen','otto''s sausage kitchen restaurant and meat market in portland oregon restaurant otto''s sausage kitchen formerly otto''s meat market is a sausage restaurant and meat market located in the woodstock neighborhood of portland oregon united states german immigrant otto eichentopf established otto''s meat market in aberdeen washington in the 1910s before relocating to portland in 1921',datetime('now')),('Q16896440','Papa''s Tomato Pies','Papa''s Tomato Pies',40.2161,-74.6238,'US','restaurant',1912,16.17,'Papa''s Tomato Pies','papa''s tomato pies historic pizzeria selling trenton tomato pies in new jersey usa restaurant papa''s tomato pies is a historic pizzeria in robbinsville new jersey founded by giuseppe joe papa in 1912 on south clinton avenue in trenton the restaurant specializes in selling trenton tomato pies',datetime('now')),('Q16896508','Peacock Brewery','Peacock Brewery',42.2731,-89.0867,'US','brewery',NULL,13.17,'Peacock Brewery','peacock brewery buildings in rockford illinois us brewery peacock brewery also known at times as the rockford brewing company and the rock river brewing company is a historic pair of buildings on the east side of the rock river in rockford illinois united states it was rockford''s largest brewery for almost seventy years',datetime('now')),('Q16896934','Oslo','Oslo',51.547283,-0.055575,'GB','pub|bar',2014,13.17,'Oslo (club)','oslo discothèque bar and food venue located in the london borough of hackney discothèque pub bar oslo is a live music venue bar and club located in hackney central east london it was one of the first clubs to open in the area',datetime('now')),('Q16898303','Picasso','Picasso',36.1139,-115.174,'US','restaurant',1998,12.0,'Picasso (restaurant)','picasso restaurant restaurant french cuisine picasso was a restaurant run by chef julian serrano in las vegas nevada united states the name is derived from the artist pablo picasso and features the artist''s paintings throughout the restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q16898318','Pier 14','Pier 14',33.6947,-78.8751,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Pier 14','pier 14 restaurant in south carolina united states restaurant pier 14 is a restaurant lounge and fishing pier in myrtle beach south carolina sandwiched between a strip of hotels and the myrtle beach boardwalk and promenade the pier thrives on tourists and vacationers',datetime('now')),('Q16898461','Pine Tavern','Pine Tavern',44.06,-121.314,'US','restaurant',1936,16.17,'Pine Tavern','pine tavern restaurant in oregon united states restaurant the pine tavern is a restaurant in bend oregon united states opened in 1936 the restaurant is located in downtown bend and is one of the city''s best known landmarks',datetime('now')),('Q16898841','Print Hall','Print Hall',-31.955,115.855,'AU','restaurant',2012,12.0,'Print Hall','print hall restaurant in western australia australia restaurant print hall is a four-level bar restaurant at brookfield place in perth western australia opened in 2012 and housed in the former headquarters of perth''s daily newspaper the west australian it has been described by the new york times in 2014 as one of the city''s most celebrated new restaurants',datetime('now')),('Q16899043','Queensland Brewery Ltd','Queensland Brewery Ltd',-27.4609,153.037,'AU','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Queensland Brewery Ltd','queensland brewery ltd brewing company of australia brewery queensland brewery ltd was a company that operated a brewery in brisbane queensland australia',datetime('now')),('Q16899109','Ram Jam Inn','Ram Jam Inn',52.7328,-0.600556,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Ram Jam Inn','ram jam inn pub in greetham rutland england pub the ram jam inn was a historic pub in the civil parish of greetham rutland england located on the west side of the great north road now the a1 near stretton about 7 miles north of stamford the pub closed in august 2013 and it was eventually demolished in november 2022',datetime('now')),('Q16899253','Revival Bar and Kitchen','Revival Bar and Kitchen',37.871,-122.268,'US','restaurant',2010,12.0,'Revival Bar and Kitchen','revival bar and kitchen restaurant in california united states restaurant revival bar and kitchen is a farm-to-table eatery in berkeley california that specializes in local sustainable ethical food it first opened its doors in may 2010 with amy murray as owner and later taking over as executive chef in december 2011',datetime('now')),('Q16899347','Riverside Inn','Riverside Inn',45.0222,-85.7581,'US','pub|restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Riverside Inn (Leland, Michigan)','riverside inn inn in leland michigan restaurant inn the riverside inn is a restaurant and hotel located at 302 east river street in leland michigan it was listed on the national register of historic places in 2003',datetime('now')),('Q16899836','Schathoes Verhildersum','Schathoes Verhildersum',53.3622,6.3922,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Schathoes Verhildersum','schathoes verhildersum restaurant in leens netherlands restaurant italian cuisine french cuisine schathoes verhildersum was a restaurant in leens in the netherlands on the estate of verhildersum it was a fine dining restaurant that was awarded one michelin star in 2004 and retained that rating until 2012',datetime('now')),('Q16900357','Southland (jazz venue)','Southland (jazz venue)|Southland',42.35,-71.0661,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Southland (jazz venue)','southland jazz venue jazz club southland was a ballroom cafe on warrenton street in boston in the united states in what is now the charles playhouse originally a church converted into a club is best known for featuring prominent jazz artists of the 1930s and 1940s such as count basie most associated with the club duke ellington cab calloway jimmie lunceford and many others',datetime('now')),('Q16900580','St. Johns Twin Cinemas & Pub','St. Johns Twin Cinemas & Pub',45.5906,-122.756,'US','pub',1913,16.17,'St. Johns Twin Cinema','st johns twin cinemas & pub movie theater and pub in portland oregon united states pub movie theater the st johns twin cinema formerly known as the northgate theater and the st',datetime('now')),('Q16901506','The Colony (restaurant)','The Colony (restaurant)|殖民地|המושבה (מסעדה)',40.764722,-73.969722,'US','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'The Colony (restaurant)','the colony restaurant new york city restaurant defunct organization the colony was a restaurant in new york city known as a meeting place of café society it was founded in 1919 by joseph l pani who later sold it to a group of employees',datetime('now')),('Q16901513','The Meatball Shop','The Meatball Shop',40.7216,-73.9888,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'The Meatball Shop','the meatball shop restaurant in new york city restaurant the meatball shop was a new york city based restaurant owned and operated by native new yorkers daniel holzman and michael chernow who met as teenagers when they worked together as delivery boys at the new york vegan restaurant candle cafe',datetime('now')),('Q16901574','Thermidor','Thermidor|Sebico',51.2595,4.06386,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Thermidor (restaurant)','thermidor restaurant in hulst netherlands restaurant thermidor was restaurant in kapellebrug hulst in the netherlands it was a fine dining restaurant that was awarded one michelin star in 1973',datetime('now')),('Q16901620','Three Horseshoes','Three Horseshoes',51.5111,-0.37544,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Three Horseshoes, Southall','three horseshoes pub in southall london pub the three horseshoes was a public house at uxbridge road and south road at southall broadway southall london it was built between 1914 and 1922 construction was delayed by world war i by the architect nowell parr',d