rk a listed building since 1989 its facade overlooking the market place was fully restored in 1994',datetime('now')),('Q16974514','Domilise''s Restaurant','Domilise''s Restaurant',29.9175,-90.1124,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Domilise''s Restaurant','domilise''s restaurant restaurant in louisiana usa restaurant domilise''s po-boy and bar is an uptown new orleans restaurant known for its po-boy sandwiches the restaurant was founded in the 1930s by the domilise family who lived in the house above the single-room bar dining area and was run by sam and dorothy miss dot domilise for over seventy-five years until her death in 2013',datetime('now')),('Q16981621','Mama Campisi''s','Mama Campisi''s',38.61498,-90.27508,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Mama Campisi''s','mama campisi''s restaurant in mo usa restaurant mama campisi''s formerly oldani''s and commonly known as mama''s on the hill is a restaurant in st louis missouri which is located on the hill which is the little italy in that city and one of the premier sources of italian cuisine in the united states',datetime('now')),('Q16982313','Mr. B''s Bistro','Mr. B''s Bistro',29.95429,-90.06826,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Mr. B''s Bistro','mr b''s bistro restaurant in louisiana united states restaurant mr b''s bistro is a restaurant in new orleans louisiana united states',datetime('now')),('Q16982905','Gullifty''s','Gullifty''s',40.435303,-79.923034,'US','restaurant',1982,13.17,'Gullifty''s','gullifty''s restaurant in pittsburgh pennsylvania jazz club gullifty''s was a restaurant in pittsburgh pennsylvania it was a cross between a diner and a traditional restaurant serving fare described as american eclectic cuisine gullifty''s was a pittsburgh landmark known for its desserts',datetime('now')),('Q16984399','Birchwood Inn','Birchwood Inn',42.82,-71.851111,'US','pub',1892,16.17,'Birchwood Inn','birchwood inn inn in temple new hampshire united states tavern inn the birchwood inn is a historic tavern and inn on new hampshire route 45 in the center of temple new hampshire with a construction history dating to the early 19th century it is an architecturally important example of how traveler accommodations changed in rural new hampshire in the 19th century',datetime('now')),('Q16984453','Black Horse','Black Horse|Black Horse (Eastcote)',51.584442,-0.406851,'GB','pub',NULL,19.02,'Black Horse, Eastcote','black horse pub in eastcote london pub the black horse is a grade ii listed public house at high road eastcote in the london borough of hillingdon it was built in the early 19th century',datetime('now')),('Q16985637','Titanic Brewery','Titanic Brewery|鐵達尼啤酒廠',53.04544,-2.18883,'GB','brewery',1985,19.02,'Titanic Brewery','titanic brewery english brewery based in burslem stoke-on-trent staffordshire uk brewery business the titanic brewery is an independent producer of bottle conditioned and cask ales in burslem stoke-on-trent england titanic''s beers are generally notable for their light colour low malt and high hop content giving a very dry bitter taste although captain smith''s and some of their seasonal beers are dark and malty though still extremely hoppy',datetime('now')),('Q16985641','Bull and Gate','Bull and Gate',51.551755,-0.141613,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Bull & Gate','bull and gate grade ii listed pub in kentish town london pub the bull & gate is a grade ii listed public house and former music venue at 389 kentish town road kentish town london the pub had a long history as music venue with bands such as the pogues coldplay blur and suede playing there towards the start of their careers',datetime('now')),('Q16986257','Case is Altered','Case is Altered|Case is Altered (Eastcote)',51.588859,-0.403637,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'The Case is Altered, Eastcote','case is altered pub in eastcote london pub the case is altered is a grade ii listed public house at southill lane eastcote northwest london it dates from the 16th century',datetime('now')),('Q16986291','The Castle','The Castle',51.572089,-