ut shut down in february 1968 and reclaimed independence in 2013',datetime('now')),('Q16996807','Indeed Brewing Company','Indeed Brewing Company',45.0036,-93.2514,'US','brewery',NULL,13.17,'Indeed Brewing Company','indeed brewing company brewery indeed brewing company is a microbrewery located in the logan park neighborhood of northeast minneapolis it was founded in 2011 by friends thomas whisenand rachel anderson and nathan berndt',datetime('now')),('Q16997942','The Mitre','The Mitre',51.512362,-0.178496,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'The Mitre, Bayswater','the mitre pub in bayswater london pub the mitre is a grade ii listed public house at 24 craven terrace lancaster gate bayswater city of westminster it was built in the mid-19th century',datetime('now')),('Q16997944','The Mitre','The Mitre|The Mitre (Greenwich)',51.480156,-0.009723,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'The Mitre, Greenwich','the mitre pub in greenwich london pub the mitre is a grade ii listed public house at 291 greenwich high road greenwich london it was built around 1840',datetime('now')),('Q16998942','La Teresita','La Teresita',27.966389,-82.496528,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'La Teresita','la teresita restaurant in tampa florida restaurant cuban cuisine la teresita is a historic cuban cuisine restaurant with affiliated market and bakery in tampa florida in the west tampa region la teresita opened in 1972 as a market',datetime('now')),('Q17002248','Bent Paddle Brewing Company','Bent Paddle Brewing Company',46.7677,-92.122,'US','brewery',2013,12.0,'Bent Paddle Brewing Company','bent paddle brewing company brewery bent paddle brewing company is a microbrewery located in duluth minnesota in may 2013 their brewery and taproom opened to the public with distribution of kegs and cans in the duluth area beginning shortly thereafter',datetime('now')),('Q17006015','The Brazen Head','The Brazen Head|ブレイズン・ヘッド',53.344946,-6.276101,'IE','restaurant',1198,34.46,'The Brazen Head','the brazen head 18th century coaching inn in dublin ireland gastropub the brazen head is a pub in merchant''s quay dublin built as a coaching inn in 1754 on the site of a merchant''s dwelling dating back to at least 1613 lt received a licence to sell ale in 1661 and the first mention of it as an inn was in 1668',datetime('now')),('Q17013556','New Riverside Cafe','New Riverside Cafe',44.970306,-93.247,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'New Riverside Cafe','new riverside cafe coffeehouse and restaurant in minneapolis minnesota u s restaurant the new riverside cafe was a coffeehouse and vegetarian restaurant located near the university of minnesota in the west-bank neighborhood of minneapolis minnesota from 1970 to 1997 it became a center for political and social movements around revolutionary politics',datetime('now')),('Q17017445','Paxtons Head','Paxtons Head',51.5015,-0.16231,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'Paxtons Head','paxtons head pub in knightsbridge london pub paxtons head is a grade ii listed public house at 153 knightsbridge london it was built in 1900 02 by george dennis martin as part of the park mansions development',datetime('now')),('Q17018181','Prince Alfred','Prince Alfred',51.524439,-0.184837,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'Prince Alfred, Maida Vale','prince alfred pub in maida vale london england uk pub the prince alfred is a grade ii listed public house at 5a formosa street maida vale london w9 it was first listed as grade ii in 1970 and upgraded to grade ii in june 2022 for its lavish interior',datetime('now')),('Q17018369','Queen''s Head','Queen''s Head',51.545966,-0.480118,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Queen''s Head, Uxbridge','queen''s head pub in uxbridge london pub the queen''s head is a public house at 54 windsor street uxbridge london the grade ii listed building is constructed of brick and dates from the early-mid 19th century',datetime('now')),('Q17018729','Red Lion','Red Lion',51.534878,-0.461455,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Red Lion, Hillingdon','red lion pub in hillingdon london pub the red lion is a grade ii listed public house at royal lane hillingdon london according to english heritage it was probably built in the 16th century and the timber-framed building was refronted in about 1800',datetime('now')),('Q17018978','Louie Mueller Barbecue','Louie Mueller Barbecue',30.5688,-97.4111,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Louie Mueller Barbecue','louie mueller barbecue barbecue restaurant restaurant louie mueller barbecue is a barbecue restaurant in taylor texas called the epitome of texas barbecue by the new york times the restaurant focuses on beef brisket beef ribs hand made beef sausages pork ribs and other smoked meats',datetime('now')),('Q17019213','Rose and Crown','Rose and Crown|Rosa e Coroa (Isleworth)',51.477013,-0.328098,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'Rose and Crown, Isleworth','rose and crown pub in isleworth london pub the rose and crown is a grade ii listed public house at london road isleworth london it was built in the 18th century with 19th-century additions',datetime('now')),('Q17019322','Lucky Lou''s','Lucky Lou''s',33.2145,-97.1454,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Lucky Lou''s','lucky lou''s bar located in college town of denton texas restaurant lucky lou''s is a bar located in the college town of denton texas opened in 1996 lou''s established itself as popular bar in the area',datetime('now')),('Q17019358','Lutz Tavern','Lutz Tavern',45.47938,-122.61461,'US','restaurant',1947,16.17,'Lutz Tavern','lutz tavern bar in portland oregon restaurant lutz tavern is a bar in the woodstock neighborhood of portland oregon in the united states it was established by the lutz family in 1947 who maintained ownership until the business was purchased by the barisich family in 1954',datetime('now')),('Q17020007','Seven Balls','Seven Balls',51.610489,-0.330233,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Seven Balls','seven balls pub in harrow weald london pub the seven balls is a grade-ii-listed public house at kenton lane harrow weald london the timber-framed building is probably 17th century but with later additions',da