ead, Shrewsbury','the king''s head public house pub in shrewsbury shropshire england uk pub the king''s head is an old public house on the historic street mardol in shrewsbury shropshire england it was previously known as the last inn as it was the last inn in shrewsbury on the route out of town towards wales frankwell historically was a separate entity outside the borough of shrewsbury',datetime('now')),('Q17551332','Garrick Inn','Garrick Inn|ギャリック・イン',52.1918,-1.70728,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Garrick Inn','garrick inn pub in stratford-upon-avon pub the garrick inn is a pub in stratford-upon-avon in warwickshire england located at 25 high street next door to harvard house it is reputedly the oldest pub in the town',datetime('now')),('Q17553601','The Old White Hart Inn','The Old White Hart Inn',53.7431,-0.333643,'GB','pub|restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Ye Olde White Harte','the old white hart inn pub in hull east riding of yorkshire england uk restaurant pub ye olde white harte is a public house in hull england it was built around 1660 in the artisan mannerist style but did not become a pub until the 1730s',datetime('now')),('Q17553762','Boar''s Head Inn','Boar''s Head Inn',51.8711,0.157016,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Boar''s Head Inn, Bishop''s Stortford','boar''s head inn pub in bishop''s stortford hertfordshire england uk inn the boar''s head inn is a grade ii listed public house in bishop''s stortford hertfordshire england the timber framed building was built in the late 16th or early 17th century and substantially modified in the 18th and 19th centuries',datetime('now')),('Q17554471','The Holly Bush','The Holly Bush',51.6456,-0.297911,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Holly Bush, Elstree','the holly bush pub in elstree hertfordshire england uk pub the holly bush is a listed building formerly a public house on the high street elstree hertfordshire england elstree''s high street was formerly an important main road the a5 which followed the course of the roman road watling street',dat