taurant',NULL,13.17,'Buck''s of Woodside','buck''s of woodside famed silicon valley restaurant restaurant buck''s of woodside locally known as buck''s is a restaurant in woodside california that has gained fame as a meeting place for venture capitalists and tech entrepreneurs like nearby sand hill road buck''s has become a fixture of silicon valley',datetime('now')),('Q19866176','Coral Reef Restaurant','Coral Reef Restaurant',28.375278,-81.550278,'US','restaurant',1986,12.0,'Coral Reef Restaurant','coral reef restaurant restaurant in the seas pavilion theme restaurant seafood the coral reef restaurant is a themed seafood restaurant in the seas pavilion formerly the living seas pavilion on the western side of future world now renamed world nature at epcot a theme park at the walt disney world resort in bay lake florida that opened with the pavilion on january 15 1986 one entire wall of the restaurant consists of a glass window that is eight inches thick and that provides a view into an aquarium',datetime('now')),('Q19867093','Billy Sims Barbecue','Billy Sims Barbecue',36.10745,-95.97512,'US','restaurant',2004,12.0,'Billy Sims Barbecue','billy sims barbecue restaurant in oklahoma city-based united states restaurant billy sims bbq is an american restaurant chain founded by former professional football player billy sims and his business partner jeff jackson in 2004 sims and jackson opened the first billy sims bbq location in tulsa oklahoma',datetime('now')),('Q19867431','Haji Biriyani','Haji Biriyani',23.717876,90.407066,'BD','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'Haji biryani','haji biriyani restaurant in dhaka bangladesh restaurant biryani haji biryani also known as hajir biryani is one of the oldest restaurants in the heart of old dhaka bangladesh selling chevon biryani dish made with highly seasoned rice and goat''s meat the restaurant also sells borhani a salted mint drink made of yogurt and soft drinks',datetime('now')),('Q19867465','The Park''s Finest','The Park''s Finest',34.066523,-118.254199,'US','restaurant',2012,12.0,'The Park''s Finest','the park''s finest restaurant in california united states restaurant the park s finest is a filipino american inspired southern bbq restaurant in echo park los angeles which started as a small catering company in 2009 the owners of the restaurant johneric concordia christine araquel-concordia are echo park locals and long time friends who grew up in the neighborhood around historic filipinotown los angeles',datetime('now')),('Q19871385','ABC Commissary','ABC Commissary',28.356077,-81.560245,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'ABC Commissary','abc commissary quick service restaurant at disney''s hollywood studios fast food restaurant the abc commissary is a restaurant on commissary lane at disney''s hollywood studios one of the four main theme parks at walt disney world the restaurant has an art deco design',datetime('now')),('Q19871631','Broadway Hotel','Broadway Hotel',-27.4899,153.038,'AU','pub',NULL,13.17,'Broadway Hotel, Woolloongabba','broadway hotel historic pub building in woolloongabba queensland australia historic site pub broadway hotel is a heritage-listed hotel at 93 logan road woolloongabba city of brisbane queensland australia it was added to the queensland heritage register on 21 october 1992',datetime('now')),('Q1987425','De Struise brewers','De Struise brewers|De Struise Brouwers|brasseurs De Struise|cerveceros De Struise',50.931989,2.737572,'BE','brewery',2001,28.39,'De Struise Brouwers','de struise brewers brewing structure located in belgium brewery business enterprise de struise brouwers is a microbrewery located in oostvleteren belgium',datetime('now')),('Q19874482','Humpty Doo Hotel','Humpty Doo Hotel',-12.578604,131.128584,'AU','pub',1964,12.0,'Humpty Doo Hotel','humpty doo hotel pub in the northern territory australia pub the humpty doo hotel built in 1971 is believed to be one of northern territory''s longest continually licensed premises the humpty doo hotel is well known and features in several bush ballads including the man from humpty doo by ted egan and slim dusty''s humpty doo waltz',datetime('now')),('Q19876430','Ichimura at Brushstroke','Ichimura at Brushstroke',40.7681,-73.9819,'US','restaurant',2012,12.0,'Ichimura at Brushstroke','ichimura at brushstroke japanese sushi restaurant located on hudson st in manhattan new york city restaurant japanese cuisine brushstroke was a japanese kaiseki restaurant located on hudson street in manhattan new york city the owners of the restaurant were french chef david bouley and yoshiki tsuji who is president of tsuji culinary school in osaka japan',datetime('now')),('Q19876929','Peppermint Bay','Peppermint Bay',-43.16025,147.24059,'AU','restaurant',1994,12.0,'Peppermint Bay','peppermint bay restaurant simon currant am is a tourism developer in tasmania australia he has served as a director of tourism industry council tasmania and as a director of spirit of tasmania',datetime('now')),('Q19876974','Ceres Cafe','Ceres Cafe',41.878125,-87.63225,'US','cafe',NULL,12.0,'Ceres Cafe','ceres cafe diner café ceres cafe is a diner in the lobby of the chicago board of trade building it takes its name from the roman goddess ceres which is a statue on the top of the building',datetime('now')),('Q19877213','Power''s Brewery','Power''s Brewery',-27.7545,153.235,'AU','brewery',1988,12.0,'Yatala Brewery','power''s brewery brewery based in yatala in south east queensland australia brewery carlton & united breweries yatala formerly power''s brewery and commonly known as the yatala brewery is a brewery located at yatala in south east queensland it is the largest brewery in australia',datetime('now')),('Q19878147','Sushi Nakazawa','Sushi Nakazawa|寿司中澤',40.731781,-74.004489,'US','restaurant',2013,19.85,'Sushi Nakazawa','sushi nakazawa japanese restaurant in new york city united states sushi-ya sushi japanese cuisine sushi nakazawa is an upscale japanese sushi restaurant located on commerce street in manhattan the restaurant has been praised for its quality and preparation',datetime('now')),('Q19879782','Le Happy','Le Happy',45.53024,-122.68762,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Le Happy','le happy restaurant in portland oregon restaurant french cuisine le happy was a crêperie in sandy oregon united states previously the restaurant operated in northwest portland''s northwest district',datetime('now')),('Q19879898','Franklin Barbecue','Franklin Barbecue|富蘭克林燒烤|フランクリン・バーベキュー',30.270079,-97.731312,'US','restaurant',2009,13.17,'Franklin Barbecue','franklin barbecue barbecue restaurant restaurant franklin barbecue is a barbecue restaurant located in austin texas founded in 2009 by aaron franklin the restaurant has sold out of brisket every day since its establishment and has attracted a national following',datetime('now')),('Q19880295','Hollywood & Vine','Hollywood & Vine',28.357416,-81.559001,'US','restaurant',1989,12.0,'Hollywood & Vine (restaurant)','hollywood & vine restaurant at disney''s hollywood studios restaurant hollywood & vine formerly hollywood & vine cafeteria of the stars is a restaurant located next to the 50''s prime time café in disney''s hollywood studios one of the four main theme parks at walt disney world both beer and wine are served at hollywood & vine',datetime('now')),('Q19880772','Les Chefs de France','Les Chefs de France',28.368855,-81.55262,'US','restaurant',1982,12.0,'Les Chefs de France','les chefs de france restaurant at france pavilion at epcot restaurant french cuisine the france pavilion is a french-themed pavilion that is part of the world showcase within epcot at walt disney world in bay lake florida its location is between the morocco and united kingdom pavilions',datetime('now')),('Q19880991','Jester King Brewery','Jester King Brewery|ジェスター・キング醸造所',30.2308,-97.999764,'US','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Jester King Brewery','jester king brewery brewery brewery jester king is a craft brewery in austin texas that specializes in beer fermented with wild yeast it is set on a 40 acre ranch about 18 miles west of downtown austin',datetime('now')),('Q19881013','John''s Roast Pork','John''s Roast Pork|جونز روست بورك',39.9212,-75.1453,'US','restaurant',1930,22.02,'John''s Roast Pork','john''s roast pork restaurant in united states pennsylvania restaurant john''s roast pork is an italian roast pork and cheesesteak eatery in south philadelphia that was founded in 1930 at its original location on east snyder avenue in philadelphia just outside the pennsport and whitman neighborhoods the eatery is considered a favorite among south philadelphia locals and has gained mainstream recognition for its roast pork and cheesesteaks',datetime('now')),('Q19881102','Joseph Knoble Brewery','Joseph Knoble Brewery',35.3925,-94.4228,'US','brewery',1848,16.17,'Joseph Knoble Brewery','joseph knoble brewery brewery in fort smith united states of america brewery the joseph knoble brewery is a historic beer brewery building at north 3rd and e streets in fort smith arkansas built in the early 1850s it is a three-story stone building with an extension beside that originally housed a large beer vault',datetime('now')),('Q19887997','Spectrum','Spectrum',52.364622,4.896558,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Spectrum (Amsterdam)','spectrum restaurant in amsterdam the netherlands restaurant restaurant spectrum formerly librije''s zusje was a restaurant located in the waldorf astoria hotel in amsterdam netherlands it is a fine dining restaurant that is awarded two michelin star since 2015',datetime('now')),('Q19888006','Bord''Eau','Bord''Eau',52.367478,4.894101,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,12.0,NULL,'bord''eau restaurant french cuisine',datetime('now')),('Q19892978','Kualao Restaurant','Kualao Restaurant|Restaurant Kualao',17.9647,102.6105,'LA','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Kualao Restaurant','kualao restaurant restaurant of vientiane restaurant kualao restaurant is a lao restaurant in vientiane the capital city of laos it provides upscale lao cuisine and showcases traditional lao dance and music performances to its clientele',datetime('now')),('Q19893902','Pambiche Cocina and Repostería Cubana','Pambiche Cocina and Repostería Cubana',45.52663,-122.63698,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Pambiche Cocina and Repostería Cubana','pambiche cocina and repostería cubana cuban restaurant in portland oregon restaurant cuban cuisine pambiche cocina and repostería cubana or simply pambiche is a cuban restaurant located in northeast portland oregon united states',datetime('now')),('Q19893931','Amal Women''s Training Center and Moroccan Restaurant','Amal Women''s Training Center and Moroccan Restaurant|Association Amal pour les Arts culinaires en faveur des femmes nécessiteuses|Amal vrouwentrainingscentrum en vereniging voor culinaire kunsten|جمعية الامل لفنون الطبخ|Amal Center|아말 여성 훈련 센터 및 모로코 레스토랑',31.63895,-8.01376,'MA','restaurant',2013,38.34,'Amal Women''s Training Center and Moroccan Restaurant','amal women''s training center and moroccan restaurant marrakesh morocco restaurant nonprofit organization amal women''s training center and moroccan restaurant arabic جمعية الامل لفنون الطبخ french association amal pour les arts culinaires en faveur des femmes nécessiteuses is a non-profit organization in marrakesh morocco that helps disadvantaged women gain work experience by training them in the preparation of moroccan food and international food the center was established in 2012 by nora belahcen fitzgerald',datetime('now')),('Q19903377','L''Atelier de Joël Robuchon','L''Atelier de Joël Robuchon|ラトリエ ドゥ ジョエル・ロブション',35.6601,139.7294,'JP','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'L''Atelier de Joël Robuchon (Tokyo)','l''atelier de joël robuchon restaurant in tokyo japan french restaurant french cuisine l''atelier de joël robuchon is a michelin 1-star french restaurant located in minato tokyo japan the restaurant is part of the l''atelier de joël robuchon family of restaurants',datetime('now')),('Q19903572','Prince''s Hot Chicken Shack','Prince''s Hot Chicken Shack',36.043849