taurant',1975,34.07,'Moshulu','moshulu four-masted barque preserved watercraft sailing ship floating restaurant four-masted barque moshulu is a four-masted steel barque built as kurt by william hamilton and company at port glasgow in scotland in 1904 the largest remaining original windjammer she is currently a floating restaurant docked in penn''s landing philadelphia',datetime('now')),('Q20706977','New South Inn','New South Inn',34.6875,-91.308056,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'New South Inn','new south inn restaurant hotel the new south inn is a historic hotel building at 132-164 second street in clarendon arkansas built in about 1902 it is the only surviving historic hotel in the city and is notable for its well-preserved pressed metal facade',datetime('now')),('Q20709457','Dragonmead','Dragonmead',42.490908,-83.060446,'US','beer_hall|brewery',1997,12.0,'Dragonmead','dragonmead meadery microbrewery brewpub dragonmead is a u s microbrewery meadery and brewpub founded by earl scherbarth larry channell and bill wrobel in january 1997 the small brewery produces many varieties of beer wine and mead and has received awards including gold medals at the world beer cup',datetime('now')),('Q20709612','Tasty Tacos','Tasty Tacos',41.5938,-93.5978,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Tasty Tacos','tasty tacos fast-food chain based in des moines iowa restaurant mexican cuisine tasty tacos is a des moines iowa based mexican-inspired restaurant founded in 1961 by richard and antonia mosqueda it is family owned and operated and has six restaurants in the central iowa area',datetime('now')),('Q20710657','Irazu Costa Rica Restaurant','Irazu Costa Rica Restaurant|Irazu Costa Rican Restaurant',41.9155,-87.6851,'US','restaurant',1990,12.0,'Irazu Costa Rican Restaurant','irazu costa rica restaurant restraunt in chicago restaurant costa rican cuisine irazu costa rican restaurant is a latin american restaurant in chicago illinois that opened in 1990 it is located on milwaukee avenue in the bucktown wicker park neighborhood on chicago''s north side',datetime('now')),('Q20711345','Enterrium','Enterrium',42.045722,-88.034889,'US','restaurant',2015,12.0,'Enterrium','enterrium illinois restaurant based on pac-man restaurant enterrium formerly known as level 257 then pac-man entertainment is a contemporary american restaurant and video arcade located at woodfield mall in schaumburg illinois the restaurant and entertainment destination was originally inspired by pac-man and the name refers to the famous kill screen which occurs when the player reaches the 256th level of the original pac-man game meaning the next level of dining and entertainment',datetime('now')),('Q20711645','Cross Keys Inn','Cross Keys Inn',51.355539,-2.363653,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Cross Keys Inn, Odd Down','cross keys inn grade ii listed pub in combe down bath and north east somerset somerset england uk pub inn the cross keys inn is a pub-restaurant and former coaching inn trading since before 1750 on a corner of midford road in odd down bath somerset england it is a grade ii listed building',datetime('now')),('Q20711678','The Flora','The Flora',51.526973,-0.212736,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Flora','the flora building in london england pub the flora also known as the flora hotel is a pub at 525 harrow road kensal green london w10 it backs onto the grand union canal',datetime('now')),('Q20711704','Food for Thought','Food for Thought',51.514247,-0.125516,'GB','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Food for Thought (restaurant)','food for thought restaurant in london restaurant vegetarian cuisine food for thought was a vegetarian restaurant in the seven dials district of london''s covent garden founded in 1971 in a former banana warehouse it later closed in 2015 due to rising rents',datetime('now')),('Q20712633','Veritable Quandary','Veritable Quandary',45.51395,-122.67527,'US','restaurant',1971,13.17,'Veritable Quandary','veritable quandary restaurant in portland oregon restaurant veritable quandary sometimes abbreviated as v q or vq was a popular restaurant in downtown portland oregon united states it was established in 1971',datetime('now')),('Q20713706','Old White Horse Cellar','Old White Horse Cellar|オールド・ホワイト・ハウス・セラー|旧白马旅馆',51.507222,-0.141667,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Old White Horse Cellar','old white horse cellar historic inn in london england inn the old white horse cellar also known as hatchetts white horse cellar at no 155 piccadilly was one of the best-known coaching inns in england during the 18th and 19th centuries',datetime('now')),('Q20713981','Scott''s','Scott''s|史考茲',51.5099,-0.1508,'GB','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Scott''s (restaurant)','scott''s london seafood restaurant active since the mid-19th century restaurant scott''s is a seafood restaurant at 20 mount street mayfair london originating as scott''s oyster rooms in haymarket in the 1850s or earlier it would become scott''s oyster and supper rooms on coventry street in 1891 and moved to its present location in mount street in 1967',datetime('now')),('Q20714224','Ye Olde Murenger House','Ye Olde Murenger House',51.5889,-2.9962,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Ye Olde Murenger House','ye olde murenger house grade ii listed pub in the united kingdom pub ye olde murenger house is a 19th-century pub with a mock tudor front on high street newport wales it replaced a 17th-century pub the fleur de lys on the same site',datetime('now')),('Q20714336','Hell''s Backbone Grill','Hell''s Backbone Grill',37.902456,-111.423916,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Hell''s Backbone Grill','hell''s backbone grill restaurant in boulder utah restaurant hell''s backbone grill is a restaurant located in boulder utah near the grand staircase escalante national monument the restaurant serves a style of four corners cuisine an updated combination of cowboy classics mormon recipes and traditional southwestern fare',datetime('now')),('Q20714568','Leonard''s Bakery','Leonard''s Bakery|Leonard’s Bakery',21.2849,-157.8133,'US','restaurant',1952,28.39,'Leonard''s Bakery','leonard''s bakery portuguese bakery in honolulu founded in 1952 restaurant leonard''s bakery is a portuguese bakery in honolulu hawaii known for popularizing the malasada the fried pastry slightly crispier and chewier than a doughnut and with no hole is known as a cuisine of hawaii',datetime('now')),('Q20714881','Pig & Calf Lunch','Pig & Calf Lunch',35.080833,-106.6225,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Pig & Calf Lunch','pig & calf lunch restaurant in new mexico united states of america restaurant the pig & calf lunch also known as the pig stand cafe is a historic building in albuquerque new mexico it is notable as a largely original example of mid-1930s commercial architecture',datetime('now')),('Q20722017','Hostellerie du Dauphin','Hostellerie du Dauphin|hôtellerie du Dauphin',49.5645,3.62281,'FR','pub',NULL,13.17,NULL,'hostellerie du dauphin inn',datetime('now'));
