co district of london it was built in 1845 to refresh prison warders serving at the millbank penitentiary',datetime('now')),('Q20878189','Old Crown Inn','Old Crown Inn',51.86691,-2.24942,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'Old Crown Inn','old crown inn pub in gloucester gloucestershire england uk pub the old crown inn was a grade ii listed pub house at 81 and 83 westgate street gloucester the pub closed in early 2024',datetime('now')),('Q20886954','Black Horse','Black Horse',52.411929,-1.973556,'GB','pub',1930,16.17,'Black Horse, Northfield','black horse public house in northfield birmingham england pub the black horse is a grade ii listed public house in northfield birmingham england the building had its grade-ii heritage status upgraded to ii in august 2015',datetime('now')),('Q20895283','La Mère Poulard','La Mère Poulard',48.635,-1.511111,'FR','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'La Mère Poulard','la mère poulard restaurant in mont-saint-michel france restaurant hotel la mère poulard is a restaurant and hotel on mont saint-michel the restaurant dates back to 1879 and is known for the wall of autographs from over a century of famous diners including ernest hemingway and yves saint laurent',datetime('now')),('Q20908817','Café de Madrid','Café de Madrid',40.416897,-3.7005,'ES','cafe',NULL,13.17,NULL,'café de madrid café',datetime('now')),('Q20908858','Bar Los Gabrieles','Bar Los Gabrieles',40.415622,-3.699606,'ES','bar|restaurant',NULL,12.0,NULL,'bar los gabrieles restaurant bar tablao',datetime('now')),('Q20908859','Café Barbieri','Café Barbieri',40.409297,-3.700986,'ES','cafe',1902,15.0,NULL,'café barbieri café',datetime('now')),('Q20940810','Ochsen (Engen)','Ochsen (Engen)|Gasthaus zum Ochsen (Engen)',47.851593,8.770702,'DE','pub',NULL,13.17,NULL,'ochsen engen building in engen germany residential building gasthaus',datetime('now')),('Q20968932','The Little Shamrock','The Little Shamrock',37.765717,-122.466719,'US','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Little Shamrock','the little shamrock historic pub 