treet ipswich suffolk england it closed on 18 september 1960',datetime('now')),('Q26533345','The Arden Arms','The Arden Arms',53.41196,-2.155079,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Arden Arms','the arden arms grade ii listed pub in stockport greater manchester england uk pub the arden arms is a grade ii listed public house on the corner of millgate and corporation street in stockport greater manchester england built around 1815 it stands on a site with a long history of pub use with an inn recorded here in 1709 under the name ye blew stoops which was already considered old at the time',datetime('now')),('Q26533440','Town Hall  Town Hall Hotel','Town Hall  Town Hall Hotel',54.402713,-1.737444,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Richmond Town Hall, North Yorkshire','town hall town hall hotel town hall and hotel in richmond richmondshire north yorkshire england uk pub city hall hotel richmond town hall is a municipal building in the market place richmond north yorkshire england the structure which is the meeting place of richmond town council is a grade ii listed building',datetime('now')),('Q26533568','The White Lion Hotel','The White Lion Hotel',53.411398,-2.158507,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'White Lion, Underbank','the white lion hotel grade ii listed pub in stockport greater manchester england uk pub the white lion officially listed as the white lion hotel is a grade ii listed public house on great underbank in the underbank area of stockport greater manchester england the site has been occupied by a licensed inn since 1490 and successive buildings were altered and rebuilt',datetime('now')),('Q26534587','George and Dragon','George and Dragon',53.395079,-2.21326,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'George and Dragon, Cheadle','george and dragon pub in cheadle greater manchester england uk pub hotel the george and dragon officially listed as the george and dragon hotel is a grade ii listed public house on high street in cheadle a suburban village within the metropolitan borough of stockport greater manchester e