1731,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Cemetery Hotel','cemetery hotel public house pub in rochdale greater manchester england uk pub the cemetery hotel is a grade ii listed public house on bury road in rochdale greater manchester england thought to date from the 1860s and named after the nearby rochdale cemetery it retains a notably intact historic interior shaped in part by an early 20th century refit and recognised by the campaign for real ale camra with a three star rating for outstanding national historic importance',datetime('now')),('Q26673990','The Oliver Public House','The Oliver Public House',51.383559,-2.360196,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'1 Broad Street, Bath','the oliver public house pub in bath and north east somerset somerset england uk pub 1 broad street is a historic building in bath somerset england standing at 1 broad street at broad street''s junction with green street the building was completed in the late 18th century',datetime('now')),('Q26675104','The Old Green Tree Public House','The Old Green Tree Public House',51.383379,-2.360224,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Old Green Tree','the old green tree public house pub in bath and north east somerset somerset england uk pub the old green tree is a public house on green street in bath somerset england grade ii listed the building dates to the 1716 and was extended to the rear in 1926',datetime('now')),('Q26675493','The Volunteer Hotel','The Volunteer Hotel',53.428448,-2.322431,'GB','pub',1897,16.17,'The Volunteer, Sale','the volunteer hotel hotel in trafford greater manchester england uk pub hotel the volunteer is a grade ii listed public house on cross street in sale a town within trafford greater manchester england built in 1897 as the volunteer hotel for chesters brewery it replaced an earlier pub on the same site whose name had changed from the white lion to the volunteer in the early 19th century',datetime('now')),('Q26675586','Coach & Horses Public House, 350 Eccles New Road, Salford','Coach & Horses Public Hous