ablished by clifton and alma washington at 35 n kentucky avenue atlantic city in 1937 the original 20-seat location attained celebrity status for hosting the performers and patrons of the nightclubs in t',datetime('now')),('Q2684279','De Koninck Brewery','De Koninck Brewery|Brouwerij De Koninck|De Koninck|Brasserie De Koninck',51.199667,4.414933,'BE','brewery',1833,31.39,'De Koninck Brewery','de koninck brewery belgian brewery brewery de koninck brewery brouwerij de koninck is a belgian brewery founded in 1833 and based in antwerp the glass in which de koninck''s flagship beer is served is called a bolleke although this term is most colloquially used to refer to a glass filled with the beer itself and is the way the beer is ordered in bars',datetime('now')),('Q2685662','Brouwerij Loterbol','Brouwerij Loterbol|Brasserie Loterbol',50.987812,5.054223,'BE','brewery',NULL,19.85,NULL,'brouwerij loterbol brewery',datetime('now')),('Q268795','Café Museum','Café Museum|Καφέ Μουζέουμ|café museum|カフェ・ムゼウム',48.201435,16.367667,'AT','cafe',1899,37.07,'Café Museum','café museum building in innere stadt austria viennese coffee house café museum is a traditional viennese café located in the innere stadt first district in vienna the café opened in 1899',datetime('now')),('Q26882586','Seventh Avenue South (jazz club)','Seventh Avenue South (jazz club)|Seventh Avenue South|セブンス・アベニュー・サウス (ジャズ・クラブ)',40.730472,-74.003861,'US','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Seventh Avenue South (jazz club)','seventh avenue south jazz club jazz club in new york city united states 1977 1987 jazz club seventh avenue south was a jazz club in new york city it existed from 1977 to 1987',datetime('now')),('Q26882947','Regattabar','Regattabar',42.372203,-71.122894,'US','restaurant',1985,12.0,NULL,'regattabar jazz club in cambridge massachusetts jazz club',datetime('now')),('Q26883700','Lettonie','Lettonie',51.3901,-2.4005,'GB','restaurant',1988,12.0,'Lettonie (restaurant)','lettonie restaurant owned and run by chef martin blunos restaurant french cuisine lettonie was a restaurant owned and run by chef martin blunos it was located in bristol until 1998 when it relocated to bath somerset it was awarded a michelin star in 1992 and a second in 1994 these were held until the restaurant was closed in 2001',datetime('now')),('Q2689313','Pico brewery Alvinne','Pico brewery Alvinne|Brouwerij Alvinne|Pico brasserie Alvinne|Pico cervecería Alvinne',50.850233,3.229492,'BE','brewery',2003,24.64,'Alvinne','pico brewery alvinne brewing structure located in belgium brewery alvinne is a small brewery in the hamlet of moen near the belgian city of zwevegem founded in 2002 the brewery creates a range of beers including versions of ''traditional'' belgian styles such as strong golden ales abbey-style beers and saison as well as original creations that cross stylistic boundaries and beers inspired by styles from outside their home country like imperial stout',datetime('now')),('Q2690074','Soigné','Soigné',52.274483,5.164594,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Soigné','soigné restaurant in bussum netherlands restaurant restaurant soigné is a restaurant in bussum netherlands it is a fine dining restaurant that was awarded one michelin star in 2010 and has retained that rating until the present',datetime('now')),('Q26939385','The Yellow Rose of Texas','The Yellow Rose of Texas',-3.750003,-73.244064,'PE','restaurant',NULL,12.0,NULL,'the yellow rose of texas restaurant in ciudad de iquitos peru restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q2693970','Falkenkrug','Falkenkrug',51.932,8.8977,'DE','brewery',NULL,13.17,NULL,'falkenkrug building in germany brewery',datetime('now')),('Q269481','Café Prückel','Café Prückel',48.2076,16.3804,'AT','cafe',NULL,24.64,NULL,'café prückel café in vienna austria viennese coffee house',datetime('now')),('Q2698315','Gasthaus Magdeburger Hof','Gasthaus Magdeburger Hof',51.7902,11.1601,'DE','pub',NULL,12.0,NULL,'gasthaus magdeburger hof inn in quedlinburg germany gasthaus',datetime('now')),('Q27062790','Restaurant Andrew Fairlie','Restaurant Andrew Fairlie|Andrew Fairlie at Gleneagles',56.2832,-3.752,'GB','restaurant',2001,19.85,'Restaurant Andrew Fairlie','restaurant andrew fairlie restaurant in the gleneagles hotel restaurant french cuisine british cuisine restaurant andrew fairlie also known as andrew fairlie at gleneagles is a restaurant serving british cuisine located within the gleneagles hotel near auchterarder perth and kinross scotland in operation since 2001 it was run by chef andrew fairlie alongside his head chef stephen mclaughlin who took over the kitchen after his death',datetime('now')),('Q27070653','De Schakel','De Schakel',52.364889,4.882639,NULL,'bar',NULL,12.0,NULL,'de schakel gay bar in amsterdam gay bar gentlemen''s club',datetime('now')),('Q27080326','The Castle Public House','The Castle Public House',51.52027,-0.10422,'GB','pub',1867,16.17,'The Castle, Farringdon','the castle public house pub in islington london england uk pub the castle is a grade ii listed public house at 34-35 cowcross street farringdon london a public house of this name has existed on this site since at least the 18th century as elizabeth soane the wife of sir john soane was born at an earlier pub of the same name on the same site in 1760',datetime('now')),('Q27080720','Ship and Shovell','Ship and Shovell',51.50767,-0.124758,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Ship and Shovell','ship and shovell pub in charing cross london pub the ship and shovell is a victorian pub in craven passage charing cross london it may be unique for consisting of two separate buildings on either side of a street connected underground by a shared cellar',datetime('now')),('Q27080908','The Greyhound','The Greyhound',51.501093,-0.189304,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'The Greyhound, Kensington','the greyhound pub in kensington london pub the greyhound is a pub at 1 kensington square kensington london w8 it is a grade ii listed building built in about 1899',datetime('now')),('Q27080979','Markham Arms Public House','Markham Arms Public House',51.489584,-0.163918,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Markham Arms, Chelsea','markham arms public house building in kensington and chelsea london england uk pub the markham arms is a former pub at 138 king''s road london sw3 it closed as a pub in the early 1990s and is now a branch of the santander bank',datetime('now')),('Q27081433','Kettner''s Restaurant','Kettner''s Restaurant',51.513157,-0.130601,'GB','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Kettner''s Townhouse','kettner''s restaurant restaurant in westminster london england uk restaurant kettner''s townhouse is a restaurant in london dating from 1867 it is one of the oldest restaurants in the city',datetime('now')),('Q27082283','The Crown','The Crown',51.451177,-0.318565,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Crown, Twickenham','the crown pub in twickenham london pub the crown is a pub at 174 richmond road twickenham london tw1 it is a grade ii listed building dating back to the late 18th century',datetime('now'));
