as an important community space',datetime('now')),('Q27087166','The George','The George',51.51765,-0.141888,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The George, Fitzrovia','the george pub in fitzrovia london pub the george is a grade ii listed public house on the corner of mortimer street and great portland street in the city of westminster london according to historic england it has an italianate façade from the 1860s and a more ornate frontage than typical of a pub of its age',datetime('now')),('Q27087707','The Cheshire Cheese','The Cheshire Cheese',51.512433,-0.113197,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Cheshire Cheese','the cheshire cheese pub in essex street strand london pub the cheshire cheese is a public house at 5 little essex street london wc2 on the corner with milford lane it is a grade ii listed building rebuilt in 1928 by nowell parr on the site of an earlier pub for the style & winch brewery',datetime('now')),('Q27121635','5-8 Club','5-8 Club|نادي 8-5 (مطعم)',44.89771,-93.247894,'US','restaurant',1928,31.39,'5-8 Club','5-8 club restaurant in minneapolis minnesota restaurant cuisine of the united states the 5-8 club tavern & grill is a restaurant in minneapolis minnesota founded in 1928 as a speakeasy the eatery is one of two minneapolis establishments that claim to have invented the juicy lucy cheeseburger in the 1950s the other being matt''s bar',datetime('now')),('Q27136461','Tiny Rebel','Tiny Rebel',51.590399,-3.054051,'GB','brewery',2008,13.17,'Tiny Rebel','tiny rebel brewery based in rogerstone newport wales brewery tiny rebel is a craft brewery in rogerstone newport wales',datetime('now')),('Q27165298','Yoshino Shuzo','Yoshino Shuzo|吉野酒造',35.15425,140.24875,'JP','brewery',1830,16.17,NULL,'yoshino shuzo sake brewery in chiba prefecture japan sake brewery business',datetime('now')),('Q2724860','Katseveer','Katseveer',51.53976,3.87007,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Katseveer','katseveer restaurant in wilhelminadorp netherlands restaurant katseveer is a restaurant in wilhelmin