 of the battle of waterloo 18 june 1815 there are two plaques on the building one is in memory of the french medical corps who attended the wounded with devotion on 18 june 1815 and the other commemorates the meeting of the two victorious field marshals at the end of the battle of waterloo',datetime('now')),('Q28949044','Loď Pivovar','Loď Pivovar',50.093458,14.426536,'CZ','brewery',NULL,13.17,NULL,'loď pivovar czech restaurant ship and brewery ship brewery',datetime('now')),('Q2895279','Ben''s Chili Bowl','Ben''s Chili Bowl|벤스 칠리 볼|เบนส์ชิลีโบวล์|本氏辣酱热狗店',38.91716,-77.02877,'US','restaurant',NULL,38.34,'Ben''s Chili Bowl','ben''s chili bowl restaurant in washington d c originally a movie theater restaurant movie theater cuisine of the united states ben''s chili bowl is a restaurant in washington d c united states located at 1213 u street next to lincoln theatre in the u street corridor also known as the cardozo shaw neighborhood in northwest d c it is known locally for its chili dogs half-smokes and milkshakes and has been part of the u street neighborhood since its founding in 1958 it was frequented by both police and protesters during the 1968 washington d c riots and has been visited by celebrities such as anth',datetime('now')),('Q2896230','Taillevent','Taillevent|טיוואן|タイユヴァン (レストラン)|戴優豐',48.8741,2.30246,'FR','restaurant',1946,27.64,'Taillevent (restaurant)','taillevent restaurant in paris france restaurant taillevent is a restaurant in paris founded in 1946 by andré vrinat and now owned by the gardinier family',datetime('now')),('Q2896854','Le Grand Véfour','Le Grand Véfour|לה גראן ופור|威孚大酒店|ル・グラン・ヴェフール',48.8661,2.3379,'FR','restaurant',NULL,36.34,'Le Grand Véfour','le grand véfour restaurant in france restaurant le grand véfour french lə ɡʁɑ vefuʁ the first grand restaurant in paris france was opened in the arcades of the palais-royal in 1784 by antoine aubertot as the café de chartres and was purchased in 1820 by jean véfour who was able to retire within three years selling the restaurant to jean boissier a list of regular customers over the last two centuries includes most of the heavyweights of french culture and politics e g',datetime('now')),('Q2900985','Fook Lam Moon','Fook Lam Moon|福臨門',22.2769,114.171,'CN','restaurant',1948,31.39,'Fook Lam Moon','fook lam moon restaurant in hong kong restaurant cantonese cuisine fook lam moon chinese 福臨門 is a chinese restaurant chain with its main and original branch at 35-45 johnston road wanchai hong kong fook lam moon means fortune and blessings come to your home the restaurant is often dubbed the cafeteria for the wealthy chinese 富豪飯堂 by the media',datetime('now')),('Q29018403','birth house of Antonín Dvořák','birth house of Antonín Dvořák|geboortehuis van Antonín Dvořák|Antonín Dvořák Geburthaus|rodný dům Antonína Dvořáka|Antonín Dvořáks fødehjem|Tempat lahir Antonín Dvořák|בית הולדתו של אנטונין דבוז''אק',50.262456,14.301478,'CZ','pub',NULL,24.64,NULL,'birth house of antonín dvořák house in nelahozeves czech republic butcher shop birth house museum building inn',datetime('now')),('Q29034340','KOKS','KOKS|Koks',62.136667,-7.021945,'FO','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'KOKS (restaurant)','koks restaurant in the faroe islands restaurant koks is a restaurant located in leynavatn faroe islands it is 24 km north of tórshavn and 23 km east of vágar airport',datetime('now')),('Q2904140','Sloppy Joe''s','Sloppy Joe''s|סלופי ג''וז|Sloppy Joe''s Bar',24.558889,-81.805,'US','bar',NULL,34.07,'Sloppy Joe''s','sloppy joe''s historic bar in key west florida bar sloppy joe''s bar is a historic american bar in key west florida located at the corner of greene and duval street since 1937 a frequent haunt of famous writer ernest hemingway it is now home to the annual hemingway days celebration and its hemingway look-alike contest',datetime('now')),('Q29046898','Schiller','Schiller',52.365583,4.896417,NULL,'bar',NULL,12.0,NULL,'schiller bar in amsterdam netherlands bar',datetime('now')),('Q29048050','