ry founded in 1990 by bernard lancelot located on the site of a gold mine in roc-saint-andré in morbihan it produces seven top-fermented unfiltered naturally-produced and unpasteurised beers named after figures from the history and literature of brittany',datetime('now')),('Q2924032','brasserie Tri Martolod','brasserie Tri Martolod',47.901075,-3.905902,'FR','brewery',NULL,12.0,NULL,'brasserie tri martolod brewery',datetime('now')),('Q2924043','Brasserie Goudale','Brasserie Goudale|brasserie de Gayant',50.732846,2.322489,'FR','brewery',2006,28.39,NULL,'brasserie goudale brewery organization',datetime('now')),('Q2924044','Brasserie de Saint-Omer','Brasserie de Saint-Omer|brasserie de Saint-Omer',50.7555,2.254,'FR','brewery',1866,31.39,'Brasserie de Saint-Omer','brasserie de saint-omer french brewery brewery brasserie de saint-omer is a french brewery in saint-omer in the pas-de-calais department situated in the nord-pas-de-calais region it is one of the two big breweries left in the nord-pas-de-calais',datetime('now')),('Q2924047','Brasserie de Saint-Sylvestre','Brasserie de Saint-Sylvestre|brasserie de Saint-Sylvestre',50.777917,2.552206,'FR','brewery',NULL,24.64,'Brasserie de Saint-Sylvestre','brasserie de saint-sylvestre brewery in france brewery the brasserie de saint sylvestre is a brewery in the nord-pas de calais region of northeast france brewing in the town of saint-sylvestre-cappel dates back to at least 1600 although the troubled history of flanders has interrupted business several times',datetime('now')),('Q29270924','old bakery Liberec','old bakery Liberec|Dělnická pekárna v Liberci|Alte Bäckerei in Liberec',50.757239,15.042937,'CZ','bakery',1901,16.17,NULL,'old bakery liberec bread factory in the czech republic bakery',datetime('now')),('Q2927192','Bryce Inn','Bryce Inn',37.63224,-112.165086,'US','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'Bryce Inn','bryce inn bryce canyon utah listed on the nrhp in utah restaurant the bryce inn also known as the bryce general store in br