x cafe in paris france restaurant the café de la paix french pronunciation kafe d ə la pɛ is a famous café located on the northwest corner of the intersection of the boulevard des capucines and the place de l''opéra in the 9th arrondissement of paris france designed in the napoleon iii style by the architect alfred armand who also designed the historic grand hôtel in which the café is located its florid interior decorations historic location and high-profile clientele have all brought it international recognition as a site of great cultural significance',datetime('now')),('Q2933012','Café du Monde','Café du Monde|世界咖啡馆|カフェデュモンド',29.9575,-90.0618,'US','restaurant',1862,39.34,'Café du Monde','café du monde new orleans café famous for its beignets restaurant coffee café du monde french for ''café of the world'' or ''the people''s café'' is an open-air coffee shop located on decatur street in the french quarter of new orleans louisiana united states it is a new orleans landmark and tourist destination known for its café au lait and beignets',datetime('now')),('Q29345652','Real Posada','Real Posada',37.673895,-4.931454,'ES','pub',1769,16.17,NULL,'real posada building in córdoba province spain inn',datetime('now')),('Q2940236','Brouwerij Van Bogaert','Brouwerij Van Bogaert',51.09784,4.131766,'BE','brewery',NULL,12.0,NULL,'brouwerij van bogaert brewery in hamme belgium brewery',datetime('now'));
INSERT INTO institutions VALUES ('Q2940758','Casa Marieta','Casa Marieta',41.9858,2.823289,'ES','restaurant',NULL,24.0,'Casa Marieta','casa marieta restaurant in girona restaurant the restaurant casa marieta is a centenary establishment recognized by the círculo de restaurantes centenarios de españa located in independence square girona also well-known as sant agustí square because formerly the convent of sant agustí had been raised there the present name is given by the war of 1808 against napoleon bonaparte war of spanish independence',datetime('now')),('Q2941354','Castel Marie-Louise','Castel Marie-Louise',47.281449,-2.407658,'FR','restaurant',NULL,13.17,NULL,'castel marie-louise restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q2943276','Caveau du Soleil d''or','Caveau du Soleil d''or|カヴォー・デュ・ソレイユ・ドール',48.853546,2.344638,'FR','cafe',NULL,12.0,NULL,'caveau du soleil d''or café',datetime('now')),('Q29467956','The Chickenburger','The Chickenburger',44.73155,-63.65723,'CA','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'The Chickenburger','the chickenburger canadian drive-in diner restaurant the chickenburger is a bedford highway roadside landmark located in bedford nova scotia that is reputed to be the oldest drive-in diner in canada',datetime('now')),('Q29469159','Deer Head Inn','Deer Head Inn',40.983015,-75.140738,'US','pub',NULL,12.0,'Deer Head Inn','deer head inn jazz club and inn in delaware water gap pennsylvania usa jazz club inn the deer head inn is a jazz club and inn located in delaware water gap pennsylvania established in the nineteenth century the deer head inn became the after hours artistic home for jazz musicians who worked in the pocono mountain resorts in the mid-twentieth century',datetime('now')),('Q29469163','Liuquanju','Liuquanju|柳泉居',39.932494,116.366914,'CN','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Liuquanju','liuquanju restaurant in beijing china restaurant liuquanju founded in 1567 is one of the oldest restaurants in beijing china the name translated from chinese means willow spring house and historic documents noted there was a big willow tree in the courtyard',datetime('now')),('Q29481920','Wynnstay Arms Public House','Wynnstay Arms Public House',52.986839,-3.039289,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'Wynnstay Arms Hotel, Ruabon','wynnstay arms public house grade ii listed pub in ruabon wrexham county borough wales pub the wynnstay arms is a hotel and public house in ruabon wales the grade ii listed building dates from the 18th-century and was a coaching inn',datetime('now')),('Q29482037','43 High Street','43 High Street',53.044899,-2.993035,'GB','pub',NULL,12.0,NULL,'43 high street building in wrexham wales pub',datetime('now')),('Q29482041','The Nags Head Inn','The Nags Head Inn',53.043931,-2.991483,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'Nags Head, Wrexham','the nags head inn pub in wrexham wales pub the nags head also spelled nag''s head is a historic pub on mount street in wrexham city centre north wales the current frontage dates to a 19th-century remodelling under the soames family',datetime('now')),('Q29482083','Nos.12-13 (The Golden Lion Public House), High Street (N Side)','Nos.12-13 (The Golden Lion Public House), High Street (N Side)',53.045201,-2.992106,'GB','pub',NULL,12.0,NULL,'nos 12-13 the golden lion public house high street n side pub in wrexham wales pub',datetime('now')),('Q29482084','The Midland','The Midland',53.045232,-2.991865,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'The Midland, Wrexham','the midland pub in wrexham wales pub the midland is a pub housed in a historic former bank building in wrexham city centre wales located at the eastern end of wrexham''s high street it opened in 1912 as the midland bank which purchased the original client the north and south wales bank a few years prior to construction',datetime('now')),('Q29482086','Talbot Inn','Talbot Inn',53.045988,-2.993737,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'The Talbot, Wrexham','talbot inn pub in wrexham wales pub the talbot is a former pub and hotel in wrexham city centre north wales it was built and opened by 1905 replacing an older inn also known as the talbot or the talbot inn',datetime('now')),('Q29482937','Hanbury Arms','Hanbury Arms',51.608485,-2.951929,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'Hanbury Arms','hanbury arms pub in caerleon newport wales pub the hanbury arms is a public house in caerleon near newport wales in the 19th century alfred lord tennyson stayed at the inn and began writing the idylls of the king during his stay',datetime('now')),('Q29491753','Jackson Hall','Jackson Hall',51.479258,-3.180687,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Jackson Hall, Cardiff','jackson hall building in cardiff wales pub jackson hall is a grade ii listed building on westgate street in central cardiff wales it was designed by john prichard and george robinson and built in 1878',datetime('now')),('Q29495260','Pant-yr-Ochain','Pant-yr-Ochain',53.073618,-2.977456,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Pant-yr-Ochain','pant-yr-ochain grade ii listed pub in gresford wales pub house hotel pant-yr-ochain is a historic country house and public house near gresford wrexham in north wales the grade ii listed building is located in hilly terrain north-east of wrexham next to a series of shallow lakes which also takes its name',datetime('now')),('Q29495599','Hayes Island Snack Bar','Hayes Island Snack Bar',51.479861,-3.176866,'GB','bar',NULL,13.17,'Hayes Island Snack Bar','hayes island snack bar snack bar in cardiff wales snack bar hayes island snack bar is located on the hayes in the centre of cardiff wales it was built as a parcel depot for cardiff corporation tramways in 1911',datetime('now')),('Q29525035','Former Gasthaus Roter Ochsen','Former Gasthaus Roter Ochsen|Ehemaliges Gasthaus Roter Ochsen',47.65931,8.8593,'CH','pub',NULL,13.17,'Rother Ochsen','former gasthaus roter ochsen building with wall painting and bay window in stein am rhein in the canton of schaffhausen switzerland oriel window wall painting gasthaus built structure the gasthaus zum rothen ochsen lit ''guesthouse of the red ox'' is the oldest tavern in the historic center of stein am rhein in the eastern part of the canton of schaffhausen switzerland founded in 1446 it is considered one of the most beautiful wine cellars in switzerland and the facade is decorated with mural paintings',datetime('now')),('Q29526924','Gasthaus zum Trauben, Weinfelden','Gasthaus zum Trauben, Weinfelden|Gasthaus Zum Trauben',47.568278,9.1099,'CH','pub',NULL,13.17,NULL,'gasthaus zum trauben weinfelden hotel in weinfelden switzerland gasthaus built structure',datetime('now')),('Q29561172','The Olde Angel Inn','The Olde Angel Inn',43.25496,-79.07278,'CA','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Olde Angel Inn','the olde angel inn restaurant in ontario canada pub british cuisine the olde angel inn is a historic pub on regent street in the heart of niagara-on-the-lake ontario the inn is said to be haunted by captain colin swayze the resident ghost',datetime('now')),('Q29561685','Sel Gris','Sel Gris',51.3441,3.2564,'BE','restaurant',NULL,12.0,NULL,'sel gris restaurant in belgium restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q29575879','Zum Roten Bären, Brugg','Zum Roten Bären, Brugg|Zum Roten Bären',47.4855,8.20724,'CH','pub',NULL,13.17,NULL,'zum roten bären brugg inn in brugg in the canton of aargau zurich gasthaus built structure',datetime('now')),('Q29581575','former Bären Inn','former Bären Inn|Ehemaliger Gasthof Bären',47.477405,8.226792,'CH','pub',1636,16.17,NULL,'former bären inn building in windisch in the canton of aargau switzerland building built structure inn',datetime('now')),('Q29581794','Gasthaus "Zum Goldenen Ochsen"','Gasthaus "Zum Goldenen Ochsen"',47.29037,7.94395,'CH','pub',1607,16.17,NULL,'gasthaus zum goldenen ochsen building in zofingen in the canton of aargau switzerland building gasthaus built structure',datetime('now')),('Q29582620','A former tavern "Beli medved" Zemun','A former tavern "Beli medved" Zemun',44.845981,20.408145,'RS','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'White Bear Tavern','a former tavern beli medved zemun kafana in belgrade kafana white bear tavern serbian кафана бели медвед