u hawaii the restaurant contains a collection of artwork that includes a lithograph series by pablo picasso',datetime('now')),('Q303690','Aass Brewery','Aass Brewery|Aass Bryggeri',59.7413,10.2109,'NO','brewery',1834,34.02,'Aass Brewery','aass brewery norway''s oldest brewery brewery aass brewery norwegian aass bryggeri is norway''s oldest brewery still active founded in 1834 in drammen norway the brewery''s primary products are beer and aquavit',datetime('now')),('Q3038887','Aneth','Aneth',51.2118,3.2113,'BE','restaurant',NULL,12.0,NULL,'aneth restaurant restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q3040039','Drouant','Drouant|ドルーアン|德魯昂|Друан|드루앙',48.8688,2.33439,'FR','restaurant',1880,39.34,'Drouant','drouant famous restaurant in paris founded in 1880 restaurant french cuisine drouant french pronunciation dʁuɑ is a well-known restaurant located in the palais garnier neighborhood in the 2nd arrondissement of paris france it was founded in 1880 by charles drouant',datetime('now')),('Q3041361','Dunn''s','Dunn''s|Dunn''s Famous|Dunn''s Famous Deli and Steakhouse|ダンズ',45.500557,-73.57177,'CA','restaurant',1927,22.85,'Dunn''s','dunn''s restaurant in montreal restaurant dunn''s famous deli and steakhouse is a chain of jewish delis serving montreal-style smoked meat pastrami and cheesecake founded in montreal quebec canada by myer dunn the chain currently has five locations in and around montreal',datetime('now')),('Q3048853','?','?|Kawiarnia "?"|Taverne « ? »|Kafana ?|Taberna ?|Кофейня «?»',44.8177,20.4525,'RS','restaurant',1823,50.07,'? (bistro)','tavern in belgrade serbia kafana immovable cultural heritage of great importance serbian cyrillic кафана кафана знак питања кафана упитник serbian kafana kafana znak pitanja kafana upitnik is the oldest still operational traditional tavern kafana in belgrade serbia located at 6 kralja petra street the building is nearly 200 years old',datetime('now')),('Q30527700','Tmol Shilshom','Tmol Shilshom|תמול שלשום',31.781412,35.219794,'IL','cafe',19