ted states its location is between the germany pavilion and the american adventure',datetime('now')),('Q30592870','Hotel Lilie','Hotel Lilie',46.896864,11.432148,'IT','pub',NULL,13.17,'Hotel Lilie','hotel lilie hotel in sterzing south tyrol hotel inn hotel lilie is a traditional inn located in historical center of sterzing south tyrol italy the first written record about it is from 1461 the hotel worked as an inn since its origin and today it is one of the most beautiful buildings of the late middle ages and is protected by the state as a treasure of fine arts',datetime('now')),('Q3059290','Brouwerij Concordia','Brouwerij Concordia',50.76749,3.873297,'BE','brewery',NULL,12.0,NULL,'brouwerij concordia brewery',datetime('now')),('Q30595894','Heihachi Jaya','Heihachi Jaya|山ばな 平八茶屋',35.054028,135.791083,'JP','restaurant',1576,16.17,'Heihachi Jaya','heihachi jaya ryokan with japanese restaurant in sakyo ward kyoto city art gallery ryokan japanese restaurant japanese cuisine heihachi jaya is one of the oldest restaurants in japan founded in 1576 and located on the bank of takano river in kyoto city kyoto prefecture the restaurant was included in famous literary works and kyogens traditional comical theatre plays',datetime('now')),('Q30598089','White Horse Inn','White Horse Inn',37.852094,-122.266079,'US','bar',NULL,12.0,'White Horse Inn (Oakland, California)','white horse inn restaurant in california united states gay bar the white horse inn is a gay bar located at 6551 telegraph avenue in oakland''s bushrod park neighborhood it officially opened in 1933 but is rumored to have operated as a gay speakeasy since before the end of prohibition',datetime('now')),('Q30599793','La Couronne','La Couronne|La Couronne (restaurante)',49.442778,1.087778,'FR','restaurant',1345,27.64,'La Couronne (restaurant)','la couronne restaurant in rouen france restaurant la couronne established in 1345 is considered the oldest inn in france it is located on the place du vieux-marché in rouen the capital of normandy',datetime('now')),('Q30600105','Monastery inn','Monastery inn|Klostergasthof',47.973508,11.183519,'DE','pub',NULL,13.17,'Andechs (restaurant)','monastery inn building in andechs upper bavaria germany monastery inn monastery klostergasthof andechs is a monastery restaurant in andechs abbey bavaria germany in the middle of 15th century duke albrecht iii donated this most worthy of inns to the newly founded benedictine abbey at andechs',datetime('now')),('Q30600276','Kindli','Kindli',47.37236,8.54055,'CH','restaurant',1474,22.02,'Kindli (hotel)','kindli hotel and restaurant in zurich restaurant kindli haus zum kindli is a historic building and inn located at pfalzgasse 1 and strehlgasse 24 in the old town of zurich switzerland in the lindenhof quarter near bahnhofstrasse it is among the oldest documented houses in zurich associated with hospitality and has been attested in historical sources since the late middle ages',datetime('now')),('Q30603957','Brae','Brae',-38.347,143.807,'AU','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Brae (restaurant)','brae restaurant in victoria australia restaurant brae is a restaurant in birregurra victoria australia it was previously the site of sunnybrae diane garrett and george biron''s home restaurant and cooking school that they ran from 1981 till 2013',datetime('now'));
