oathouse seafood restaurant in seattle washington restaurant ray''s boathouse is a restaurant in the ballard neighborhood of seattle washington united states located on shilshole bay along the puget sound shoreline it is noted for its seafood and views of puget sound and the olympic mountains and has been listed as one of the city''s top restaurants alongside the herbfarm',datetime('now')),('Q30625437','Ore Dock Brewing Company','Ore Dock Brewing Company',46.541789,-87.393944,'US','brewery',2012,13.17,'Ore Dock Brewing Company','ore dock brewing company microbrewery in the upper peninsula of michigan brewery the ore dock brewing company is a craft brewery in marquette michigan that opened in may 2012 named for a nearby local landmark the brewery is known for being a marquette focal point and tourist destination in the words of historian russell magnaghi',datetime('now')),('Q30626218','Brew Detroit','Brew Detroit',42.327659,-83.061773,'US','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Brew Detroit','brew detroit american brewery brewery brew detroit was a contract brewery operating in detroit michigan the company also produced small-batch craft beers',datetime('now')),('Q30635669','Gasthof Herold','Gasthof Herold',49.794306,11.509445,'DE','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Gasthof Herold','gasthof herold brewery in büchenbach bavaria germany brewery gasthof herold is one of the oldest breweries in büchenbach bavaria germany founded in 1568 since the foundation it is a family business today managed by johann und matthias herold and the annual production is about 1200 hl',datetime('now')),('Q30638707','Exmoor Ales','Exmoor Ales',51.043267,-3.307875,NULL,'brewery',NULL,12.0,'Exmoor Ales','exmoor ales microbrewery based in wiveliscombe somerset microbrewery company exmoor ales is a microbrewery based in wiveliscombe somerset england the brewery was previously called golden hill brewery',datetime('now')),('Q30638768','BrewDog','BrewDog',50.824548,-0.135485,'GB','pub',2010,13.17,'The Blind Tiger Club, Brighton'