ue in liverpool united kingdom it was known for serving vegan food and its association with the city''s diy punk music scene',datetime('now')),('Q48815906','Spiaggia','Spiaggia',41.900556,-87.624722,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Spiaggia','spiaggia italian restaurant in chicago restaurant italian cuisine spiaggia was an italian restaurant in chicago on michigan avenue at oak street after 37 years on the magnificent mile spiaggia closed permanently having never reopened following its covid-19 closure in march 2020',datetime('now')),('Q48816144','Everest','Everest',41.876,-87.6322,'US','restaurant',1986,19.02,'Everest (restaurant)','everest french restaurant in chicago united states french restaurant french cuisine everest was a french restaurant run by jean joho in chicago for over 30 years first opened in october 1986 it was located on the 40th floor of 425 south financial place and served alsatian cuisine',datetime('now')),('Q48816428','Oriole','Oriole',41.886167,-87.645167,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Oriole (restaurant)','oriole restaurant in chicago restaurant oriole is a restaurant in west loop chicago it has earned two michelin stars among a small group of chicago restaurants to do so',datetime('now')),('Q48816966','The Waiters Restaurant','The Waiters Restaurant',-37.81207,144.97235,'AU','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'The Waiters Restaurant','the waiters restaurant italian restaurant in melbourne restaurant italian cuisine the waiter''s restaurant is an italian restaurant in melbourne australia described as a melbourne institution founded in 1947 as the italian waiter''s club it was initially a place for waiters mainly of italian and spanish heritage to have a meal a drink and play cards after their work in breach of the very strict liquor licensing laws in place at the time',datetime('now')),('Q48818119','Lower Bell','Lower Bell',51.318056,0.507778,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Lower Bell','lower bell pub in kent england pub hotel the lower bell is a pub and hotel on the a