datetime('now')),('Q4890919','Beppi''s Restaurant','Beppi''s Restaurant',-33.8754,151.214,'AU','restaurant',1956,12.0,'Beppi''s Restaurant','beppi''s restaurant italian restaurant in sydney australia restaurant italian cuisine beppi''s italian restaurant is an australian restaurant that was established on 12 july 1956 in sydney specializing in italian cuisine and founded by italian-born chef beppi polese and his wife norma who owned and ran the establishment with their family including son marc polese the restaurant is world famous having served prime ministers hollywood stars rock royalty and the elite',datetime('now')),('Q4894563','Bernstein''s Fish Grotto','Bernstein''s Fish Grotto',37.7859,-122.408,'US','restaurant',1912,15.0,'Bernstein''s Fish Grotto','bernstein''s fish grotto restaurant in san francisco california restaurant bernstein''s fish grotto was a popular restaurant in san francisco california that operated from 1912 to 1981',datetime('now')),('Q4894670','Berowra Waters Inn','Berowra Waters Inn|貝羅拉沃特斯餐廳|פונדק בארורה ווטרס',-33.5954,151.122,'AU','restaurant',NULL,27.86,'Berowra Waters Inn','berowra waters inn restaurant north of sydney australia restaurant french cuisine berowra waters inn is a restaurant owned and run by head chef brian geraghty located at berowra waters along berowra creek a tributary of the hawkesbury river near ku-ring-gai chase national park 50 minutes from downtown sydney australia it is unique due to its being accessed only by private ferry or airplane as well as being one of pritzker prize-winning australian architect glenn murcutt''s only venues regularly open to the public',datetime('now')),('Q48949050','Pavilion No. 35 Tobacco at the VDNKh','Pavilion No. 35 Tobacco at the VDNKh|Павильон № 35 «Табак» на ВДНХ',55.83833,37.61417,'RU','restaurant',1954,13.17,NULL,'pavilion no 35 tobacco at the vdnkh pavilion at the vdnkh in moscow restaurant architectural landmark',datetime('now')),('Q48949058','Pavilion No. 311 Sericulture at th