rk hangout for players coaches and fans of the houston astros during spring training in nearby osceola county stadium and year-round for employees of the walt disney world resort it was located at 4849 w irlo bronson highway kissimmee fl 34746',datetime('now')),('Q4906421','Big Spring Cafe','Big Spring Cafe',34.7205,-86.6048,'US','restaurant',1928,15.0,'Big Spring Cafe','big spring cafe a diner in huntsville alabama diner diner big spring cafe is a diner in huntsville alabama it opened in 1922 and is the oldest restaurant in the city',datetime('now')),('Q49099931','Bloom In The Park','Bloom In The Park',55.590556,12.996944,'SE','restaurant',NULL,12.0,NULL,'bloom in the park building in malmö skåne county sweden restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q4911400','The Wilson House','The Wilson House|Bill Wilson House|Bill Wilson house',43.239444,-73.009167,'US','pub',1987,19.85,'Bill Wilson House','the wilson house birthplace of bill wilson in east dorset vermont us place of birth national historic landmark inn house the bill wilson house is a historic 19th-century hotel at 378 village street in east dorset vermont united states built in 1852 it is the birthplace and living memorial of alcoholics anonymous co-founder bill wilson',datetime('now')),('Q4913308','Billy Simpson''s House of Seafood and Steaks','Billy Simpson''s House of Seafood and Steaks',38.938056,-77.024167,'US','restaurant',1923,15.0,'Billy Simpson''s House of Seafood and Steaks','billy simpson''s house of seafood and steaks restaurant commercial building billy simpson''s house of seafood and steaks also known as the ebony table kushner''s sea food grill minoux bakery harry c johnson & son or the kaieteur was a restaurant on georgia avenue in the northwest area of washington d c it was listed on the national register of historic places on march 17 2009 it is notable for the role it played in the social and political culture of the district of columbia''s african american community',datetime('now')),('Q4915659','Birch Hall Inn','Birch Hall Inn',54.408824,-0.735287,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Birch Hall Inn','birch hall inn pub in beck hole in the north york moors england pub the birch hall inn is a grade ii listed public house on beck hole road in beck hole a village in the north york moors england founded around 1860 it is noted for its small bars and shop and interior and is popular with hiking tourists on holiday in the area',datetime('now')),('Q491736','Brauerei Anderten','Brauerei Anderten|Anderter Brauerei',52.363498,9.856979,'DE','brewery',NULL,13.17,NULL,'brauerei anderten architectural structure brewery',datetime('now')),('Q4920422','Black Boy Inn','Black Boy Inn|ブラックボーイ・イン',53.141133,-4.275999,'GB','pub',NULL,24.64,'Black Boy Inn','black boy inn hotel and public house in caernarfon gwynedd wales pub hotel inn the black boy inn or just black boy is a hotel and public house in the royal town of caernarfon in gwynedd wales which is thought to date back to 1522 making it one of the oldest surviving inns in north wales it is within the medieval walls of caernarfon a few hundred yards from caernarfon castle',datetime('now')),('Q4920501','Black Castle Public House','Black Castle Public House|Black Castle|Black Kalesi',51.443333,-2.560833,'GB','pub',1745,22.85,'Black Castle, Bristol','black castle public house grade i listed pub in bristol united kingdom pub folly black castle public house is a grade i-listed building and public house on junction road in the brislington suburb of the english city of bristol it is also known as arno''s castle',datetime('now')),('Q4920507','Black Cat Bar','Black Cat Bar',37.7958,-122.403,'US','bar',NULL,24.0,'Black Cat Bar','black cat bar bar in san francisco california bar the black cat bar or black cat café was a bar in san francisco california it originally opened in 1906 and closed in 1921',datetime('now')),('Q4921226','Van Den Bossche brewery','Van Den Bossche brewery|Brouwerij Van Den Bossche|brasserie Van Den Bossche',50.8564,3.884,'BE','brewery',NULL,19.85,NULL,'van den bossche brewery brewery',datetime('now')),('Q4921966','Black Swan Hotel','Black Swan Hotel',51.3532,-1.99638,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Black Swan Hotel, Devizes','black swan hotel hotel in devizes wiltshire england uk pub hotel inn the black swan hotel is a traditional inn and hotel in devizes wiltshire england overlooking the market place on the a360 road the inn was built in 1737',datetime('now')),('Q4923611','Sirocco','Sirocco|시로코|ซีรอคโค',13.721111,100.5175,'TH','restaurant',NULL,24.0,'Sirocco (restaurant)','sirocco restaurant in bangkok thailand restaurant lebua bangkok is a luxury hotel located in at state tower adjacent to the chao phraya river on silom road in the bang rak district of bangkok thailand the hotel is managed by lebua hotels & resorts a thai hospitality company that operates hotels restaurants and bars in thailand india and new zealand',datetime('now')),('Q4928134','Bloom''s restaurant','Bloom''s restaurant',51.5739,-0.201111,'GB','restaurant',1920,15.0,'Bloom''s restaurant','bloom''s restaurant england''s longest-standing kosher restaurant restaurant ashkenazi jews bloom''s restaurant was a kosher jewish deli restaurant in london until its last branch closed in summer 2010 it was the longest-standing kosher restaurant in england and was well-known beyond the jewish community',datetime('now')),('Q4928862','Blue Bayou Restaurant','Blue Bayou Restaurant|ブルーバイユー・レストラン',33.811122,-117.920993,'US','restaurant',1967,19.85,'Blue Bayou Restaurant','blue bayou restaurant restaurant in new orleans square in disneyland restaurant cajun cuisine blue bayou is a full-service chain of new orleans cajun-style restaurants located at disneyland in anaheim california and tokyo disneyland in chiba japan',datetime('now'));
