ant me mu danish restaurant restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q49301731','Restaurant Jordnær','Restaurant Jordnær',55.74812,12.54127,'DK','restaurant',2017,12.0,NULL,'restaurant jordnær restaurant in gentofte north of copenhagen restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q4930227','Blueberry Hill','Blueberry Hill|蓝莓山餐厅',38.6558,-90.305,'US','restaurant',1972,12.0,'Blueberry Hill (restaurant)','blueberry hill restaurant in missouri united states restaurant blueberry hill is a restaurant and music club located in the delmar loop neighborhood in university city a suburb of st louis missouri',datetime('now')),('Q4930444','Blues Alley','Blues Alley',38.9047,-77.0623,'US','restaurant',NULL,24.64,'Blues Alley','blues alley american jazz nightclub in the georgetown neighborhood of washington d c jazz club blues alley founded in 1965 is a jazz nightclub in the georgetown neighborhood of washington d c it is the oldest continuing jazz supper club in the united states known as the house that dizzy built the 125-seat venue was opened by musician tommy gwaltney',datetime('now')),('Q4931264','Boar''s Head Inn','Boar''s Head Inn|ボアーズヘッド亭|Boar’s Head Inn|野豬頭旅館',51.510669,-0.083828,'GB','pub',NULL,31.02,'Boar''s Head Inn','boar''s head inn pub in the united kingdom pub wikimedia list article the boar''s head inn is the name of several former and current taverns in london most famously a tavern in eastcheap that is supposedly the meeting place of sir john falstaff prince hal and other characters in shakespeare''s henry iv plays an earlier tavern in southwark used the same name and an inn of the name in whitechapel was used as a theatre',datetime('now')),('Q4931577','Bob''s Big Boy','Bob''s Big Boy|ボブズ・ビッグボーイ',34.1524,-118.3462,'US','restaurant',1949,16.17,'Bob''s Big Boy','bob''s big boy american fast-food restaurant restaurant building bob''s big boy is a casual dining restaurant chain founded by bob wian in southern california in 1936 originally named bob''s pantry the chain''s signature product is the big boy hamburger which wian created six months after opening his original location',datetime('now')),('Q49321022','Zeisigwaldschänke','Zeisigwaldschänke|Gasthof „Zeisigwaldschänke“',50.845585,12.963437,'DE','pub',1899,16.17,NULL,'zeisigwaldschänke cultural heritage monument in chemnitz-hilbersdorf saxony germany historic building gasthaus',datetime('now')),('Q49336651','Gasthaus „Krone“','Gasthaus „Krone“|Ehemaliges Gasthaus „Krone“',50.832005,12.949628,'DE','pub',1887,15.0,NULL,'gasthaus krone cultural heritage monument in chemnitz-sonnnenberg saxony germany gasthaus',datetime('now')),('Q4936456','Bodegas López de Heredia','Bodegas López de Heredia|ボデガス・ロペス・デ・エレディア|Bodegas López de Heredia Viña Tondonia|Bodegas R. López de Heredia',42.584735,-2.847604,'ES','bar',1877,16.17,'Bodegas López de Heredia','bodegas lópez de heredia spanish winery wine bar bodegas lópez de heredia is a spanish winery located in the rioja region founded in 1877 the estate owns around 420 acres of vineyards and produces 25 000 cases of wine annually',datetime('now')),('Q4938090','Bohemian Cafe','Bohemian Cafe',41.2453,-95.9336,'US','restaurant',1924,15.0,'Bohemian Cafe','bohemian cafe restaurant in nebraska u s a restaurant the bohemian cafe was located at 1406 south 13th street in the historic little bohemia neighborhood of omaha nebraska established in 1924 the cafe sat next to the prague hotel',datetime('now')),('Q4938092','Bohemian Caverns','Bohemian Caverns',38.9172,-77.0268,'US','restaurant',1926,22.02,'Bohemian Caverns','bohemian caverns american restaurant and jazz nightclub restaurant jazz club the bohemian caverns founded in 1926 was a restaurant and jazz nightclub located on the ne corner of the intersection of 11th street and u street nw in washington d c the club started out as club caverns - a small establishment in the basement of a drugstore - famous for its floor and variety shows the club was frequented by many of washington''s elite at the time who would come to see such musical artists as duke ellington and cab calloway',datetime('now')),('Q4938093','Bohemian Citizens'' Benevolent Society','Bohemian Citizens'' Benevolent Society',40.772778,-73.916389,'US','beer_hall|restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Bohemian Citizens'' Benevolent Society','bohemian citizens'' benevolent society queens new york restaurant social club beer garden the bohemian citizens'' benevolent society is a private benevolent society founded in 1892 in astoria queens to support czech and slovak immigrants to the area as well as people of czech and slovak ancestry the society is commonly known as bohemian hall after its clubhouse which is listed on the national register of historic places',datetime('now')),('Q4938375','Boiling Springs Tavern','Boiling Springs Tavern',40.1502,-77.1286,'US','restaurant',1832,16.17,'Boiling Springs Tavern','boiling springs tavern restaurant in pennsylvania united states restaurant cuisine of the united states the boiling springs tavern was a restaurant located in boiling springs pennsylvania the boiling springs tavern was built in 1832 by philip brechbill in the federal style with native limestone and originally was used as a hotel',datetime('now')),('Q49403869','Stadtbrauerei Wittichenau; Brauerei mit Schornstein Haschkestraße 33','Stadtbrauerei Wittichenau; Brauerei mit Schornstein Haschkestraße 33',51.38373,14.245089,'DE','brewery',1900,15.0,NULL,'stadtbrauerei wittichenau brauerei mit schornstein haschkestraße 33 brewery',datetime('now')),('Q4942787','Booches','Booches',38.95017,-92.32741,'US','restaurant',1884,16.17,'Booches','booches bar and restaurant in columbia missouri u s restaurant booches is a bar restaurant and pool hall on 9th street in downtown columbia missouri established in 1884 it is the oldest pool hall in columbia',datetime('now')),('Q4943819','Boot Inn, Chester','Boot Inn, Chester',53.1905,-2.8908,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Boot Inn, Chester','boot inn chester pub in cheshire england uk pub the boot inn is at 17 eastgate street and 9 eastgate row chester cheshire england it is recorded in the national heritage list for england as a designated grade ii listed building',datetime('now')),('Q494438','Café Hawelka','Café Hawelka|Гавелка (кафе)|café Hawelka|哈维卡咖啡馆',48.2079,16.3694,'AT','cafe',1939,47.62,'Café Hawelka','café hawelka coffee house in vienna austria viennese coffee house café hawelka german kaˈfeː ˈhaːvelka is a traditional viennese café located at dorotheergasse 6 in the innere stadt the first district of vienna austria',datetime('now')),('Q49473403','Paragon Cafe','Paragon Cafe',-33.71392,150.31133,'AU','restaurant',1916,16.17,'Paragon Cafe, Katoomba','paragon cafe tea-room confectionery and ballroom in katoomba australia restaurant the paragon cafe is a heritage-listed restaurant located at 65 katoomba street katoomba new south wales australia it was designed in successive stages by harry & ernest sidgreaves shopfitters architects harry lindsay blackwood and george newton kenworthy with decoration by otto steen and built from 1909 to 1940',datetime('now')),('Q49477131','Casa De Tableta','Casa De Tableta',37.382222,-122.193889,'US','beer_hall|restaurant',NULL,19.85,'Casa de Tableta','casa de tableta historical building in san mateo county california united states of america restaurant casino western saloon beer garden casa de tableta now known as the alpine inn and formerly known as rossotti''s saloon and zott''s was built c 1851 in portola valley california at the junction of arastradero road it was listed as a california historical landmark in 1969 and on the national register of historic places in 1973',datetime('now')),('Q4949638','Boulevard Diner','Boulevard Diner',42.264806,-71.787167,'US','restaurant',1936,22.85,'Boulevard Diner','boulevard diner diner in worcester massachusetts united states restaurant the boulevard diner is a historic diner at 155 shrewsbury street in worcester massachusetts it was built by worcester lunch car company in 1936 as 730',datetime('now')),('Q4949688','Bouley','Bouley|בולה (מסעדה)',40.717,-74.009,'US','restaurant',2008,12.0,'Bouley','bouley restaurant in tribeca new york city restaurant french cuisine bouley was a contemporary french restaurant located at 163 duane street between greenwich street and hudson street in tribeca in manhattan in new york city david bouley was its owner and chef',datetime('now')),('Q4950408','Boustan','Boustan|مطاعم بستان',45.4982,-73.5778,'CA','restaurant',1986,19.85,'Boustan','boustan fast-food chain from montreal restaurant lebanese cuisine boustan is a lebanese-canadian fast food restaurant chain in montreal quebec it was established in 1986',datetime('now')),('Q4955299','Braeburn Lodge','Braeburn Lodge',61.4844,-135.776,'CA','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Braeburn Lodge','braeburn lodge roadhouse on the klondike highway in the yukon territory of canada roadhouse braeburn lodge is a roadhouse on the klondike highway in yukon canada it is located east of braeburn lake and north of braeburn mountain on the path of the former dawson overland trail which was built in 1902 between whitehorse and dawson city',datetime('now')),('Q4957927','Brasserie Julien','Brasserie Julien',40.7754,-73.9567,'US','restaurant',1999,12.0,'Brasserie Julien','brasserie julien american restaurant in new york city united states jazz club french cuisine brasserie julien was a brasserie-style french cuisine restaurant located at 1422 third avenue between east 80th street and east 81st street on the upper east side of manhattan in new york city as well as a jazz club the establishment closed at the end of 2012',datetime('now')),('Q4957928','Brasserie Les Halles','Brasserie Les Halles|בראסרי לה האל',40.7436,-73.9837,'US','restaurant',1990,24.64,'Brasserie Les Halles','brasserie les halles restaurant with locations in new york city restaurant french cuisine brasserie les halles was a french-brasserie-style restaurant originally located on park avenue in manhattan new york city other locations were on john street in manhattan in tokyo miami and washington d c author and television host anthony bourdain worked there as executive chef',datetime('now')),('Q4959455','Breakfast Creek Hotel','Breakfast Creek Hotel',-27.4408,153.045,'AU','pub',NULL,13.17,'Breakfast Creek Hotel','breakfast creek hotel historic site in queensland australia pub breakfast creek hotel is a heritage-listed hotel at 2 kingsford smith drive albion city of brisbane queensland australia it was designed by simkin & ibler and built in 1889 to 1890 by thomas woollam & william norman',datetime('now')),('Q4960433','Breitbach''s Country Dining','Breitbach''s Country Dining',42.638,-90.8683,'US','restaurant',1852,16.17,'Breitbach''s Country Dining','breitbach''s country dining historic restaurant in iowa restaurant breitbach''s country dining is a casual dining restaurant and bar located in the town of balltown in dubuque county iowa united states breitbach''s is the oldest continuously operating restaurant and bar in the state of iowa having been open since august 23 1852',datetime('now')),('Q4962694','Brewery Shades','Brewery Shades',51.115698,-0.189737,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Brewery Shades','brewery shades pub in crawley west sussex england uk pub the brewery shades inn is a public house on the high street in crawley a town and borough in west sussex england the building which stands on a corner site at the point where the town''s ancient high street meets the commercial developments of the postwar new town has been altered and extended several times but at its centre is a 15th-century timber-framed open hall-house of a type common in the crawley area in the middle ages',datetime('now')),('Q4966208','Bridge Cafe','Bridge Cafe|ブリッジ・カフェ',40.7087,-74.0008,'US','restaurant',1794,22.85,'Bridge Cafe','bridge cafe restaurant in united states new york restaurant bridge cafe was a historic restaurant and bar located at 279 water street in the south street seaport area of manhattan new york city united states the site was originally home to a grocery and wine and porter bottler opened in 1794 and has been home to a series of drinking and eating establishments',datetime('now')),('Q4974859','Brooklyn Ice Cream Factory','Brooklyn Ice Cream Factory|브루클린 아이스크림 팩터리|ブルックリン・アイス・クリーム・ファクトリー',40.702719,-73.9945,'US','restaurant',2001,19.85,'Brooklyn Ice Cream Factory','brooklyn ice cream factory ice cream shop in brooklyn new york restaurant the brooklyn ice cream factory is an ice cream shop in brooklyn new york city its original location was a converted 1922 fireboat house at 1 water street on the fulton ferry landing pier in the dumbo neighborhood near the brooklyn bridge',datetime('now')),('Q4975664','Brothers Cider','Brothers Cider',51.191389,-2.551111,'GB','brewery',1992,13.17,'Brothers Cider','brothers cider cider brewery in the uk brewery company brothers cider is a brand of fruit cider originating in somerset in south west england originally available at music festivals it is now sold in pubs bars and stores across the united kingdom and internationally in countries such as thailand singapore and china',datetime('now')),('Q4975867','Broussard''s','Broussard''s',29.9566,-90.0682,'US','restaurant',1920,22.85,'Broussard''s','broussard''s restaurant in louisiana united states restaurant french cuisine broussard''s along with galatoire''s antoine''s and arnaud''s is one of the four classic creole new orleans restaurants known as the grand dames broussard''s first opened in 1920 when an eminent local chef joseph broussard married rosalie borrello and the couple moved into the borrello family mansion built in 1834 at 819 conti street in the french quarter where the restaurant now sits',datetime('now')),('Q4975922','Brown''s Brewery','Brown''s Brewery',39.288333,-76.604445,'US','brewery',1783,15.0,'Brown''s Brewery','brown''s brewery brewery located on east lombard street in baltimore maryland us brewery brown''s brewery was a brewery located on east lombard street in baltimore maryland in 1813 mary pickersgill sewed the famous star spangled banner flag in one of its malthouses',datetime('now')),('Q4975947','Brown''s Hotel','Brown''s Hotel',51.771124,-4.462257,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Brown''s Hotel, Laugharne','brown''s hotel hotel in laugharne carmarthenshire wales uk pub hotel brown''s hotel is a guesthouse and pub in laugharne carmarthenshire wales it is a grade ii listed building and is known for being the favourite pub of the poet and writer dylan thomas',datetime('now')),('Q4978902','Bruneau by Maxime Maziers','Bruneau by Maxime Maziers',50.867583,4.322728,'BE','restaurant',1975,24.0,'Bruneau (restaurant)','bruneau by maxime maziers restaurant in belgium restaurant french cuisine bruneau was a restaurant in brussels belgium which has garnered a michelin star as well as an 18 20 rating from gault-millau the chef was jean-pierre bruneau 74 years old in 2017',datetime('now'));
INSERT INTO institutions VALUES ('Q4980544','Bryant-Lake Bowl','Bryant-Lake Bowl',44.9485,-93.2901,'US','bar|restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Bryant-Lake Bowl','bryant-lake bowl bowling alley restaurant bar and theatre in minnesota restaurant gay bar theatre building bowling alley bryant-lake bowl locally nicknamed blb is a bowling alley restaurant bar and 90-seat theatre in uptown minneapolis minnesota best known for its evening entertainment and cheap date night specials two meals drinks and a round of bowling for 28 blb is also a reliable brunch stop',datetime('now')),('Q4980769','Bryggeriet Vestfyen','Bryggeriet Vestfyen',55.2634,9.905,'DK','brewery',1885,22.85,'Bryggeriet Vestfyen A/S','bryggeriet vestfyen danish brewery brewery bryggeriet vestfyen a s is a danish beverage company established in 1885',datetime('now')),('Q4980771','Bryghuset Møn','Bryghuset Møn',54.9828,12.285,'DK','brewery',2005,19.85,'Bryghuset Møn','bryghuset møn microbrewery bryghuset møn is a micro-brewery in the town of stege on the danish island of møn bryghuset møn is also a restaurant and café',datetime('now')),('Q4983163','Buckhorn Saloon & Museum','Buckhorn Saloon & Museum',29.4262,-98.4897,'US','restaurant',1881,16.17,'Buckhorn Saloon & Museum (San Antonio)','buckhorn saloon & museum wildlife exhibits shooting gallery texas rangers exhibit in texas united states restaurant museum the buckhorn saloon & museum is a privately run museum located at 318 e houston street in downtown san antonio texas u s originally privately owned by albert friedrich the buckhorn became a tourist attraction for its unique collections theodore roosevelt and his rough riders were reputed to frequent the establishment',datetime('now')),('Q4984293','Buddies in Bad Times','Buddies in Bad Times',43.664017,-79.382894,'CA','bar',1979,19.02,'Buddies in Bad Times','buddies in bad times theatre building in toronto canada gay bar theatre building buddies in bad times theatre bibt is a canadian professional theatre company based in toronto ontario and founded in 1978 by matt walsh jerry ciccoritti and sky gilbert buddies in bad times is dedicated to the promotion of queer theatrical expression',datetime('now')),('Q4985436','Buena Vista Cafe','Buena Vista Cafe',37.806528,-122.420782,'US','cafe',1916,16.17,'Buena Vista Cafe','buena vista cafe credited with introducing irish coffee to the united states café the buena vista is a café in san francisco california credited with introducing irish coffee to the united states in 1952 the buena vista café originally opened in 1916 when the first floor of a boardinghouse was converted into a saloon',datetime('now')),('Q4986844','Bukhara','Bukhara|בוכרה',28.5971,77.174,'IN','restaurant',1977,24.0,'Bukhara (restaurant)','bukhara restaurant in delhi restaurant bukhara is a restaurant at the luxury collection itc maurya hotel in new delhi india it was established in 1977',datetime('now')),('Q4992897','Hard Times Cafe','Hard Times Cafe|Hard Times Café',44.96954,-93.24617,'US','restaurant',1992,27.86,'Hard Times Cafe','hard times cafe collectively run vegetarian restaurant in minneapolis minnesota united states vegetarian restaurant vegan cuisine hard times cafe is a collectively owned restaurant in the cedar-riverside neighborhood of minneapolis minnesota it is known for its punk and hippie ideology its gritty ambiance and its large selection of vegan and vegetarian food',datetime('now')),('Q4996570','Bull Inn','Bull Inn',51.4737,-0.91196,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Bull Inn, Sonning','bull inn pub in sonning berkshire england uk pub inn hotel the bull inn also known as the bull at sonning or just the bull is a historic public house now also a restaurant and hotel in the centre of the village of sonning in berkshire england',datetime('now')),('Q4996877','Bullfeathers','Bullfeathers',38.884639,-77.005639,'US','pub|restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Bullfeathers','bullfeathers restaurant pub bullfeathers of capitol hill is a restaurant and bar on 410 first street se in washington d c in the capitol hill neighborhood its name comes from president theodore roosevelt''s favorite euphemism for bullshit the logo of the restaurant is a depiction of roosevelt',datetime('now')),('Q4997484','Bundaberg Brewed Drinks','Bundaberg Brewed Drinks|Bundaberg Drinks|משקאות בונדברג',-24.8524,152.3813,'AU','brewery',1960,28.39,'Bundaberg Brewed Drinks','bundaberg brewed drinks non-alcoholic beverages company brewery business bundaberg brewed drinks pty ltd is an australian family-owned business that brews non-alcoholic beverages based in bundaberg queensland the company exports to over 60 countries across the globe and is most known for ginger beer and other carbonated beverages',datetime('now')),('Q4998536','Burger Heaven','Burger Heaven',40.7574,-73.9765,'US','restaurant',1943,15.0,'Burger Heaven','burger heaven restaurant in new york united states restaurant burger heaven was a family owned diner-style burger restaurant in new york city established in 1943 it closed its final location in february 2020 citing the increase in delivery culture',datetime('now')),('Q4998538','Burger King','Burger King',39.48193,-88.37309,'US','restaurant',1957,19.02,'Burger King (Mattoon, Illinois)','burger king independent restaurant in mattoon illinois restaurant fast food hamburger burger king is a restaurant founded by the hoots family and operated by burger king llc of illinois in mattoon illinois united states it is not related to the fast food chain burger king the restaurant''s founders claim that it is the original burger king and predates the fast food chain',datetime('now')),('Q5001291','Busboys and Poets','Busboys and Poets',38.918055,-77.031944,'US','restaurant',2005,13.17,'Busboys and Poets','busboys and poets restaurant chain in washington d c area restaurant cuisine of the united states busboys and poets is a full-service restaurant bar bookstore coffee shop and events venue in the washington d c area founded in 2005 by andy shallal the original busboys and poets is located at 14th & v streets in the u street corridor of washington d c there are now eight locations in the dmv a second location opened in shirlington virginia in 2007 a third location opened in dc''s mount vernon triangle neighborhood in 2008 a fourth in hyattsville maryland opened in july 2011 a fifth opened in the ',datetime('now')),('Q5002470','Butchie''s Drive-In','Butchie''s Drive-In',34.523056,-93.053611,'US','restaurant',1952,12.0,'Butchie''s Drive-In','butchie''s drive-in restaurant butchie''s drive-in now known as bailey''s dairy treat is a historic restaurant at 534 park avenue in hot springs arkansas it is a small single-story art moderne structure with sleek rounded lines neon lighting and a stucco finish',datetime('now')),('Q5011045','CHAR No.4','CHAR No.4',40.6851,-73.9917,'US','restaurant',2008,12.0,'CHAR No.4','char no 4 restaurant char no 4 was an american restaurant and whiskey bar located in the new york city neighborhood of cobble hill brooklyn specializing in southern us cuisine and noted for its large selection of bourbon whiskey char opened in 2008 and closed in summer 2015',datetime('now')),('Q5015304','Panoramic','Panoramic',53.41,-2.997,'GB','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Panoramic (restaurant)','panoramic liverpool restaurant restaurant panoramic 34 is a restaurant and bar located on the 34th floor of west tower liverpool it is 100 metres 330 ft above ground and claims to be ''one of the uk''s highest restaurants'' with views as far away as north wales',datetime('now')),('Q5016807','Caelis','Caelis',41.387,2.1743,'ES','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Caelis','caelis restaurant in barcelona spain restaurant caelis is a michelin-starred restaurant in barcelona spain in 2002 toulouse chef romain fornell took over the diana restaurant at the el palace hotel and renamed it caelis in 2004',datetime('now')),('Q5017087','Cafe Astoria','Cafe Astoria|明星咖啡館',25.044215,121.512781,'TW','restaurant',1949,22.85,'Cafe Astoria','cafe astoria first western-style bakery in taiwan restaurant cultural heritage monument in taipei the cafe astoria chinese 明星咖啡館 pinyin míngxīng kāfēi guǎn is the first western-style bakery in taiwan it is located in the zhongzheng district of taipei taiwan on wuchang street across from the city god temple',datetime('now')),('Q5017090','Cafe Bahar','Cafe Bahar',17.399756,78.478508,'IN','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Cafe Bahar','cafe bahar building in india restaurant cafe bahar is a prominent and historically significant restaurant located in basheerbagh area of hyderabad in the state of telangana india specifically near the old mla quarters and hyderguda cross-roads initially established as a modest irani café it has evolved into a popular landmark particularly renowned for its authentic hyderabadi biryani hyderabadi haleem and traditional irani chai',datetime('now')),('Q5017092','Cafe Chambord','Cafe Chambord',40.761667,-73.974444,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Cafe Chambord','cafe chambord restaurant in new york u s restaurant french cuisine cafe chambord was a french haute cuisine restaurant in new york city united states its original owner was roger chauveron who opened it in 1936 then sold it in 1950 to move to deviat charente france',datetime('now')),('Q5017101','Cafe Frankenstein','Cafe Frankenstein',33.5469,-117.796,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Cafe Frankenstein','cafe frankenstein coffee house in laguna beach california us restaurant the café frankenstein was a coffee house in laguna beach california united states from 1958 to 1962 the café frankenstein was seen as sort of a den of iniquity amongst the semi-conservative orange county california art community of laguna beach',datetime('now')),('Q5017102','Cafe Hon','Cafe Hon',39.331157,-76.63292,'US','restaurant',1992,12.0,'Cafe Hon','cafe hon restaurant in baltimore maryland usa restaurant cafe hon was a restaurant in the hampden area of baltimore maryland',datetime('now')),('Q5017146','Caffe Mediterraneum','Caffe Mediterraneum',37.8656,-122.258,'US','cafe',1956,12.0,'Caffe Mediterraneum','caffe mediterraneum famous café located on telegraph avenue in berkeley california near the university of california berkeley café caffe mediterraneum often referred to as caffe med or simply the med was a coffeehouse located on telegraph avenue in berkeley california us near the university of california berkeley the med was a landmark of telegraph avenue history listed for years in european guide books as ''the gathering place for 1960s radicals who created people''s park'' and as of 2009 described in fodor''s guide book as a relic of 1960s-era café culture',datetime('now')),('Q5017150','Caffe Reggio','Caffe Reggio',40.7303,-74.0003,'US','cafe',1927,16.17,'Caffe Reggio','caffe reggio cafe in new york city café caffe reggio is a new york city coffeehouse at 119 macdougal street in the heart of manhattan''s greenwich village which first opened in 1927 italian cappuccino was introduced in america by the founder of caffe reggio domenico parisi in the early 1920s',datetime('now')),('Q5017151','Caffe Trieste','Caffe Trieste',37.7987,-122.407,'US','cafe|restaurant',1956,13.17,'Caffe Trieste','caffe trieste coffeehouse in san francisco restaurant café caffè trieste is an internationally known coffeehouse retail store and former franchise in san francisco the original cafe opened in 1956 was the first espresso-based coffeehouse on the west coast of the united states',datetime('now')),('Q5017152','Caffe Vittoria','Caffe Vittoria',42.3642,-71.0545,'US','restaurant',1929,15.0,'Caffé Vittoria','caffe vittoria italian restaurant in boston massachusetts u s restaurant italian cuisine caffè vittoria is an italian cafe located on hanover street in the north end neighborhood of boston massachusetts united states the cafe features four levels three liquor bars and a cigar room',datetime('now')),('Q5017189','Caffè Lavena','Caffè Lavena|קפה לאבנה',45.43457,12.33848,'IT','cafe',1750,27.64,'Caffè Lavena','caffè lavena coffeehouse in venice italy café caffé lavena is a café in the city of venice italy',datetime('now')),('Q5017199','Caffé Vita Coffee Roasting Company','Caffé Vita Coffee Roasting Company',47.614004,-122.31902,'US','cafe',1995,13.17,'Caffé Vita Coffee Roasting Company','caffé vita coffee roasting company coffee roasting company in seattle washington café caffe vita coffee roasting company commonly known as caffe vita is an american coffee roasting company based in seattle washington part of the third wave of coffee movement it has been named one of 10 places offering the best coffee in america caffe vita was founded in seattle''s queen anne neighborhood in 1995 by mike mcconnell',datetime('now')),('Q5017216','Café Allegro','Café Allegro',47.6585,-122.313,'US','cafe',NULL,12.0,'Café Allegro','café allegro coffeeshop in seattle washington café café allegro is a coffeeshop in the university district of seattle washington united states it is notable for being one of the city''s first espresso shops and for its role in the history of starbucks as the place where founding proprietor dave olsen designed the starbucks coffee product line',datetime('now')),('Q5017226','Café Boulud','Café Boulud',40.7744,-73.9639,'US','restaurant',1998,12.0,'Café Boulud','café boulud restaurant in new york united states restaurant french cuisine café boulud stylized as café boulud at maison barnes is a french restaurant located at 100 east 63rd street on the upper east side in manhattan in new york city it is owned by french celebrity chef and restaurateur daniel boulud',datetime('now')),('Q5017228','Café Bräunerhof','Café Bräunerhof',48.2072,16.3687,'AT','cafe',NULL,19.85,'Café Bräunerhof','café bräunerhof viennese café viennese coffee house café bräunerhof is a traditional viennese café and restaurant located at stallburggasse 2 in the innere stadt first district in vienna austria bräunerhof is best known for being the preferred café of the famous austrian writer thomas bernhard',datetime('now')),('Q5017234','Café Coco','Café Coco',36.15186,-86.804938,'US','restaurant',1995,12.0,'Café Coco','café coco restaurant in tennessee usa restaurant music venue café coco was a 24-hour cafe located at 210 louise avenue near elliston place in nashville tennessee during the day it is primarily a coffee shop and at night it has live music poetry and comedy',datetime('now')),('Q5017237','Café Comercial','Café Comercial|café Comercial',40.428639,-3.702055,'ES','cafe',NULL,24.64,'Café Comercial','café comercial café located at the glorieta de bilbao in central madrid spain café the café comercial is a café located at the glorieta de bilbao in central madrid spain it is one of the city''s oldest cafés founded 21 march 1887 in the era of the bourbon restoration in spain',datetime('now')),('Q5017239','Café Hafa','Café Hafa|مقهى الحافة',35.7915,-5.8218,'MA','cafe',NULL,28.39,'Café Hafa','café hafa moroccan cafe café café hafa arabic مقهى الحافة is a cafe in tangier morocco located along the cliff top overlooking the bay of tangier opened in 1921 the cafe still maintains its original decor with multiple levels of terrace seating facing the strait of gibraltar with tarifa spain visible in the distance',datetime('now')),('Q5017243','Café Mambo','Café Mambo',38.981171,1.296054,'ES','bar',NULL,12.0,'Café Mambo','café mambo bar café mambo is a bar located in sant antoni de portmany ibiza it is known for being the official pre party point for pacha ibiza and hosting internationally known djs such as john digweed carl cox erick morillo benny benassi paul van dyk armin van buuren david guetta martin garrix and swedish house mafia who have a weekly residency there during the summer',datetime('now')),('Q5017245','Café La Biela','Café La Biela|La Biela',-34.587917,-58.390833,'AR','cafe',NULL,19.85,'La Biela','café la biela building in recoleta buenos aires argentina café la biela spanish the connecting rod is a famous bar in the recoleta neighbourhood of buenos aires frequented by the argentine upper class celebrities and tourists',datetime('now')),('Q5017252','Café Pamplona','Café Pamplona',42.3717,-71.1155,'US','restaurant',1959,24.0,'Café Pamplona','café pamplona cambridge ma us 1959 2020 restaurant café pamplona was a coffeehouse at 12 bow st beside the intersection of bow and arrow streets near harvard square in cambridge massachusetts united states',datetime('now')),('Q5017253','Café Paradiso','Café Paradiso',51.897114,-8.482903,'IE','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Café Paradiso','café paradiso restaurant denis cotter is an irish celebrity chef from macroom author and proprietor of the acclaimed vegetarian paradiso restaurant in cork city he has also published several cookbooks and featured on the rté one television series guerrilla gourmet',datetime('now')),('Q5017256','Café Reconcile','Café Reconcile',29.9399,-90.0803,'US','restaurant',1996,13.17,'Café Reconcile','café reconcile non-profit organisation and restaurant in new orleans restaurant café reconcile is a non-profit organization and restaurant in central city area of new orleans louisiana united states it was founded in 1996 by craig cuccia and rev',datetime('now'));
INSERT INTO institutions VALUES ('Q5017283','Café des Artistes','Café des Artistes',40.773333,-73.978861,'US','restaurant',1917,16.17,'Café des Artistes','café des artistes restaurant in manhatten new york restaurant french cuisine café des artistes was a fine restaurant at 1 west 67th street in manhattan new york city',datetime('now')),('Q5017290','Café ‘t Mandje','Café ‘t Mandje|Café ''t Mandje|カフェ・マンチェ',52.374722,4.901111,NULL,'bar',NULL,31.46,'Café ''t Mandje','café t mandje bar in amsterdam gay bar café ''t mandje is a bar in amsterdam netherlands it is located in zeedijk street and was opened in 1927 by bet van beeren herself a lesbian',datetime('now')),('Q5017692','Cairngorm Brewery','Cairngorm Brewery|Cairngorm Brewery Co Ltd',57.2009,-3.8202,'GB','brewery',NULL,19.85,'Cairngorm Brewery','cairngorm brewery brewery in highland scotland uk brewery cairngorm brewery is a brewery based in aviemore in the highlands of scotland it is situated on the dalfaber industrial estate at the north end of the village and is within the cairngorms national park',datetime('now')),('Q5022877','Callooh Callay Bar','Callooh Callay Bar',51.526281,-0.0799,'GB','bar',NULL,13.17,'Callooh Callay Bar','callooh callay bar cocktail bar in shoreditch london cocktail lounge shoreditch is an area in london england and is located in the london borough of hackney alongside neighbouring parts of tower hamlets which are also perceived as part of the area due to historic ecclesiastical links shoreditch lies just north-east of the border with the city of london and is considered to be a part of london''s east end',datetime('now')),('Q502333','Preservation Hall','Preservation Hall|プリザベーション・ホール|Preswervation Hall',29.958339,-90.065359,'US','restaurant',NULL,31.46,'Preservation Hall','preservation hall jazz club in the french quarter of new orleans louisiana us jazz club preservation hall is a jazz venue on st peter street in the french quarter of new orleans louisiana the building is associated with a house band a record label and a non-profit foundation',datetime('now')),('Q5025775','Camden Head','Camden Head',51.5373,-0.14112,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Camden Head','camden head one of the oldest pubs in camden london england pub the camden head is one of the oldest pubs in camden london england having been established in 1787 it is also a former music venue and hosts comedy events',datetime('now')),('Q5025904','Camellia Grill','Camellia Grill',29.9435,-90.134,'US','restaurant',1946,16.17,'Camellia Grill','camellia grill restaurant in louisiana united states restaurant north american cuisine the camellia grill is a landmark diner in the carrollton section uptown of new orleans it is on carrollton avenue near its intersection with st',datetime('now')),('Q50276335','Q50276335','',60.1681,24.9473,'FI','restaurant',NULL,12.0,NULL,'q50276335 restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q5027667','Camp Washington Chili','Camp Washington Chili|キャンプ・ワシントン・チリ',39.137558,-84.537783,'US','restaurant',1940,16.17,'Camp Washington Chili','camp washington chili restaurant in ohio usa restaurant cuisine of the united states camp washington chili is a cincinnati chili parlor founded in 1940 by steve andon and fred zarnbus in the neighborhood of camp washington near downtown cincinnati in southwestern ohio a well known cincinnati landmark the parlor is located at 3005 colerain avenue and was run by longtime owner john johnson until his death in october 2025',datetime('now')),('Q5027988','Campbell Apartment','Campbell Apartment|キャンベル・アパート',40.7526,-73.9778,'US','bar',1923,16.17,'Campbell Apartment','campbell apartment cocktail bar in new york city cocktail lounge the campbell is a bar and cocktail lounge in grand central terminal in midtown manhattan new york city the space long known as the campbell apartment was once the office of american financier john w campbell a member of the new york central railroad''s board of directors',datetime('now')),('Q5028417','Campisi''s Egyptian Restaurant','Campisi''s Egyptian Restaurant',32.836338,-96.771688,'US','restaurant',1946,15.0,'Campisi''s Egyptian Restaurant','campisi''s egyptian restaurant italian restaurant located in dallas texas us restaurant italian cuisine campisi''s restaurant is an italian-american restaurant chain based in dallas texas offering a self-described roman cuisine focusing on pizza and pasta as of 2023 the chain has nine locations throughout the dallas fort worth metroplex',datetime('now')),('Q5029067','Can Jubany','Can Jubany',41.9294,2.3018,'ES','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Can Jubany','can jubany restaurant in calldetenes spain restaurant catalan cuisine can jubany is a catalan restaurant in calldetenes catalonia chef nandu jubany raises vegetables herbs and livestock for his refined versions of traditional catalan cuisine',datetime('now')),('Q5031970','Candlenut Kitchen','Candlenut Kitchen',1.305863,103.810233,'SG','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Candlenut Kitchen','candlenut kitchen restaurant restaurant peranakan cuisine candlenut kitchen often known simply as candlenut is a singaporean restaurant serving the local peranakan cuisine located at the tanglin district the restaurant is owned by malcolm lee who also serves as its executive chef',datetime('now')),('Q50321270','Blue Bay','Blue Bay|Le Blue Bay',43.748162,7.439065,'MC','restaurant',NULL,12.0,NULL,'blue bay restaurant restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q50333437','Gasthaus Stuhlmacher','Gasthaus Stuhlmacher',51.961889,7.628278,'DE','restaurant',NULL,13.17,NULL,'gasthaus stuhlmacher restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q5033567','Canteen Lunch in the Alley','Canteen Lunch in the Alley|Обед в столовой на аллее',41.0181,-92.4119,'US','restaurant',1927,16.17,'Canteen Lunch in the Alley','canteen lunch in the alley restaurant in iowa united states restaurant canteen lunch in the alley is a short order restaurant in ottumwa iowa the original five-stool canteen lunch was opened in 1927 and moved west on the same street to its current address under the second street parking ramp in 1936',datetime('now')),('Q5033602','Canter''s','Canter''s|カンターズ',34.0788,-118.362,'US','restaurant',1924,27.64,'Canter''s','canter''s jewish-style delicatessen and restaurant in los angeles jewish delicatessen canter''s deli is a jewish-style delicatessen opened in 1931 in boyle heights and later moved to the fairfax district of los angeles california near the border of west hollywood it has been frequented by many movie stars and celebrities',datetime('now')),('Q5035868','Capitol Diner','Capitol Diner',42.463056,-70.944722,'US','restaurant',1928,22.02,'Capitol Diner','capitol diner restaurant in massachusetts united states restaurant diner the capitol diner is a historic diner at 431 union street in lynn massachusetts built in 1928 by the j g brill company it is believed to be that company''s last operating diner',datetime('now')),('Q5036241','Caprice','Caprice|קפריס',22.2863,114.157,'CN','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'Caprice (restaurant)','caprice restaurant in hong kong restaurant french cuisine caprice is a contemporary french haute cuisine restaurant in the four seasons hotel hong kong it was initially run by chef de cuisine vincent thierry a former sous chef at le cinq in the hotel george v paris',datetime('now')),('Q5036692','Captain John''s Harbour Boat Restaurant','Captain John''s Harbour Boat Restaurant|キャプテン・ジョンズ・ハーバー・ボート・レストラン|Jadran',43.641362,-79.374387,NULL,'restaurant',1970,19.85,'Captain John''s Harbour Boat Restaurant','captain john''s harbour boat restaurant prominent floating restaurant in toronto for several decades passenger vessel floating restaurant captain john''s harbour boat restaurant incorporated as 1518756 ontario inc was a restaurant and banquet hall in toronto ontario canada for most of its existence it was located in the ms jadran a former adriatic passenger ship that was permanently docked at the foot of yonge street at 1 queens quay west on toronto''s waterfront',datetime('now')),('Q5036713','Captain Lawrence Brewing Company','Captain Lawrence Brewing Company',41.1281,-73.7892,'US','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Captain Lawrence Brewing Company','captain lawrence brewing company brewery brewery captain lawrence brewing company is a craft brewery located in elmsford new york the brewery is owned and run by head brewer scott vaccaro',datetime('now')),('Q5037759','Caravaggio','Caravaggio',40.7733,-73.9649,'US','restaurant',2009,12.0,'Caravaggio (restaurant)','caravaggio italian restaurant in manhattan new york city restaurant italian cuisine caravaggio is an italian restaurant located at 23 east 74th street between 5th avenue and madison avenue on the upper east side in manhattan in new york city it is around the corner from the met breuer',datetime('now')),('Q5039331','Carib Brewery','Carib Brewery|Carib',10.649056,61.42975,'TT','brewery',1947,30.86,'Carib Brewery','carib brewery trinidadian brewery trademark brewery the carib brewery limited is headquartered in trinidad and tobago it produces carib and stag beers and a range of shandy products',datetime('now')),('Q5039744','Carl''s Ice Cream','Carl''s Ice Cream',38.3136,-77.4686,'US','ice_cream|restaurant',1947,16.17,'Carl''s Ice Cream','carl''s ice cream historic ice cream stand ice cream parlor restaurant carl''s ice cream also known as carl''s frozen custard or most often carl''s is a curbside ice cream stand located at 2200 princess anne street fredericksburg virginia since 2005 the stand with its art moderne architectural facade has been listed on the national register of historic places',datetime('now')),('Q5041437','Carlo''s Bake Shop','Carlo''s Bake Shop|carlo´s bake shop|卡洛斯烘培坊',40.73711,-74.0309,'US','bakery',1910,39.34,'Carlo''s Bake Shop','carlo''s bake shop bakeries of the united states bakery carlo''s bake shop commonly known as carlo''s bakery and also known as carlo''s city hall bake shop is a bakery in hoboken new jersey owned by buddy valastro the bakery has gained public attention as the setting of the tlc television series cake boss',datetime('now')),('Q5043145','Carlyle Restaurant','Carlyle Restaurant',40.7744,-73.9632,'US','restaurant',1930,15.0,'Carlyle Restaurant','carlyle restaurant new york city restaurant french cuisine the carlyle restaurant formerly dumonet at the carlyle is a contemporary american cuisine restaurant located at 35 east 76th street at madison ave in the back of the carlyle hotel on the upper east side in manhattan in new york city it was established in 1930',datetime('now')),('Q5044022','Carney''s','Carney''s|卡尼火車餐廳|カーニーズ',34.095833,-118.371667,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Carney''s','carney''s restaurant in los angeles california u s fast-food hamburger restaurant carney''s is a hot dog and burger restaurant in a yellow union pacific rail car on sunset boulevard in los angeles california it was brought to the site in 1978',datetime('now')),('Q5045652','Carpenter''s Coffee House','Carpenter''s Coffee House',51.51197,-0.1228,'GB','cafe',NULL,13.17,'Carpenter''s Coffee House','carpenter''s coffee house coffee house in covent garden london england coffeehouse carpenter''s coffee house later known as the finish the queen''s head and jack''s was a coffee house in covent garden london established by george carpenter some time around 1762',datetime('now')),('Q5047784','Casa Basso','Casa Basso',40.8214,-72.6631,'US','restaurant',1928,16.17,'Casa Basso','casa basso historic site in westhampton ny restaurant casa basso is an italian restaurant located on the eastern end of long island in westhampton new york it is the site of the theophilus brouwer house',datetime('now')),('Q5047893','Casa Vicent','Casa Vicent',41.146111,-8.608333,'PT','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'Casa Vicent','casa vicent cultural heritage monument in porto portugal restaurant cultural heritage casa vicent is a historic building in the civil parish of santo ildefonso in the portuguese city of porto located in the historic lower town portuguese baixa the shop is notable for the art nouveau and rococo elements and undulating forms of its iron facade it is similar to the facades of the ourivesaria cunha and ourivesaria reis along the same road all constructed by the companhia aliança',datetime('now')),('Q5048432','Casey''s Diner','Casey''s Diner|Casey’s Diner',42.285738,-71.344375,'US','restaurant',1922,22.02,'Casey''s Diner','casey''s diner diner casey''s diner is a historic ten-stool diner located at 36 south avenue in downtown natick massachusetts famous for its steamed hot dogs that snap when first bitten into casey''s is one of the oldest operating diners in massachusetts and possibly in the united states',datetime('now')),('Q5048957','Cask''n Flagon','Cask''n Flagon',42.3473,-71.0983,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Cask''n Flagon','cask''n flagon restaurant and sports bar in massachusetts us restaurant the cask ''n flagon is a restaurant and sports bar with locations at fenway park in boston and on rt 139 in marshfield massachusetts both locations are owned locally',datetime('now')),('Q5049812','Castelo de Palmela','Castelo de Palmela|Castillo de Palmela|パルメラ城|Château de Palmela|Palmela Kalesi',38.565621,-8.901681,'PT','pub',NULL,28.39,'Castle of Palmela','castelo de palmela castle in portugal castle cultural heritage inn castle of palmela is a castle in portugal it is classified as a national monument',datetime('now')),('Q5050149','Castle Hotel','Castle Hotel',53.333,-2.6957,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Castle, Halton','castle hotel pub in halton cheshire england uk pub hotel the castle formerly known as the castle hotel is a public house and former georgian courthouse on halton hill in halton runcorn cheshire england its side walls are continuous with the curtain walls of the ruins of halton castle',datetime('now')),('Q5051081','Cat and Fiddle Inn','Cat and Fiddle Inn',53.2441,-1.9997,'GB','pub',NULL,24.64,'Cat and Fiddle Inn','cat and fiddle inn pub in macclesfield forest and wildboarclough cheshire england uk pub the cat and fiddle inn is a former public house in the english peak district in cheshire close to the border with derbyshire it sits on the a537 road from macclesfield to buxton which runs across a high and remote area of moorland',datetime('now')),('Q5051174','Catacombs Nightclub Philadelphia','Catacombs Nightclub Philadelphia',39.9488,-75.1605,'US','bar',NULL,12.0,'Catacombs Nightclub Philadelphia','catacombs nightclub philadelphia gay after hours nightclub in philadelphia that played underground dance music lgbtq nightclub the catacombs nightclub was a gay after-hours club in philadelphia that played underground dance music a precursor to house music additionally catacombs was responsible for the creation of the dance music genre philly classics',datetime('now')),('Q5055048','Cavern Pub','Cavern Pub|キャヴァーン・パブ',53.40638,-2.98795,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Cavern Pub','cavern pub pub in liverpool uk pub the cavern club is a music venue on mathew street liverpool england the cavern club opened on 16 january 1957 as a jazz club later becoming a centre of the rock and roll scene in liverpool in the late 1950s and early 1960s',datetime('now')),('Q5060711','Central Diner','Central Diner',41.791025,-71.422548,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Central Diner','central diner restaurant the central diner also called paula''s kitchen and formerly known as the elmwood diner liberty elm diner jenn''s elmwood diner ole elmwood diner or worcester lunch car company diner 806 is a historic worcester lunch car company diner at 777 elmwood avenue in providence rhode island',datetime('now')),('Q5061142','Central Grocery','Central Grocery',29.9588,-90.061,'US','restaurant',1906,16.17,'Central Grocery','central grocery restaurant in louisiana united states restaurant central grocery co is a small old-fashioned italian-american grocery store with a sandwich counter located at 923 decatur street in the french quarter of new orleans louisiana',datetime('now')),('Q5069929','Champany Inn','Champany Inn',55.993,-3.561,'GB','restaurant'