 9039 beverly boulevard on the border of beverly hills it opened for business in 1936 and was the site of the academy awards party for many years',datetime('now')),('Q5089190','Cheddar Ales','Cheddar Ales',51.267131,-2.768909,'GB','brewery',2006,12.0,'Cheddar Ales','cheddar ales brewery in the village of cheddar in somerset england brewery cheddar ales is an independent artisanal brewery located in the village of cheddar in somerset england which produces a range of regular and seasonal beers its owner and head brewer jem ham previously worked 15 years at another local brewery before going out on his own',datetime('now')),('Q5089487','Chef''s Table at Brooklyn Fare','Chef''s Table at Brooklyn Fare',40.6887,-73.986,'US','restaurant',2009,19.02,'Chef''s Table at Brooklyn Fare','chef''s table at brooklyn fare restaurant in the united states restaurant chef''s table at brooklyn fare is a restaurant in new york city originally the restaurant was located at 200 schermerhorn street in downtown brooklyn making it the first new york city restaurant outside manhattan to receive 3 michelin stars',datetime('now')),('Q5090125','Chelsea Place','Chelsea Place',40.741972,-74.001167,'US','restaurant',1974,12.0,'Chelsea Place','chelsea place restaurant in new york city restaurant chelsea place was a restaurant at 147 eighth avenue in new york city''s chelsea district founded in 1974 and operational until 1992 it was unusual in that the restaurant was hidden in the back of an antique shop',datetime('now')),('Q5092279','Cherry Bar','Cherry Bar|チェリーバー',-37.8156,144.971,'AU','bar',1999,12.0,'Cherry Bar','cherry bar bar and music venue in melbourne australia bar music venue the cherry bar is a melbourne city bar founded in december 1999 by former cosmic psychos drummer bill walsh and jim bourke originally located on acdc lane off flinders lane between russell st and exhibition st the bar replaced existing artists studios in the building to make a rock music venue that has become a popular concert after-party venue for touring bands and their crews oasis guitarist noel gallagher was so taken with the bar during the band''s 2002 australian tour he made an offer to purchase it',datetime('now')),('Q5092298','Cherry Bowl Drive-In Theatre & Diner','Cherry Bowl Drive-In Theatre & Diner|Cherry Bowl Drive-In',44.668,-86.043,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Cherry Bowl Drive-In Theatre & Diner','cherry bowl drive-in theatre & diner drive-in movie theater and diner in honor michigan united states restaurant movie theater drive-in theater the cherry bowl drive-in theatre & diner is a historic drive-in theater with a concession stand in honor michigan on us highway 31 us 31 it opened on july 4 1953 and was one of eight remaining drive-in theaters in michigan in 2024',datetime('now')),('Q5092649','Cherwell Boathouse','Cherwell Boathouse',51.7697,-1.2538,'GB','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Cherwell Boathouse','cherwell boathouse boathouse and restaurant on the river cherwell in oxford england restaurant boathouse the cherwell boathouse also boat house is a boathouse and restaurant on the river cherwell in oxford england it is located down a small lane off the junction between chadlington road and bardwell road which itself is off the banbury road in north oxford',datetime('now')),('Q5094644','Chez Bruce','Chez Bruce|シェ・ブルース',51.4464,-0.165278,'GB','restaurant',1995,13.17,'Chez Bruce','chez bruce restaurant located at 2 bellevue road in wandsworth london england restaurant chez bruce is a restaurant located at 2 bellevue road in wandsworth london england',datetime('now')),('Q5094656','Chez l''Ami Louis','Chez l''Ami Louis|ל''אמי לואיז',48.867,2.3582,'FR','restaurant',1924,15.0,'Chez l''Ami Louis','chez l''ami louis restaurant in paris france restaurant chez l''ami louis french pronunciation ʃe lami lwi our friend louis''s is a restaurant at 32 rue du vertbois in the 3rd arrondissement of paris france founded in 1924 the restaurant which has been called the world''s most famous bistro and the worst restaurant in the world has only fourteen tables and serves meals in a traditional french setting',datetime('now')),('Q5098932','Chili John''s','Chili John''s|チリ・ジョンズ',34.18,-118.334,'US','restaurant',1946,16.17,'Chili John''s','chili john''s restaurant located in green bay wisconsin restaurant chili john''s is a restaurant that originated in green bay wisconsin opening in 1913 a second restaurant was opened in burbank california in 1946',datetime('now')),('Q51069194','Jim and Dad''s Brewing Company','Jim and Dad''s Brewing Company|吉姆老爹啤酒工场',24.707917,121.684,'TW','brewery',NULL,13.17,'Jim and Dad''s Brewing Company','jim and dad''s brewing company brewery in yuanshan yilan county taiwan brewery the jim and dad''s brewing company traditional chinese 吉姆老爹啤酒工場 simplified chinese 吉姆老爹啤酒工场 pinyin jímǔ lǎo diē píjiǔ gōngchǎng is a brewery in yuanshan township yilan county taiwan',datetime('now')),('Q5110604','Geuzestekerij Hanssens Artisanaal','Geuzestekerij Hanssens Artisanaal|Gueuzerie Hanssens Artisanaal',50.72884,4.29744,'BE','brewery',NULL,19.85,NULL,'geuzestekerij hanssens artisanaal brewery in belgium lambic brewery gueuze blendery',datetime('now')),('Q5118320','Churston Court','Churston Court|Churston Court Inn',50.3972,-3.54333,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Churston Court','churston court grade i listed pub in torbay devon england united kingdom pub hotel churston court is the manor house of the former manor of churston ferrers anciently cercetone domesday book 1086 churecheton book of fees 13th c churchstow churchton churchston etc near brixham in devon and is a grade ii listed building',datetime('now')),('Q5119566','Ciel Bleu','Ciel Bleu',52.348678,4.893933,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Ciel Bleu','ciel bleu restaurant inside the okura hotel in amsterdam the netherlands restaurant french cuisine ciel bleu is a restaurant located in the okura hotel a five-star hotel in amsterdam netherlands it is a fine dining restaurant and was awarded one michelin star from 2005 to 2007 and two michelin stars from 2008 to present',datetime('now')),('Q5119742','Cieszyn Brewery','Cieszyn Brewery|Bracki Browar Zamkowy w Cieszynie|Schlossbrauerei Cieszyn',49.751944,18.626111,'PL','brewery',1846,27.64,'Cieszyn Brewery','cieszyn brewery brewery in poland brewery the cieszyn brewery is a historic brewery in poland and belongs to the felix investments it is the longest continuously operating brewery in poland',datetime('now')),('Q5119798','Cigar City Brewing','Cigar City Brewing',27.95902,-82.50934,'US','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Cigar City Brewing','cigar city brewing craft brewery in tampa florida brand microbrewery cigar city brewing llc is a craft brewery in tampa florida at 3924 west spruce street founded in 2007 by joey redner it has been producing beer in tampa since january 30 2009',datetime('now')),('Q5120180','Cinc Sentits','Cinc Sentits',41.378371,2.152474,'ES','restaurant',2004,24.0,'Cinc Sentits','cinc sentits restaurant in spain restaurant catalan cuisine cinc sentits is a michelin two-starred restaurant in barcelona catalonia spain run by self-taught chef-owner jordi artal and maître-owner amèlia artal the restaurant''s name reflects its goal of stimulating each of the five taste sensations sweetness bitterness sourness saltiness and umami',datetime('now')),('Q5122135','Cisco Brewers','Cisco Brewers',41.263528,-70.13125,'US','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Cisco Brewers','cisco brewers brewery distillery and winery on nantucket island in massachusetts brewery cisco brewers is a brewery distillery and winery founded in 1992 in nantucket massachusetts by randy and wendy hudson it was acquired by craft brew alliance in 2018 and by ab inbev in 2020',datetime('now')),('Q5122929','Cittie of Yorke','Cittie of Yorke',51.5184,-0.112812,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'Cittie of Yorke','cittie of yorke public house on london''s high holborn pub the cittie of yorke is a grade ii listed public house on london''s high holborn and is listed in camra''s national inventory of historic pub interiors the pub is owned and operated by samuel smith old brewery',datetime('now')),('Q5123351','City Park Brewery','City Park Brewery',39.9719,-75.1842,'US','brewery',NULL,13.17,'City Park Brewery','city park brewery brewery in pennsylvania united states of america brewery city park brewery also known as the louis bergdoll brewing company was a brewery in north philadelphia built in 1856 several brewery buildings were added to the national register of historic places in 1980 as a historic district',datetime('now')),('Q5124557','Civil Service Club','Civil Service Club|公務員クラブ',51.5066,-0.12565,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Civil Service Club','civil service club social club for members of the uk civil service pub social club the civil service club is a london social club founded in 1953 for current and former members of the uk civil service and his majesty''s diplomatic service in advance of the wedding of the princess elizabeth and philip mountbatten which took place on 20 november 1947 at westminster abbey the home civil service and foreign service undertook a collection for the purpose of purchasing a suitable present to celebrate the royal nuptials',datetime('now')),('Q5125130','Claire''s Corner Copia','Claire''s Corner Copia',41.3081,-72.9289,'US','restaurant',1975,12.0,'Claire''s Corner Copia','claire''s corner copia vegetarian restaurant in new haven connecticut restaurant claire''s corner copia is a kosher vegetarian restaurant in new haven connecticut it is located at 1000 chapel street near the campus of yale university and the new haven green',datetime('now')),('Q5127031','Clayton Hotel Limerick','Clayton Hotel Limerick|Hotel Clarion|號角酒店|فندق كلاريون، ليمريك',52.6602,-8.637978,'IE','bar|restaurant',NULL,36.34,'Clayton Hotel, Limerick','clayton hotel limerick building in limerick ireland restaurant venue bar tower block leisure center hotel clayton hotel limerick formerly branded as a clarion hotel is a 17-storey hotel located beside the river shannon on steamboat quay in limerick part of the dalata hotel group the hotel was built in 2002 at a cost of 20 million',datetime('now')),('Q5128012','Class and Nachod Brewery','Class and Nachod Brewery',39.9797,-75.1503,'US','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Class and Nachod Brewery','class and nachod brewery brewery in pennsylvania united states of america brewery the class and nachod brewery is located in philadelphia pennsylvania the building was built in 1911 and is composed of six interconnected sections that historically served as the brewery cooper shop engine room boiler house stable and garage and bottling house',datetime('now')),('Q5133358','Cliftonville Hotel, Cromer','Cliftonville Hotel, Cromer|Cliftonville Hotel',52.9329,1.29299,'GB','pub',1894,22.85,'Cliftonville Hotel, Cromer','cliftonville hotel cromer pub in cromer uk pub hotel the cliftonville hotel is an aa 3 star hotel and grade ii listed building located in the english seaside town of cromer in the county of norfolk united kingdom',datetime('now')),('Q5134231','Clinton St. Baking Company & Restaurant','Clinton St. Baking Company & Restaurant',40.7209,-73.9837,'US','restaurant',2001,12.0,'Clinton Street Baking Company & Restaurant','clinton st baking company & restaurant american bakery and restaurant restaurant new american cuisine the clinton street baking company & restaurant csbc is an american bakery and restaurant it is located at 4 clinton street between east houston street and stanton street on the lower east side of manhattan new york',datetime('now')),('Q5136253','Club Gascon','Club Gascon',51.518613,-0.10023,'GB','restaurant',1998,13.17,'Club Gascon','club gascon french restaurant located in london england uk restaurant french cuisine club gascon was a french restaurant located in london england as of 2002 the restaurant held one star in the michelin guide',datetime('now')),('Q5136315','Club Moderne','Club Moderne',46.127778,-112.943889,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Club Moderne','club moderne restaurant in anaconda united states of america restaurant the club moderne is a bar in anaconda montana united states in the streamline moderne style it was designed by architect fred f willson and built by frank wullus in 1937 for john francisco',datetime('now')),('Q5136789','Clwb Ifor Bach','Clwb Ifor Bach',51.4805,-3.18147,'GB','pub|bar',1983,19.85,'Clwb Ifor Bach','clwb ifor bach nightclub in cardiff pub charitable organization music venue nightclub clwb ifor bach welsh pronunciation ˈklʊb ˈivɔr ˈbaːχ meaning little ivor''s club is a cardiff nightclub music venue welsh-language club and community centre it is known to the cardiff welsh-speaking community as clwb english club and is often known by others on the cardiff music scene as the welsh club',datetime('now')),('Q5137325','Cnapan Hotel','Cnapan Hotel',52.016628,-4.831446,'GB','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'Cnapan Hotel','cnapan hotel hotel and restaurant in newport pembrokeshire wales restaurant hotel cnapan also known variously as cnapan country house or cnapan restaurant and bed & breakfast is a grade ii listed hotel and restaurant in newport pembrokeshire it lies along the main road of the town east street which is part of the a487 road opposite the golden lion',datetime('now')),('Q5137456','Co-operative Block Building','Co-operative Block Building',42.685,-103.413056,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Co-operative Block Building','co-operative block building nrhp-listed property in crawford nebraska restaurant the co-operative block building is a commercial structure in downtown crawford nebraska united states it was built in 1909 and added to the national register of historic places on september 12 1985',datetime('now')),('Q5137601','Coach and Horses','Coach and Horses',51.5132,-0.130222,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Coach and Horses, Soho','coach and horses pub in soho london pub the coach and horses at 29 greek street on the corner with romilly street in soho london is a grade ii listed public house in the 20th century the pub became notable for its association with the columnist jeffrey bernard the staff of private eye magazine other journalists and as a haunt for soho personalities',datetime('now')),('Q5142352','Cold Spring Grange Hall','Cold Spring Grange Hall',38.9775,-74.9133,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Cold Spring Grange Hall','cold spring grange hall building in new jersey united states clubhouse restaurant the cold spring grange hall is located at 720 seashore road u s route 9 in the cold spring section of lower township in cape may county new jersey united states the historic grange hall was built in 1912 designed as the meeting hall for the cold spring grange 132',datetime('now')),('Q5142607','Cole''s Pacific Electric Buffet','Cole''s Pacific Electric Buffet|コールズ・パシフィック・エレクトリック・ビュッフェ',34.0448,-118.249,'US','restaurant',1908,16.17,'Cole''s Pacific Electric Buffet','cole''s pacific electric buffet restaurant in california united states restaurant diner cole''s pacific electric buffet also known as cole''s p e buffet and cole''s french dip was a restaurant and bar located at 118 east 6th street in the historic core of downtown los angeles california opened in 1908 it was the oldest restaurant in los angeles that had operated at same location since its founding',datetime('now')),('Q5148317','Colonial Farms','Colonial Farms',40.4966,-74.5268,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Colonial Farms','colonial farms building in new jersey united states restaurant colonial farms also known as the voorhees house is located at 1719 amwell road in the middlebush section of franklin township somerset county new jersey united states it was built in 1793 by p metz in a georgian style',datetime('now'));
