djacent church',datetime('now')),('Q5169970','Cordial','Cordial',51.767983,5.528603,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Cordial (restaurant)','cordial michelin starred restaurant in the netherlands restaurant cordial is a restaurant in oss netherlands it is a fine dining restaurant that was awarded one michelin star for the period 2002 2018',datetime('now')),('Q5171612','Corner Lunch','Corner Lunch',42.252778,-71.805556,'US','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Marvin''s Corner Lunch Diner','corner lunch historic diner in worcester massachusetts united states restaurant the marvin''s corner lunch diner is a historic diner at 133 lamartine street in worcester massachusetts built c 1955 and moved to worcester in 1968 it is the largest diner in the city and a rare example in new england of remodeling work done by the musi dining car company of carteret new jersey',datetime('now')),('Q5172117','Corona','Corona',52.079053,4.310045,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Corona (restaurant)','corona restaurant located in the hague in the netherlands part of hotel corona restaurant restaurant les saison part of hotel corona is a defunct restaurant in the hague netherlands it was a fine dining restaurant that was awarded one michelin star in 1988 and retained that rating until 1992',datetime('now')),('Q5177234','Country Club Bakery','Country Club Bakery',39.47167,-80.17049,'US','bakery',NULL,12.0,'Country Club Bakery','country club bakery bakeries of the united states bakery country club bakery is a bakery located in fairmont west virginia which is where the pepperoni roll originated the bakery is currently located on country club road',datetime('now')),('Q5178061','Cour du Nord','Cour du Nord',52.968761,6.671681,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Cour du Nord','cour du nord restaurant in drenthe netherlands restaurant cour du nord was a restaurant located in nooitgedacht drenthe in the netherlands it was a fine dining restaurant that was awarded one michelin star in 2009 and 2010',datetime('now')),('Q5179802