ed acts including jazz legends art blakey charles mingus max roach miles davis john coltrane bill evans and kenny burrell',datetime('now')),('Q5184204','Creole Kosher Kitchen','Creole Kosher Kitchen',29.953056,-90.067847,'US','restaurant',2000,12.0,'Creole Kosher Kitchen','creole kosher kitchen restaurant in new orleans louisiana restaurant creole kosher kitchen was a kosher restaurant in the city of new orleans the restaurant which was located in the french quarter was forced to close following severe devastation from the hurricane that ultimately led to the relocation of the family business to los angeles',datetime('now')),('Q51844440','Casa Piccola, Vienna','Casa Piccola, Vienna|Casa Piccola',48.201753,16.360762,'AT','cafe',NULL,13.17,NULL,'casa piccola vienna coffeehouse in mariahilf austria café',datetime('now')),('Q51845339','The Two Puddings','The Two Puddings',51.540385,0.001316,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'Two Puddings','the two puddings bar in newham london england uk pub the two puddings was a pub and live music venue on stratford broadway in stratford east london',datetime('now')),('Q5186565','Criterion Restaurant','Criterion Restaurant',51.50972,-0.13411,'GB','restaurant',1873,27.64,'Criterion Restaurant','criterion restaurant restaurant in london restaurant haute cuisine the criterion restaurant is an opulent restaurant complex facing piccadilly circus in the heart of london it was built by architect thomas verity in neo-byzantine style for the partnership spiers and pond which opened it in 1873',datetime('now')),('Q5187381','The Crocodile','The Crocodile|Crocodile Cafe|ذا كروكودايل',47.6135,-122.344,'US','bar',NULL,28.39,'The Crocodile','the crocodile music venue in seattle washington usa bar music venue the crocodile formerly the crocodile cafe and sometimes called the croc is a music club at 2505 1st avenue at wall street in the belltown neighborhood of seattle washington united states opened by stephanie dorgan as the crocodile cafe on april 30 1991 it quickly became a fixture of the city''s music scene',datetime('now')),('Q5187819','Market Cross House','Market Cross House',51.482286,-0.607097,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Crooked House of Windsor','market cross house building in windsor berkshire england uk pub the crooked house of windsor also known as the market cross house is a commercial building in windsor england dating from c 1687',datetime('now')),('Q5187999','The Great Yorkshire Brewery','The Great Yorkshire Brewery|Cropton Brewery',54.283333,-0.833333,'GB','brewery',NULL,19.02,'The Great Yorkshire Brewery','the great yorkshire brewery brewery situated in the village of cropton brewery the great yorkshire brewery founded as cropton brewery is situated in the village of cropton in north yorkshire england located within the north york moors national park it is 2 miles 3 2 km north-west of pickering',datetime('now')),('Q5188244','Cross Cafe','Cross Cafe',19.034312,73.063519,'IN','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Cross Cafe','cross cafe adolf-hitler themed restaurant in kharghar in navi mumbai restaurant cross cafe formerly known as hitlers'' cross or hitler''s cross was an adolf hitler-themed restaurant at kharghar in navi mumbai a satellite city of mumbai the restaurant''s former name hitlers'' cross referred to the swastika and the cross of honour of the german mother symbols of the nazi regime and the restaurant''s interior was decorated in red white and black - the colours of the nazi party',datetime('now')),('Q5188702','Crosskeys Inn','Crosskeys Inn',54.8059,-6.42055,'GB','pub',1801,22.85,'Crosskeys Inn','crosskeys inn pub in ardnaglass county antrim northern ireland thatched pub crosskeys inn is a pub situated in a rural location between portglenone and toome in county antrim northern ireland the pub a grade b1 listed building is thought to have been built around 1740',datetime('now')),('Q5189381','Crown Hotel','Crown Hotel',53.40669,-2.97897,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'Crown Hotel, Liverpool','crown hotel pub in liverpool merseyside england uk pub the crown hotel is a public house on lime street liverpool england it is recorded in the national heritage list for england as a designated grade ii listed building',datetime('now')),('Q5189382','Crown Hotel','Crown Hotel',53.0674,-2.5227,'GB','pub',1580,16.17,'Crown Hotel, Nantwich','crown hotel grade i listed pub in nantwich cheshire england uk pub the crown hotel also known as the crown inn is a timber-framed black-and-white hotel and public house located at 24 high street in the town of nantwich in cheshire england the present building dates from shortly after 1583',datetime('now')),('Q5189405','Crown Liquor Saloon','Crown Liquor Saloon',54.5947,-5.93423,'GB','pub',1849,27.64,'Crown Liquor Saloon','crown liquor saloon pub in belfast county antrim northern ireland pub hotel building the crown liquor saloon also known as the crown bar is a pub in great victoria street in belfast northern ireland refurbished in 1885 and at least twice since it is an outstanding example of a victorian gin palace and one of northern ireland''s best-known pubs',datetime('now')),('Q5189482','Crown and Treaty','Crown and Treaty',51.5499,-0.4841,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Crown and Treaty','crown and treaty pub in uxbridge uk pub the crown and treaty is an historic building on oxford road in uxbridge england dating from 1576 it was the site where charles i and his parliamentary opponents attempted negotiations the treaty of uxbridge between 30 january and 22 february 1645 to end the english civil war',datetime('now')),('Q5190302','Cruz 101','Cruz 101',53.477,-2.2393,'GB','bar',NULL,13.17,'Cruz 101','cruz 101 nightclub and music venue in manchester england lgbtq nightclub cruz 101 better known simply as cruz is a nightclub and music venue situated in manchester''s gay village near canal street england it is one of the most popular and longest-running gay clubs in greater manchester often boasting itself as manchester''s no 1 lgbtq nightclub and entertainment venue',datetime('now')),('Q5194820','Curlers Rest','Curlers Rest',55.8754,-4.2933,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Curlers Rest','curlers rest pub in glasgow scotland pub the curlers rest formerly the curlers tavern is the oldest drinking establishment on byres road glasgow scotland a tavern is said to have been situated at this site since the 17th century when this part of the city was still countryside',datetime('now'));
