 Brennan''s Steakhouse','dickie brennan''s steakhouse restaurant in louisiana united states restaurant dickie brennan''s steakhouse is a steakhouse located in the french quarter of new orleans louisiana the restaurant is part of the dickie brennan family of restaurants and has received various awards from publications such as playboy magazine and maxim magazine',datetime('now')),('Q5276866','Dillard House','Dillard House',34.966598,-83.383737,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Dillard House','dillard house restaurant in georgia usa restaurant the dillard house is a restaurant in dillard georgia known for its family style menu and southern cooking it traces its origins to the 1910s when a j dillard a descendant of john dillard and his wife carrie opened their stone house to boarders',datetime('now')),('Q5278252','Dingo Bar','Dingo Bar',48.8419,2.3284,'FR','restaurant',1923,22.85,'Dingo Bar','dingo bar bar in paris france restaurant the dingo american bar and restaurant at 10 rue delambre in the montparnasse quarter of paris france opened its doors in 1923 most commonly called the dingo bar it was one of the few drinking establishments at the time that was open all night',datetime('now')),('Q5278291','Dingwalls','Dingwalls|ディングウォールズ',51.5413,-0.1458,'GB','pub',1973,19.85,'Dingwalls','dingwalls live music and comedy venue pub event venue theatre building music venue comedy club dingwalls dancehall original name at time of opening is a live music and comedy venue adjacent to camden lock camden in london the building itself is one of many industrial victorian buildings which were put to new use in the 20th century',datetime('now')),('Q5278421','Dinner by Heston Blumenthal','Dinner by Heston Blumenthal',51.502222,-0.16,'GB','restaurant',2011,13.17,'Dinner by Heston Blumenthal','dinner by heston blumenthal restaurant in london england restaurant british cuisine dinner by heston blumenthal is a restaurant in london england created by heston blumenthal menu items are based on historical british dishes which were researched by food historians and through the british library',datetime('now')),('Q5284898','Dixie Travel Plaza','Dixie Travel Plaza',40.3104,-89.169,'US','restaurant',1928,15.0,'Dixie Travel Plaza','dixie travel plaza interstate 55 travel plaza in illinois restaurant the dixie travel plaza previously known as the dixie truck stop and dixie trucker''s home is a large trucker and travel plaza located in mclean illinois on interstate 55 it was established by j p walters and john geske in 1928 on old us route 66 as a small sandwich stand in a truck mechanic''s garage',datetime('now')),('Q5286533','Dobbin House Tavern','Dobbin House Tavern|ドビンズ・ハウス・タヴァーン',39.822222,-77.233056,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Dobbin House Tavern','dobbin house tavern restaurant in pennsylvania restaurant house the dobbin house tavern known also as dobbin house on 89 steinwehr avenue in gettysburg pennsylvania is a tavern which is listed on the national register of historic places it was established in 1776 making it the oldest standing structure in the town limits of gettysburg',datetime('now')),('Q5287722','Dodd-Hinsdale House','Dodd-Hinsdale House',35.780917,-78.644833,'US','restaurant',1887,16.17,'Dodd-Hinsdale House','dodd-hinsdale house raleigh nc nrhp-listed restaurant the dodd-hinsdale house was built in 1879 for the family of the raleigh wake county north carolina city mayor it was constructed in the italianate style with some second empire embellishments',datetime('now')),('Q5288051','Doe Run Inn','Doe Run Inn|دو رن إن',37.959722,-86.121944,'US','pub|restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Doe Run Inn','doe run inn restaurant inn doe run inn is a restaurant inn business two miles southeast of brandenburg kentucky it is within the doe run creek historic district which was placed on the national register of historic places on december 19 1978',datetime('now')),('Q5288708','Dojlidy Brewery','Dojlidy Brewery|Browar Dojlidy',53.1062,23.2036,'PL','brewery',1768,27.64,'Dojlidy Brewery','dojlidy brewery brewery in poland brewery dojlidy brewery polish browar dojlidy ˌbrɔvar dɔjˈlidɨ is a brewery located in białystok poland and owned by kompania piwowarska sa the polish subsidiary of asahi breweries the brewery was modernized between 1997 and 1999 then in 2003 it was purchased by kompania piwowarska sa the dojlidy brewery used to make many different brands of beer after being bought by kompania piwowarska s a their main product is żubr',datetime('now')),('Q5289629','Dolphin Hotel','Dolphin Hotel',50.367127,-4.134935,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Dolphin Hotel, Plymouth','dolphin hotel pub in barbican plymouth devon england uk pub hotel the dolphin hotel is a pub on the barbican in plymouth devon england the building which is known as the dolphin hotel never the dolphin inn is a grade ii listed building',datetime('now')),('Q5293466','Don Saltero''s','Don Saltero''s',51.4839,-0.1661,'GB','cafe',NULL,12.0,'Don Saltero''s','don saltero''s 17th 18th century london coffee house café don saltero''s was a coffee house based in chelsea london founded in 1695 by james salter don saltero''s was distinct from other seventeenth and eighteenth century london coffee houses in that it contained many cabinets of curiosities',datetime('now')),('Q5295759','Dong Phuong Oriental Bakery','Dong Phuong Oriental Bakery|Đông Phương',30.0359,-89.915,'US','bakery|restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Dong Phuong Oriental Bakery','dong phuong oriental bakery vietnamese bakery and restaurant in new orleans louisiana united states restaurant bakery dong phuong oriental bakery vietnamese đông phương literally the orient is a vietnamese retail and wholesale bakery restaurant and catering business in new orleans louisiana it is known for supplying the baguette style bread for many of the city''s restaurants that offer bánh mì or other sandwiches and has its own popular bánh mì counter',datetime('now')),('Q5298742','Dorrian''s Red Hand Restaurant','Dorrian''s Red Hand Restaurant',40.7764,-73.9526,'US','restaurant',1960,13.17,'Dorrian''s Red Hand Restaurant','dorrian''s red hand restaurant irish-american bar in new york city restaurant dorrian''s red hand also known simply as dorrian''s is a famed irish-american bar located at 1616 second avenue at east 84th street on the upper east side of manhattan new york city new york started by irish immigrant james red dog dorrian in 1960 and operated by his son jack the popular hangout became a social pillar for preppy upper east side teenagers college students and young urban professionals',datetime('now')),('Q5302252','Doumar''s Cones and BBQ','Doumar''s Cones and BBQ',36.866394,-76.284843,'US','restaurant',1934,15.0,'Doumar''s Cones and BBQ','doumar''s cones and bbq restaurant in norfolk virginia u s restaurant doumar''s cones and bbq is a norfolk virginia restaurant historically the business operated at the ocean view amusement park',datetime('now')),('Q5303016','Down the Street','Down the Street',40.2174,-74.0038,'US','bar',NULL,12.0,'Down the Street','down the street gay nightclub in new jersey united states gay bar lgbtq nightclub down the street was a gay nightclub in asbury park new jersey united states',datetime('now')),('Q5303728','Doyle''s Cafe','Doyle''s Cafe',42.3065,-71.1073,'US','restaurant',1882,15.0,'Doyle''s Cafe','doyle''s cafe restaurant in boston massachusetts u s restaurant doyle''s cafe was a pub located on washington street in the jamaica plain neighborhood of boston massachusetts united states doyle''s cafe was established in 1882 and is located near the samuel adams brewery',datetime('now')),('Q5303824','Dozen Bake Shop','Dozen Bake Shop',40.4643,-79.9662,'US','restaurant',2006,13.17,'Dozen Bake Shop','dozen bake shop restaurant in the united states restaurant bakery dozen bake shop was a bakery in pittsburgh pennsylvania united states while a variety of baked goods and other dishes were offered cupcakes were dozen''s specialty and featured product',datetime('now')),('Q5307746','Drink