tarting in the summer of 2010',datetime('now')),('Q53228380','Veletržní kino','Veletržní kino|veletržní kino',49.189302,16.582511,'CZ','cafe',1920,22.85,NULL,'veletržní kino theatre building café movie theater',datetime('now')),('Q5323389','Mirth, Marvel and Maud','Mirth, Marvel and Maud',51.586,-0.020434,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Soho Theatre Walthamstow','mirth marvel and maud pub cinema and cultural centre in walthamstow london pub arts center movie theater soho theatre walthamstow formally best-known as walthamstow granada is a grade ii listed building housing a pub cinema and cultural centre in walthamstow london the building is famous for having been frequented by alfred hitchcock during its time as a cinema',datetime('now')),('Q5323585','Ye Olde Trip To Jerusalem','Ye Olde Trip To Jerusalem|Ye Olde Trip To Jerusalem söröző|ジ・オールドトリップ・トゥ・エルサレム',52.9493,-1.15264,'GB','pub',1650,37.07,'Ye Olde Trip to Jerusalem','ye olde trip to jerusalem pub in nottingham nottinghamshire england uk pub ye olde trip to jerusalem is a grade ii listed public house in nottingham england which claims to be the oldest in the country the building rests against castle rock upon which nottingham castle is built and is attached to several caves carved out of the soft sandstone',datetime('now')),('Q5325699','Earl Abel''s','Earl Abel''s',29.488453,-98.447868,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Earl Abel''s','earl abel''s restaurant in san antonio texas restaurant earl abel''s is a popular restaurant in san antonio texas that opened in 1933 and existed at one location at broadway and hildebrand from 1940 until 2006 it has been popular for its diverse menu ranging from fried chicken and rainbow trout to its selection of desserts including german chocolate cake and lemon meringue pie its clientele included the well-to-do from nearby alamo heights businessmen and politicians including congressman henry b gonzalez who got in a fist fight at the restaurant in 1986 with a fellow customer who called him a c',datetime('now')),('Q5327835','East Beach Cafe','East Beach Cafe|East Beach Café',50.8029,-0.532491,'GB','cafe',NULL,19.85,'East Beach Cafe','east beach cafe cafe in littlehampton west sussex café east beach café is a seafront cafe in littlehampton west sussex united kingdom it is owned by jane wood and sophie murray who commissioned designer thomas heatherwick to create an iconic building for the seaside town of littlehampton',datetime('now')),('Q5328297','East End Brewing Company','East End Brewing Company',40.455528,-79.904611,'US','brewery',2008,13.17,'East End Brewing Company','east end brewing company brewery east end brewing company is a pittsburgh brewery according to the pittsburgh post-gazette it is a force in the local beer market owner scott smith founded the brewery after quitting his job with a consumer products company',datetime('now')),('Q5330506','Eastern Suburbs Leagues Club','Eastern Suburbs Leagues Club',-33.8927,151.249,'AU','pub',1961,12.0,'Eastern Suburbs Leagues Club','eastern suburbs leagues club rugby league club in sydney australia pub club eastern suburbs leagues club or ''easts'' as it is now known is a licensed club that was established in 1961 with the purpose of raising revenue to support and promote the eastern suburbs district rugby league football club and rugby league within the eastern suburbs of sydney australia the club describes itself as the home of the sydney roosters',datetime('now'));
