aurant in mexico city mexico restaurant mexican cuisine el bajío is a group of eighteen restaurants in mexico city which are run by carmen ramírez degollado noted for their colorful decoration and traditional cuisine from central mexico which has received awards and praise from notable food experts the restaurant business began in 1972 when carmen''s husband raúl ramírez degollado bought a restaurant selling carnitas in the northwestern borough of azcapotzalco',datetime('now')),('Q5351079','El Coyote Cafe','El Coyote Cafe',34.076,-118.349,'US','restaurant',1931,15.0,'El Coyote Cafe','el coyote cafe mexican restaurant in los angeles restaurant mexican cuisine el coyote cafe is a mexican restaurant in los angeles that opened on march 5 1931 it is most notable for being the location of the final meal of four of the victims of the manson family murders',datetime('now')),('Q5353673','Elbasan Inn','Elbasan Inn|Elbasan-Han|Elbasan Han',40.618222,20.775,'AL','pub',NULL,28.39,'Elbasan Han','elbasan inn historic inn and cultural monument in albania historic site inn hotel elbasan inn is a historic inn in korçë albania it is said to be several centuries old and the oldest hotel in the city',datetime('now')),('Q5353760','Elbo Room','Elbo Room',26.1195,-80.1047,'US','bar',NULL,13.17,'Elbo Room','elbo room bar bar the elbo room is a bar that was established in 1938 at 241 south fort lauderdale beach boulevard fort lauderdale florida and that became a landmark for fort lauderdale beach the bar was featured in the 1960 film where the boys are',datetime('now')),('Q5359767','Eleven Madison Park','Eleven Madison Park|イレブン・マディソン・パーク',40.7417,-73.9872,'US','restaurant',1998,31.46,'Eleven Madison Park','eleven madison park restaurant in nyc restaurant french cuisine eleven madison park is a fine dining restaurant located inside the metropolitan life north building at 11 madison avenue in the flatiron district of manhattan new york city owned by daniel humm hospitality it has held 3 miche