ificant diner for the african american community in north omaha nebraska once known as the black city hall fair deal was located at north 24th & burdette in the near north omaha neighborhood from 1954 - 2003',datetime('now')),('Q5437546','Father''s Office','Father''s Office',34.0292,-118.498,'US','restaurant',1955,12.0,'Father''s Office','father''s office gastropub in santa monica california restaurant gastropub father''s office is a chain of gastropubs located in los angeles county the first father''s office location was opened at 1018 montana avenue in santa monica california and has become famous for the office burger which esquire called one of the best burgers in the world',datetime('now')),('Q54380026','Brauerei Neunspringe Worbis','Brauerei Neunspringe Worbis|Brauerei Neunspringe',51.426389,10.352222,'DE','brewery',1867,22.85,NULL,'brauerei neunspringe worbis brewery business enterprise',datetime('now')),('Q5438058','Fauconberg Arms Inn','Fauconberg Arms Inn',54.1877,-1.18239,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Fauconberg Arms Inn','fauconberg arms inn pub in coxwold york uk pub the fauconberg arms is a 17th-century coaching inn in coxwold a village in north yorkshire england the village and estate were given to the fauconberg family by henry viii the property is still owned by the newburgh priory estate and is named after the earl of fauconberg',datetime('now')),('Q5439634','Feathers Hotel','Feathers Hotel',52.368611,-2.7175,'GB','pub',1863,16.17,'Feathers Hotel, Ludlow','feathers hotel grade i listed hotel in ludlow shropshire england uk pub hotel the feathers hotel is a historic inn in ludlow shropshire its imposing half-timbered frontage was constructed in 1619 over an earlier core for a local lawyer rees jones',datetime('now')),('Q5439653','Feathertick Inn','Feathertick Inn|auberge Feathertick',49.0143,-102.823,'CA','pub',1911,15.0,'Feathertick Inn','feathertick inn building in saskatchewan canada inn the feathertick inn is a designated historic building located in the rural municipality of estevan no 5 saskatchewan canada',datetime('now')),('Q5441450','Feenie''s','Feenie''s',49.2642,-123.1632,'CA','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Feenie''s','feenie''s bistro on west broadway in the kitsilano neighbourhood of vancouver canada restaurant french cuisine feenie''s was a bistro on west broadway in the kitsilano neighbourhood of vancouver british columbia canada it was the casual-dining sister-restaurant to lumière which was located next-door',datetime('now')),('Q5443649','Fentons Creamery','Fentons Creamery',37.827997,-122.250067,'US','restaurant',1894,22.02,'Fentons Creamery','fentons creamery historic ice cream parlor and restaurant restaurant ice cream fentons creamery is a historic ice cream parlor and restaurant located on piedmont avenue in oakland california united states fentons is the state s longest continually operating creamery with a small herd of dairy cows in west marin',datetime('now')),('Q5444130','Fergburger','Fergburger|퍼그버거',-45.0317,168.66,'NZ','restaurant',2000,19.85,'Fergburger','fergburger burger restaurant in new zealand restaurant fergburger is a hamburger restaurant located in queenstown new zealand which specialises in gourmet hamburgers their burgers include those prepared with lamb tofu cod falafel a swine-and-chicken mix and venison',datetime('now')),('Q5445247','Ferrara Bakery and Cafe','Ferrara Bakery and Cafe',40.719,-73.997,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Ferrara Bakery and Cafe','ferrara bakery and cafe new york city restaurant restaurant italian cuisine ferrara bakery and cafe established in 1892 by antonio ferrara claims to be america''s first espresso bar it is located in little italy manhattan new york city and offers italian delicacies',datetime('now'));
INSERT INTO institutions VALUES ('Q5449197','Filomena Ristorante','Filomena Ristorante',38.904417,-77.062611,'US','restaurant',1983,12.0,'Filomena Ristorante','filomena ristorante restaurant in washington d c u s restaurant italian cuisine filomena ristorante is an italian-american restaurant located in the historic neighborhood of georgetown in washington d c it opened along washington''s c&o canal in 1983 fresh pasta is made by filomena''s pasta mamas in the storefront kitchen',datetime('now')),('Q5454943','Fishers Island Club','Fishers Island Club',41.28,-71.9475,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Fishers Island Club','fishers island club country club in new york golf course tennis club beach club the fishers island club is a country club located near the eastern end of fishers island in new york the club includes an eighteen-hole golf course designed by seth raynor that was ranked ninth in the 2023 golf digest list of america''s 100 greatest golf courses',datetime('now')),('Q5455443','Fitger Brewing Company','Fitger Brewing Company',46.792222,-92.090417,'US','brewery',NULL,13.17,'Fitger''s Brewing Company','fitger brewing company brewery in duluth minnesota usa brewery fitger''s brewing company was a beer manufacturer in duluth minnesota united states from 1881 to 1972 the surviving brewery complex stretches for 720 feet 220 m along the lake superior shoreline and east superior street one of duluth''s main roads',datetime('now')),('Q5455720','Fitzroy Tavern','Fitzroy Tavern',51.5186,-0.1347,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'Fitzroy Tavern','fitzroy tavern pub on charlotte street fitzrovia camden london pub the fitzroy tavern is a public house situated at charlotte street in the fitzrovia district of central london england owned by samuel smith old brewery it became famous during a period spanning the 1920s to the mid-1950s as a meeting place for many of london''s artists intellectuals and bohemians such as jacob epstein nina hamnett dylan thomas augustus john and george orwell',