 was the summer residence of prince william henry duke of gloucester and edinburgh 1743 1805 fourth son of frederick prince of wales and brother of king george iii during his recovery from porphyria in 1789 george iii spent some time convalescing there',datetime('now')),('Q5578090','Gokul','Gokul|Гокул',18.922887,72.832115,'IN','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Gokul (restaurant)','gokul pub in mumbai india restaurant gokul is a pub in colaba mumbai located behind the taj mahal palace hotel next to regal cinema it is renowned for its cheap alcoholic beverages mostly beer sold almost at retail value i e',datetime('now')),('Q5579298','Golden Cross','Golden Cross',52.4078,-1.5086,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Golden Cross, Coventry','golden cross pub in coventry west midlands england uk pub the golden cross is one of the oldest pubs in coventry west midlands and one of the longest-established alcohol-serving venues in england',datetime('now')),('Q5579301','Golden Cross','Golden Cross',52.7069,-2.75302,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Golden Cross, Shrewsbury','golden cross public house in shrewsbury england pub the golden cross is a public house in shrewsbury england it is reputed to be the oldest licensed pub in shrewsbury',datetime('now')),('Q5579404','Golden Fleece Inn, York','Golden Fleece Inn, York|Golden Fleece',53.9587,-1.07967,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'Golden Fleece, York','golden fleece inn york grade ii listed public house in york north yorkshire england uk pub the golden fleece is an inn on pavement in york england with a free house pub on the ground floor and four guest bedrooms above it dates back to at least the early 16th century although the present building is a rebuild from around 1840',datetime('now')),('Q5579637','Golden Lion','Golden Lion',52.323148,-0.073228,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Golden Lion, St Ives','golden lion hotel in saint ives huntingdonshire cambridgeshire england uk pub hotel st ives is a medieval market town and civil parish in the huntingdonshire district of cambri