arn it is believed to be one of the oldest of its type in the county and is a grade ii listed building',datetime('now')),('Q5599426','Great Lakes Brewing Company','Great Lakes Brewing Company',41.484456,-81.704392,'US','beer_hall|brewery',1988,13.17,'Great Lakes Brewing Company','great lakes brewing company craft brewery and brewpub in cleveland ohio brewpub microbrewery great lakes brewing company is a brewery and brewpub in cleveland ohio the first brewpub and microbrewery in the state great lakes brewing has been noted as important to cleveland''s local identity and as one of the initial forces behind the revival of the ohio city neighborhood on the near west side',datetime('now')),('Q5601794','Greek Islands','Greek Islands',41.878889,-87.6475,'US','restaurant',1971,19.02,'Greek Islands (restaurant)','greek islands greek restaurant in chicago restaurant greek islands is a restaurant in chicago illinois founded in 1971 by konstantinos koutsogeorgas it is located at 200 s halsted street in the greektown neighborhood to the immediate west of downtown chicago',datetime('now')),('Q5604212','Greenland Brewhouse','Greenland Brewhouse',60.913056,-46.050833,'GL','brewery',NULL,19.02,'Greenland Brewhouse','greenland brewhouse greenland''s first brewery brewery greenland brewhouse was greenland''s first brewery it was located in narsaq in southern greenland and was founded in december 2004',datetime('now')),('Q56053921','Rose Hotel','Rose Hotel',-33.324538,115.637367,'AU','pub',NULL,13.17,'Rose Hotel, Bunbury','rose hotel historic hotel in bunbury western australia pub hotel heritage site the rose hotel is a historic hotel in bunbury western australia both the hotel itself and the adjacent bottle shop are heritage listed buildings',datetime('now')),('Q56062156','Pavyllon','Pavyllon|Le Vistamar',43.73848,7.42597,'MC','restaurant',NULL,12.0,NULL,'pavyllon restaurant in monaco restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q5607449','Grendel''s Den','Grendel''s Den|Grendel’s Den',42.3606,-71.