he restaurant houses more than 50 000 clay smoking pipes making it one of the largest collections in the world',datetime('now')),('Q6383426','Keg Mansion','Keg Mansion',43.6668,-79.3779,'CA','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Keg Mansion','keg mansion building in toronto canada restaurant house the keg mansion is a historic house in toronto ontario that is presently used a location by the keg restaurant chain the building was initially known as euclid hall',datetime('now')),('Q6385886','Kelly''s Cellars','Kelly''s Cellars',54.599,-5.932,'GB','pub',1799,22.85,'Kelly''s Cellars','kelly''s cellars pub in belfast county antrim northern ireland pub kelly''s cellars is a pub in belfast northern ireland situated at 30 bank street in the city centre built on 14 march 1720 it is one of the oldest pubs of belfast',datetime('now')),('Q63860198','Pivovar Jindřichov ve Slezsku','Pivovar Jindřichov ve Slezsku',50.2528,17.537364,'CZ','brewery',NULL,12.0,NULL,'pivovar jindřichov ve slezsku brewery',datetime('now')),('Q638862','Ardencaple Hotel Including Former Stables, Rhu Road Lower, Rhu','Ardencaple Hotel Including Former Stables, Rhu Road Lower, Rhu|Ardencaple Hotel',56.0135,-4.76441,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,NULL,'ardencaple hotel including former stables rhu road lower rhu pub in rhu helensburgh uk pub hotel cottage',datetime('now'));
