age dating from 1832 it was originally two adjoining but independent breweries hardy''s brewery and hanson''s brewery which merged in 1930',datetime('now')),('Q6410842','King''s Arms','King''s Arms',51.755082,-1.254286,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'King''s Arms, Oxford','king''s arms public house in oxford england pub the king''s arms colloquially known as the ka is one of the main student pubs in oxford england it claims to be the oldest pub in oxford',datetime('now')),('Q6410862','King''s Carriage House','King''s Carriage House',40.7756,-73.954,'US','restaurant',1995,12.0,'King''s Carriage House','king''s carriage house new york new york restaurant new american cuisine king''s carriage house is a new american cuisine restaurant tea room and wine bar located at 251 east 82nd street between second avenue and third avenue on the upper east side in manhattan in new york city it opened in 1995',datetime('now')),('Q6410961','King''s Head Inn','King''s Head Inn',51.8165,-0.813592,'GB','pub',NULL,24.64,'King''s Head Inn, Aylesbury','king''s head inn pub in aylesbury buckinghamshire england uk historic house museum pub the king''s head is one of the oldest public houses with a coaching yard in the south of england it is located in the market square aylesbury buckinghamshire and is a grade ii listed building',datetime('now')),('Q6411344','King Cole Bar','King Cole Bar',40.7613,-73.9744,'US','bar',NULL,12.0,'King Cole Bar','king cole bar cocktail lounge in new york city cocktail lounge the st regis new york is a luxury hotel at 2 east 55th street at the southeast corner with fifth avenue in the midtown manhattan neighborhood of new york city',datetime('now')),('Q6412141','King William Ale House','King William Ale House',51.4516,-2.59474,'GB','pub',1670,16.17,'King William Ale House','king william ale house pub in king street bristol united kingdom pub the king william ale house is a historic public house situated on king street in bristol england it dates from 1670 and was originally part of a row of three houses',datetime('now')),('Q6412177','King and Queen, Brighton','King and Queen, Brighton',50.8246,-0.1371,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'King and Queen, Brighton','king and queen brighton public house in brighton england pub the king and queen also known as ye olde king and queen and the king and queen hotel is a pub in the seaside resort of brighton part of the city of brighton and hove the present building a striking architectural pantomime by the prolific local firm clayton & black dates from the 1930s but a pub of this name has stood on the site since 1860 making it one of the first developments beyond the boundaries of the ancient village',datetime('now')),('Q6412283','King of Prussia Inn','King of Prussia Inn',40.084444,-75.382778,'US','pub',NULL,13.17,'King of Prussia Inn','king of prussia inn inn in pennsylvania united states of america inn the king of prussia inn is a historic tavern in king of prussia pennsylvania it was listed on the national register of historic places in 1975',datetime('now')),('Q6412869','Kings Arms','Kings Arms|Kings Arms, Woolwich',51.4874,0.0561,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'Kings Arms, Woolwich','kings arms pub in woolwich greenwich london uk pub the woolwich pub bombing was an attack by the provisional irish republican army on the kings arms a public house in woolwich in southeast london on 7 november 1974 two people were killed in the explosion',datetime('now')),('Q6413911','Kinkead''s','Kinkead''s',38.900556,-77.045083,'US','restaurant',1993,12.0,'Kinkead''s','kinkead''s american restaurant american restaurant kinkead''s an american brasserie was a fine dining restaurant in washington d c open from 1993 to 2012 named for its chef and owner bob kinkead primarily featuring seafood and new american cuisine',datetime('now')),('Q6413949','Kinky Gerlinky','Kinky Gerlinky',51.5109,-0.1303,'GB','bar',1984,12.0,'Kinky Gerlinky','kinky gerlinky lgbtq nightclub kinky gerlinky was an influential british clubnight that began in 1989 at the legends nightclub in london england it was hosted by fashion impresarios michael and gerlinde costiff and co-hosted by winn austin',datetime('now')),('Q641473','Café de Fornos, Madrid','Café de Fornos, Madrid|Café de Fornos',40.417981,-3.699533,'ES','cafe',NULL,19.85,NULL,'café de fornos madrid café',datetime('now')),('Q6415895','Kirkwood Inn & Saloon','Kirkwood Inn & Saloon',38.7027,-120.072,'US','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Kirkwood Inn & Saloon','kirkwood inn & saloon restaurant and bar in kirkwood california restaurant the kirkwood inn & saloon also known as kirkwood station or kirkwood''s is a restaurant and bar located in kirkwood california united states it''s situated at the intersection of three county lines alpine amador and el dorado counties at 7 800 feet 2 400 m up',datetime('now')),('Q6417960','Kitchen Bar','Kitchen Bar',54.5984,-5.92463,'GB','pub',1899,16.17,'Kitchen Bar','kitchen bar pub in belfast northern ireland pub the kitchen bar is a pub in belfast northern ireland it dates back to 1859 but on 30 july 2004 the original building was demolished to make way for victoria square a shopping centre',datetime('now')),('Q6420169','Klein Paardenburg','Klein Paardenburg',52.297692,4.8994,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Klein Paardenburg','klein paardenburg restaurant in ouderkerk aan de amstel netherlands restaurant french cuisine bistro klein paardenburg was a restaurant in ouderkerk aan de amstel in the netherlands it was a fine dining restaurant that was awarded one michelin star in 1976 and retained that rating until 1979',datetime('now')),('Q6422873','Knockinaam Lodge','Knockinaam Lodge',54.8167,-5.08333,'GB','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Knockinaam Lodge','knockinaam lodge restaurant in dumfries and galloway scotland uk restaurant knockinaam lodge is a hotel and restaurant located about 3 5 miles south of portpatrick dumfries & galloway scotland as of 2008 the restaurant holds one star in the michelin guide',datetime('now')),('Q6426166','Kohvik Moon','Kohvik Moon',59.445183,24.747883,'EE','restaurant',2009,19.02,'Kohvik Moon','kohvik moon restaurant in tallinn estonia restaurant kohvik moon is a restaurant in tallinn estonia located near the viking line harbour the restaurant focuses on slavic food',datetime('now')),('Q6428210','Komatsu','Komatsu|小松 (料亭)',35.275917,139.676667,'JP','restaurant',NULL,24.64,'Komatsu (Japanese restaurant)','komatsu building in yokosuka kanagawa prefecture japan restaurant komatsu 小松 was a japanese restaurant in yokosuka kanagawa japan known as the navy restaurant komatsu it was a preferred eating location for japanese naval officers prior to and following world war ii american navy personnel and those related to the japanese navy also patronized the establishment in significant numbers',datetime('now')),('Q6428315','Komi','Komi',38.910111,-77.038361,'US','restaurant',2003,19.02,'Komi (restaurant)','komi restaurant in washington dc restaurant italian cuisine komi was a restaurant in washington d c operated by chef johnny monis serving italian cuisine and greek cuisine komi was located at 1509 17th st',datetime('now')),('Q6429123','Kong Hans Kælder','Kong Hans Kælder',55.6788,12.5841,'DK','restaurant',1976,24.64,'Kong Hans Kælder','kong hans kælder restaurant in copenhagen denmark restaurant kong hans kælder is a two michelin star restaurant in copenhagen denmark it received the first michelin star awarded to a copenhagen restaurant but lost its star in march 2014',datetime('now')),('Q6430559','KookyCanuck','KookyCanuck',35.1424,-90.0528,'US','restaurant',2005,12.0,'KookyCanuck','kookycanuck restaurant kooky canuck restaurant opened in 2005 in memphis tennessee in the united states it is a family business owned by shawn and lana danko',datetime('now')),('Q6432265','Koriander (restaurant)','Koriander (restaurant)|Koriander|Koriander (étterem)',53.103392,6.098286,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Koriander (restaurant)','koriander restaurant restaurant in drachten netherlands restaurant restaurant koriander is a restaurant in drachten in the netherlands it is a fine dining restaurant that is awarded one michelin star from 1999 till 2018',datetime('now')),('Q6432276','Korilla BBQ','Korilla BBQ',40.75516,-73.97482,'US','restaurant',2010,12.0,'Korilla BBQ','korilla bbq restaurant in new york united states restaurant korilla bbq is a new york city-based lunch dinner truck owned by eddie song that specializes in korean-theme burritos also known as ssams they also serve korean-style tacos',datetime('now')),('Q6433415','Kossar''s Bialys','Kossar''s Bialys',40.7164,-73.9888,'US','restaurant',1936,16.17,'Kossar''s Bialys','kossar''s bialys bakery in new york city restaurant bakery kossar''s bialys kossar''s bialystoker kuchen bakery located at 367 grand street and essex street on the lower east side of manhattan in new york city is the oldest bialy bakery in the united states',datetime('now')),('Q64349041','Celest bar restaurant','Celest bar restaurant',45.761066,4.853839,'FR','restaurant',1977,13.17,NULL,'celest bar restaurant restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q6435055','Kowloon Restaurant','Kowloon Restaurant',42.4678,-71.0249,'US','restaurant',1950,12.0,'Kowloon Restaurant','kowloon restaurant restaurant in saugus massachusetts restaurant kowloon restaurant is a pan-asian restaurant in saugus massachusetts the restaurant serves a range of chinese cantonese and sichuan japanese thai and polynesian and dishes in several themed dining rooms and lounges',datetime('now')),('Q6436508','Krazy Kat Klub','Krazy Kat Klub',38.904,-77.031,'US','bar|cafe',NULL,13.17,'Krazy Kat Klub','krazy kat klub jazz age speakeasy in washington d c café speakeasy lgbtq nightclub the krazy kat klub also known as the kat and throck''s studio was a bohemian coffeehouse and art club near thomas circle in washington d c during the jazz age founded in 1919 by u s army veterans john ledru stiffler and jawne donn allen with the aid of scenic designer cleon throckmorton the back-alley establishment functioned as a speakeasy due to the 1917 sheppard bone-dry act imposing a ban on alcoholic beverages in the nation''s capital',datetime('now')),('Q6445231','Kuo Yuan','Kuo Yuan',51.548,-0.236,'GB','restaurant',1963,12.0,'Kuo Yuan','kuo yuan chinese restaurant on willesden high road willesden london england restaurant the kuo yuan was a chinese restaurant on willesden high road willesden london england which played an important part in the history of chinese cuisine in the uk in particular it was the first restaurant in the uk to serve pekinese dishes including peking duck peking duck is now served at most chinese restaurants in the uk jay rayner of the observer states in 1963 the now communist chinese embassy once again gave the business a boost when a group of chinese restaurateurs managed to convince the ambassador''s c',datetime('now')),('Q64512990','Wirtshaus Schlössl, St. Pankraz am Haunsberg','Wirtshaus Schlössl, St. Pankraz am Haunsberg|Gasthaus St. Pankraz',47.9311,12.98925,'AT','pub',NULL,13.17,NULL,'wirtshaus schlössl st pankraz am haunsberg gasthaus',datetime('now')),('Q6455533','L''Ambroisie','L''Ambroisie|ランブロワジー|ל''אמברוזי',48.8554,2.3643,'FR','restaurant',NULL,24.64,'L''Ambroisie','l''ambroisie restaurant in paris france fine dining restaurant french cuisine l''ambroisie french pronunciation lɑ bʁwazi is a traditional french restaurant in paris france it was founded by danièle and bernard pacaud and is now owned by walter butler of butler industries group',datetime('now')),('Q6455598','L''Arpège','L''Arpège',48.8557,2.317,'FR','restaurant',1986,34.07,'Arpège (restaurant)','l''arpège gourmet restaurant in paris france gourmet restaurant french cuisine arpège french pronunciation aʁpɛʒ arpeggio is a 3 michelin-star french restaurant in paris the chef is alain passard',datetime('now')),('Q6455605','L''As du Fallafel','L''As du Fallafel|ל''אס דו פלאפל',48.857425,2.359072,'FR','restaurant',NULL,24.64,'L''As du Fallafel','l''as du fallafel kosher restaurant in paris france restaurant kosher restaurant l''as du fallafel english the ace of falafel is a kosher middle eastern restaurant located at 34 rue des rosiers in the pletzl jewish quarter of the le marais neighborhood in paris france the restaurant is acclaimed for its falafel sandwich served with eggplant and hummus',datetime('now')),('Q6455614','L''Astrance','L''Astrance|アストランス|Astrance',48.865083,2.289917,'FR','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Astrance','l''astrance restaurant in paris france gourmet restaurant pascal barbot born 7 june 1972 is a french chef his restaurant l''astrance in paris earned one michelin star 2023 a year after the reopening of the restaurant at a new location and has kept the star ever since',datetime('now')),('Q6455617','L''Atelier de Joël Robuchon','L''Atelier de Joël Robuchon',22.281111,114.158056,'CN','restaurant',2006,13.17,'L''Atelier de Joël Robuchon (Hong Kong)','l''atelier de joël robuchon restaurant in hong kong restaurant french cuisine l''atelier de joël robuchon is a formerly three michelin-starred restaurant in hong kong it is located at shops 403-410 4 f the landmark queen''s road central',datetime('now')),('Q6455618','L''Atelier de Joël Robuchon','L''Atelier de Joël Robuchon',51.5131,-0.128333,'GB','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'L''Atelier de Joël Robuchon (London)','l''atelier de joël robuchon restaurant in the city of westminster london restaurant french cuisine l''atelier de joël robuchon was a michelin-starred restaurant in west street covent garden in the city of westminster london the restaurant spanned three floors with the counter on the ground floor the tables and restaurant on the first floor and the salon bar and terrace on the upper floor',datetime('now'));
INSERT INTO institutions VALUES ('Q6455633','L''Autre Pied','L''Autre Pied',51.51824,-0.15208,'GB','restaurant',2007,13.17,'L''Autre Pied','l''autre pied restaurant in london england restaurant french cuisine l''autre pied was a michelin one-star restaurant situated in marylebone in london''s west end in england specialising in french cuisine',datetime('now')),('Q6455662','L''Enclume','L''Enclume|ランクリム',54.2017,-2.9539,'GB','restaurant',2002,13.17,'L''Enclume','l''enclume restaurant in the united kingdom restaurant l''enclume pronounced lɑ klym french for the anvil is a modern british restaurant opened in 2002 in cartmel cumbria england run by the chef simon rogan and his partner penny tapsell l''enclume received a rating of 10 out of 10 five times in the good food guide and was named their top restaurant for the fourth consecutive year in the 2017 guide and placed second in the 2018 guide',datetime('now')),('Q6455693','L''Escargot','L''Escargot',51.513947,-0.131059,'GB','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'L''Escargot (restaurant)','l''escargot french restaurant in london restaurant l''escargot is london''s oldest french restaurant and is also one of the city''s oldest restaurants it is housed in a georgian townhouse on greek street in the heart of the soho district',datetime('now')),('Q6455696','L''Espalier','L''Espalier',42.348333,-71.080833,'US','restaurant',1978,12.0,'L''Espalier','l''espalier restaurant in massachusetts united states restaurant french cuisine l espalier was a french restaurant located in boston massachusetts in the back bay neighborhood adjacent to the mandarin oriental hotel the chef and owner of l''espalier was frank mcclelland who received a james beard foundation award in 2007 for best northeast chef',datetime('now')),('Q6455839','L''Ortolan','L''Ortolan',51.4089,-0.9541,'GB','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'L''Ortolan','l''ortolan restaurant in the united kingdom restaurant french cuisine l''ortolan was a gourmet restaurant in the village of shinfield 6 km 4 mi south of the centre of reading berkshire england the restaurant closed its doors for the final time in august 2024',datetime('now')),('Q6455842','L''Osier','L''Osier|ロオジエ',35.6697,139.7612,'JP','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'L''Osier','l''osier restaurant in japan french restaurant french cuisine l''osier is a michelin guide 3-star classic french cuisine restaurant in chuo-ku tokyo it is located on the second floor of its own two-story building in ginza',datetime('now')),('Q6462022','La Covacha','La Covacha',25.7968,-80.3697,NULL,'restaurant',1989,12.0,'La Covacha','la covacha restaurant in florida united states restaurant la covacha was a restaurant nightclub and live music venue in the doral sweetwater area of west miami-dade florida founded in 1989 by aurelio f rodríguez and his mother teresa rodríguez on the site of a family truck stop it became a prominent latin nightlife venue covered by billboard newsweek and the new york times',datetime('now')),('Q64620771','Herbert Samuel restaurant','Herbert Samuel restaurant|Herbert Samuel restoranı',32.1627,34.797,'IL','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Herbert Samuel restaurant','herbert samuel restaurant restaurant in israel restaurant the herbert samuel restaurant hebrew הרברט סמואל is a kosher fine-dining restaurant in herzliya israel it was established as a branch of a non-kosher restaurant in tel aviv that has since closed',datetime('now')),('Q6462192','La Degustation','La Degustation|La Degustation Bohême Bourgeoise',50.090989,14.425117,'CZ','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'La Degustation','la degustation restaurant in prague restaurant modern cuisine la degustation bohême bourgeoise is a restaurant in prague czech republic located on haštalská street the restaurant offers three menus czech traditional czech-inspired fusion and pan-european which can be combined',datetime('now')),('Q6462920','La Grenouille','La Grenouille',40.759611,-73.975586,'US','restaurant',1962,12.0,'La Grenouille (restaurant)','la grenouille french restaurant in