nie brazier between 1933 and 1968',datetime('now')),('Q6467706','Labworth Café','Labworth Café',51.5118,0.59459,'GB','cafe',NULL,19.85,'Labworth Café','labworth café cafe on canvey island built by ove arup café the labworth restaurant & café is a modernist international style reinforced concrete building overlooking the thames estuary at labworth beach on canvey island essex built in 1932 1933 by ove arup to resemble the bridge of the queen mary it exists as the only building solely designed by the distinguished engineer',datetime('now')),('Q64687115','auberge de Boondael','auberge de Boondael',50.8044,4.392,'BE','pub',NULL,12.0,NULL,'auberge de boondael building in belgium function hall inn',datetime('now')),('Q6469209','Lad in the Lane','Lad in the Lane',52.51475,-1.835314,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Lad in the Lane','lad in the lane pub in birmingham west midlands england uk pub the lad in the lane is a pub in the bromford area of erdington in birmingham england dating to the year 1400 it is considered to be the oldest house and pub in the city although the old crown in digbeth claims to date from 1368 a date which is yet to be confirmed',datetime('now')),('Q6469811','Ladora Savings Bank','Ladora Savings Bank',41.754722,-92.183611,'US','restaurant',2008,13.17,'Ladora Savings Bank','ladora savings bank restaurant in iowa united states of america restaurant the ladora savings bank is a historic structure along u s route 6 in ladora iowa united states constructed in 1920 it was closed when the bank that built it failed in the great depression leaving it to be used by a succession of businesses',datetime('now')),('Q6473070','Lagunitas Brewing Company','Lagunitas Brewing Company|Lagunitas Brewery|Lagunitas|Birra Lagunitas',38.2725,-122.6625,'US','brewery',1993,31.46,'Lagunitas Brewing Company','lagunitas brewing company brewery founded in lagunitas california brewery the lagunitas brewing company founded in 1993 in petaluma california is a subsidiary of heineken international before heineken bought a 50 share of the company in 2015 the company met the definition of a craft brewery',datetime('now')),('Q6473662','Lai Sin''s','Lai Sin''s',52.057122,5.295075,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Lai Sin''s','lai sin''s restaurant in driebergen netherlands restaurant lai sin''s is a defunct restaurant in driebergen-rijsenburg in the netherlands it was a fine dining restaurant that was awarded one michelin star in 1996 and retained that rating until 2008',datetime('now')),('Q64755710','Brewery of the Chateau Litomyšl','Brewery of the Chateau Litomyšl|zámecký pivovar v Litomyšli',49.873016,16.313772,'CZ','brewery',NULL,13.17,NULL,'brewery of the chateau litomyšl cultural monument in litomyšl brewery building',datetime('now')),('Q6478727','Lakefront Brewery, Inc.','Lakefront Brewery, Inc.',43.054683,-87.905105,'US','brewery',1987,13.17,'Lakefront Brewery','lakefront brewery inc milwaukee s first microbrewery to achieve regional craft brewery status brewery lakefront brewery inc is a brewery in milwaukee wisconsin united states',datetime('now')),('Q64800611','La Bombonera (San Juan)','La Bombonera (San Juan)',18.46595,-66.114786,'US','bakery|restaurant',1902,27.64,'La Bombonera (San Juan)','la bombonera san juan san juan restaurant puerto rico founded in 1902 restaurant bakery confectionery store la bombonera is a restaurant founded in 1902 in san juan puerto rico located on 259 san francisco street of old san juan in puerta de tierra it is the third oldest restaurant in puerto rico after la mallorquina founded in 1848 and cafè turull founded in 1816',datetime('now')),('Q6483119','Lancaster Brewing Company','Lancaster Brewing Company',40.043611,-76.298056,'US','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Lancaster Brewing Company','lancaster brewing company brewery brewery the lancaster brewing company is an american brewery restaurant and distillery business located in lancaster pennsylvania',datetime('now')),('Q6484777','Landmark Inn State Historic Site','Landmark Inn State Historic Site',29.354873,-98.874717,'US','pub',1853,16.17,'Landmark Inn State Historic Site','landmark inn state historic site historic place in castroville medina county texas inn texas state historic site the landmark inn state historic site is a historic inn in castroville texas united states it serves the general public as both a state historic site and inn eight overnight rooms',datetime('now')),('Q6484917','Landor Theatre','Landor Theatre',51.4657,-0.1261,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Landor Theatre','landor theatre pub theatre in south london pub theatre building the landor theatre is a pub theatre in clapham south london originally the cage theatre upon its opening in 1994 the landor became upstairs at the landor in 1995 and finally the landor theatre in 1998 following a refit of the building',datetime('now')),('Q64851131','Minipivovar Černý orel','Minipivovar Černý orel',49.298402,17.392333,'CZ','brewery',2013,12.0,NULL,'minipivovar černý orel brewery',datetime('now')),('Q6488471','Lapérouse','Lapérouse',48.8551,2.34159,'FR','restaurant',1766,27.64,'Lapérouse (restaurant)','lapérouse restaurant in paris restaurant lapérouse is a restaurant located at 51 quai des grands augustins in 6th arrondissement of paris france established in 1766 the restaurant was awarded the prestigious 3 michelin stars between 1933 and 1968 although it was briefly 2 stars from 1949 to 1951',datetime('now')),('Q6500075','Laurelhurst Theater','Laurelhurst Theater|Laurelhurst Theater & Pub',45.5229,-122.637,'US','pub',1923,16.17,'Laurelhurst Theater','laurelhurst theater movie theater in the kerns neighborhood in portland oregon united states pub movie theater laurelhurst theater is a movie theater located in the kerns neighborhood in northeast portland oregon known for showing first and second-run films and for serving food and beer the theater was constructed in 1923 with an art deco design',datetime('now')),('Q650340','Westvleteren Abbey','Westvleteren Abbey|abbazia di Westvleteren|abba