s','Poquitos',47.61424,-122.31914,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Poquitos','poquitos restaurant in seattle washington u s restaurant mexican cuisine poquitos is a mexican restaurant in with three locations in the u s state of washington the original restaurant is located in seattle''s capitol hill neighborhood at the intersection of 10th and pike',datetime('now')),('Q65058151','Lakeside Ryōtei in Hsinchu Park','Lakeside Ryōtei in Hsinchu Park|新竹公園湖畔料亭',24.80173,120.97908,'TW','restaurant',NULL,13.17,NULL,'lakeside ryōtei in hsinchu park ryōtei',datetime('now')),('Q65062063','The Village Den','The Village Den',40.738055,-74.001528,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'The Village Den','the village den restaurant owned by antoni porowski restaurant the village den was a restaurant located in the west village neighborhood of new york city previously a neighborhood diner the restaurant was re-designed by antoni porowski and partners eric marx and lisle richards in 2018',datetime('now')),('Q65062524','Two Dollar Radio Headquarters','Two Dollar Radio Headquarters',39.940623,-82.98291,'US','cafe',NULL,12.0,'Two Dollar Radio Headquarters','two dollar radio headquarters independent bookstore coffeehouse and event venue in columbus ohio event venue café independent bookstore two dollar radio headquarters hq is an independent bookstore performance and event space bar coffeehouse and a counter-service vegan café located in the south side neighborhood of ganthers place within thurman square in columbus ohio it opened in september 2017 and is locally owned and operated by eric obenauf publisher of the indie press also based in columbus ohio and brett gregory with eliza wood-obenauf',datetime('now')),('Q65063472','Campanile','Campanile',34.064167,-118.343695,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Campanile (restaurant)','campanile restaurant in los angeles california restaurant california cuisine campanile was a restaurant co-founded by mark peel nancy silverton and manfred krankl which earned acclaim during the 23 years it was in business although its theme was italian the restaurant was notable for its california cuisine',datetime('now')),('Q6506367','LeJeune''s Bakery','LeJeune''s Bakery',29.918056,-91.667778,'US','bakery',NULL,12.0,'LeJeune''s Bakery','lejeune''s bakery bakery lejeune''s bakery is a historic louisiana bakery located and operating at 1510 main street jeanerette opened in 1884 by oscar j lejeune as the old reliable city bakery the building underwent a major remodelling in 1918 when o a lejeune and walter lejeune sr',datetime('now'));
