taurant in the village of sarmeola di rubano 6 kilometres 3 7 mi west of padua italy',datetime('now')),('Q6506674','Le Champignon Sauvage','Le Champignon Sauvage',51.891,-2.08,'GB','restaurant',1987,12.0,'Le Champignon Sauvage','le champignon sauvage restaurant in the united kingdom restaurant le champignon sauvage is a restaurant located in cheltenham gloucestershire england as of 2008 the restaurant holds two stars in the michelin guide',datetime('now')),('Q6506697','Le Chat Qui Pêche','Le Chat Qui Pêche|Le Chat qui pêche',48.853,2.3462,'FR','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Le Chat Qui Pêche','le chat qui pêche parisian jazz club restaurant jazz club defunct organization le chat qui pêche is a parisian jazz club and restaurant founded in the mid-1950s located in a cellar in rue de la huchette in the latin quarter on the left bank of the seine it was run by madame ricard who had been in the french resistance during the war and who looked so small and delicate that people likened her to the ''little sparrow'' edith piaf',datetime('now')),('Q6506699','Le Chateaubriand','Le Chateaubriand',48.8693,2.3713,'FR','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Le Chateaubriand','le chateaubriand restaurant in france restaurant le chateaubriand french pronunciation lə ʃɑtobʁijɑ is a restaurant on avenue parmentier in paris france its chef is iñaki aizpitarte',datetime('now')),('Q6506748','Le Cirque','Le Cirque|מסעדת סירק',40.7613,-73.9675,'US','restaurant',1974,19.02,'Le Cirque','le cirque french restaurant originating in new york city restaurant italian cuisine french cuisine le cirque is a french restaurant that had several locations throughout the new york city borough of manhattan from 1974 to 2018 the new york location is closed with its future status unknown',datetime('now')),('Q65068795','Lúc Lác Vietnamese Kitchen','Lúc Lác Vietnamese Kitchen',45.5169,-122.6754,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Lúc Lắc Vietnamese Kitchen','lúc lác vietnamese kitchen vietnamese restaurant in portland oregon u s restau