Brauerei|Flensburger|Flensborg Bryggeri',54.779056,9.435722,'DE','brewery',1888,48.89,'Flensburger Brauerei','flensburger brauerei brewery in flensburg schleswig-holstein germany brewery flensburger brauerei is a brewery located in flensburg in the bundesland federal state of schleswig-holstein germany it is one of the last country-wide operating breweries not being part of a larger brewery group',datetime('now')),('Q6827573','Thai House restaurant','Thai House restaurant|בית תאילנדי',32.077611,34.768278,'IL','restaurant',1996,13.17,NULL,'thai house restaurant restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q683303','Hürlimann Brewery','Hürlimann Brewery|Brauerei Hürlimann|Brasserie Hürlimann',47.364508,8.525728,'CH','brewery',1836,27.64,'Hürlimann Brewery','hürlimann brewery brewery brewery hürlimann brewery german brauerei hürlimann ag or hürlimann bier was a swiss brewery in zurich switzerland founded in 1836 it became one of the largest and most successful breweries until it ceased operations in 1996',datetime('now')),('Q68339650','RIJKS®','RIJKS®',52.359969,4.885325,NULL,'restaurant',2014,13.17,NULL,'rijks restaurant in amsterdam the netherlands restaurant fine dining restaurant french cuisine',datetime('now')),('Q6836541','Michel Richard Citronelle','Michel Richard Citronelle',38.904889,-77.059611,'US','restaurant',1994,13.17,'Michel Richard Citronelle','michel richard citronelle restaurant in d c united states restaurant french cuisine michel richard citronelle was an american restaurant located in georgetown washington d c the chef and owner of citronelle was james beard award-winning chef michel richard',datetime('now')),('Q6838530','Mickey''s Diner','Mickey''s Diner',44.9475,-93.097778,'US','restaurant',1939,22.85,'Mickey''s Diner','mickey''s diner restaurant in saint paul minnesota us restaurant mickey''s dining car is a classic diner in downtown saint paul minnesota united states designed to resemble a railroad dining car the prefabricated building was constructed in 1937 by the jerry o''mahony diner company of elizabeth new jersey then shipped to saint paul by rail opening in 1939',datetime('now')),('Q68403515','Carnation Cafe','Carnation Cafe',33.811061,-117.919078,'US','restaurant',1955,13.17,'Carnation Cafe','carnation cafe restaurant at disneyland restaurant cuisine of the united states carnation cafe is an american comfort food restaurant located in main street u s a at disneyland in anaheim california in the united states the restaurant opened in 1955 as carnation cafe ice cream parlor',datetime('now')),('Q6842358','Midland Hotel','Midland Hotel|Отель Мидлэнд',54.0722,-2.87538,'GB','pub',1933,31.39,'Midland Hotel, Morecambe','midland hotel hotel in morecambe uk pub hotel the midland hotel is a streamline moderne building in morecambe lancashire england it was built by the london midland and scottish railway lms in 1933 to the designs of architect oliver hill with sculpture by eric gill and murals by eric ravilious subsequently destroyed',datetime('now')),('Q6842960','Midpoint Café','Midpoint Café|Midpoint Cafe',35.271,-102.673,'US','restaurant',1928,22.85,'Midpoint Café','midpoint café restaurant souvenir and antique shop on us route 66 in adrian texas restaurant the midpoint café a restaurant souvenir and antique shop on u s route 66 in adrian texas bills itself as geographically the midway point between los angeles and chicago on historic route 66 signage in adrian proudly declares a 1139-mile distance to each original us 66 endpoint the café''s slogan is when you''re here you''re halfway there',datetime('now')),('Q6843043','Midsummer House','Midsummer House|ミッドサマーハウス',52.2121,0.128428,'GB','restaurant',1998,12.0,'Midsummer House','midsummer house restaurant restaurant midsummer house is a restaurant located in cambridge england on the bank of the river cam it is a victorian house that was transformed into a restaurant in 1986',datetime('now')),('Q684336','Ristorante Cooperativo','Ristorante Cooperativo|Cooperativa italiana',47.3737,8.5281,'CH','restaurant',1905,27.0,'Ristorante Cooperativo','ristorante cooperativo restaurant the ristorante cooperativo colloquially known as coopi is a restaurant in zürich switzerland known for its association with 20th-century left-wing political figures as well as the anti-fascist trade union and italian immigrant movements in switzerland the restaurant''s roots are in the società cooperativa italiana zurigo founded by italian immigrants in 1905 for furthering socialist cooperation',datetime('now')),('Q6849430','Mikell''s','Mikell''s|Mikell’s',40.7937,-73.967,'US','restaurant',1969,24.0,'Mikell''s','mikell''s jazz club in new york city jazz club mikell''s was a jazz club on the corner of 97th street and columbus avenue in new york city run by mike mikell and pat mikell from 1969 to 1991 it was a regular venue for new york''s top studio and session musicians who would turn up for jam sessions with major soul funk and jazz artists visiting the city',datetime('now')),('Q6849999','Mikla Restaurant','Mikla Restaurant|Mikla',41.03105,28.9741,'TR','restaurant',2005,19.02,'Mikla','mikla restaurant restaurant in istanbul turkey restaurant mikla is a contemporary restaurant in istanbul known for its new anatolian kitchens opened in october 2005 mikla is on the top two floors of the marmara pera hotel located in the historical pera region with its view of istanbul',datetime('now')),('Q6853136','HaPil Restaurant','HaPil Restaurant|מסעדת הפיל',32.1225,34.824167,'IL','restaurant',NULL,13.17,NULL,'hapil restaurant restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q6857969','Milk & Honey','Milk & Honey|ミルク&ハニー',51.5137,-0.1366,'GB','bar',NULL,19.02,'Milk & Honey (bar)','milk & honey london cocktail bar cocktail lounge nightclub milk & honey was a cocktail bar originally founded in new york city on 31 december 1999 with another location in soho london founded by sasha petraske the new york location was first located on the lower east side and later moved to the flatiron district',datetime('now')),('Q6857986','Milk Farm Restaurant','Milk Farm Restaurant',38.47551,-121.82128,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Milk Farm Restaurant','milk farm restaurant restaurant in dixon california restaurant milk farm restaurant was a restaurant in dixon california off i-80 that played a part in dixon''s dairy economy during world war ii it was considered to be the city''s landmark',datetime('now')),('Q6858003','Milk Pail Restaurant','Milk Pail Restaurant',42.076667,-88.26,'US','restaurant',1929,16.17,'Milk Pail Restaurant','milk pail restaurant historic restaurant tearoom in unincorporated dundee township kane county illinois united states restaurant the milk pail restaurant formerly known as the country tea room is a historic restaurant tearoom in unincorporated dundee township kane county illinois united states it was originally a farmhouse for increase c bosworth who operated the farm as a creamery',datetime('now')),('Q68587792','Alain Bianchin','Alain Bianchin|Alain Bianchin (restaurant)',50.7935,4.4818,'BE','restaurant',2015,13.17,NULL,'alain bianchin restaurant in belgium restaurant french cuisine',datetime('now'));
