urant mise en place is a restaurant in tampa florida the core of a group of spin-off restaurants in the area named for the french term mise en place the restaurant started in 1986 as a small catering business',datetime('now')),('Q6876226','Miss Bellows Falls Diner','Miss Bellows Falls Diner',43.135,-72.4475,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Miss Bellows Falls Diner','miss bellows falls diner a restaurant in bellows falls vermont usa restaurant bellows falls is one of two incorporated villages located in the town of rockingham in windham county vermont united states it is a 1 4 square miles 3 6 km2 area bounded on the east by the connecticut river and as of the 2020 census the population was 2 747',datetime('now')),('Q6878042','Miss Worcester Diner','Miss Worcester Diner',42.253833,-71.806667,'US','restaurant',1948,22.02,'Miss Worcester Diner','miss worcester diner diner the miss worcester diner or worcester lunch car 812 is a historic diner at 302 southbridge street in worcester massachusetts it was built in 1948 by worcester lunch car company and is located across the street from the company''s now defunct worcester factory',datetime('now')),('Q6880105','Mister C''s','Mister C''s',41.3075,-95.9561,'US','restaurant',1953,13.17,'Mister C''s','mister c''s italian restaurant in north omaha nebraska restaurant italian cuisine mister c''s steak house was a landmark italian restaurant located at 5319 north 30th street in north omaha nebraska after operating for almost 55 years the restaurant closed september 30 2007',datetime('now')),('Q6880607','קפה פילץ','קפה פילץ',32.077354,34.766937,'IL','cafe',1938,15.0,NULL,'קפה פילץ café',datetime('now')),('Q68817014','Källaren Stjärnan','Källaren Stjärnan',59.323472,18.073806,'SE','restaurant',NULL,13.17,NULL,'källaren stjärnan popina',datetime('now')),('Q6884152','Miya''s','Miya''s|米亞壽司',41.3098,-72.9354,'US','restaurant',1982,13.17,'Miya''s','miya''s restaurant in connecticut united states restaurant defunct organization miya''s was a restaurant in new haven connecticut united states credited as the first sustainable sushi restaurant in the world the restaurant was founded by yoshiko lai a japanese nutritionist',datetime('now')),('Q6886217','Mo Gridder''s','Mo Gridder''s',40.8122,-73.8835,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Mo Gridder''s','mo gridder''s restaurant in new york united states restaurant mo gridder''s was a barbecue restaurant and auto repair shop in new york city both the repair shop and bbq truck were owned by fred donnelly',datetime('now')),('Q6888549','Modern Apizza','Modern Apizza',41.3138,-72.9127,'US','restaurant',1934,16.17,'Modern Apizza','modern apizza restaurant in connecticut united states restaurant italian cuisine modern apizza is an american pizza restaurant in new haven connecticut along with frank pepe pizzeria napoletana and sally''s apizza modern forms what is informally referred to by locals as the holy trinity of new haven-style pizza the three pizza parlors are consistently ranked by food critics as some of the best pizza places in the world',datetime('now')),('Q6888636','Modern Diner','Modern Diner',41.868889,-71.386944,'US','restaurant',1940,16.17,'Modern Diner','modern diner restaurant the modern diner is a historic diner in pawtucket rhode island united states',datetime('now')),('Q6889581','Modra Hvezda Dobrany','Modra Hvezda Dobrany|Modrá Hvězda Dobřany',49.655428,13.290082,'CZ','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Modrá Hvězda Dobřany','modra hvezda dobrany czech independent beer brewery from dobřany brewery modrá hvězda dobřany is a small independent czech beer brewery based in the town of dobřany beer has been brewed in dobřany since 1378',datetime('now')),('Q68897683','Flicka','Flicka',51.785,5.3223,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,12.0,NULL,'flicka restaurant in the netherlands restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q6894816','Moishes Steakhouse','Moishes Steakhouse',45.5166,-73.5782,'CA','restaurant',1938,16.17,'Moishes Steakhouse','moishes steakhouse restaurant in quebec canada defunct organization steakhouse moishe''s steakhouse in its original incarnation was one of the oldest restaurants in montreal quebec canada founded in 1938 by moishe lighter it ran in montreal''s the main district for 83 years',datetime('now')),('Q6895120','Abu Hassan','Abu Hassan|אבו חסן|علي كروان أبو حسن',32.05025,34.750861,'IL','restaurant',1972,19.85,'Abu Hassan (restaurant)','abu hassan hummus restaurant in israel restaurant hummus place ali karawan abu hassan hebrew עלי קרוואן אבו חסן arabic علي كروان أبو حسن is one of the oldest and most famous hummus restaurants in israel its original branch is on hadolphin street in jaffa and there are two more branches located on shivtei israel street',datetime('now')),('Q6895798','Jaan Par Andre','Jaan Par Andre|ג''אן',1.293544,103.85349,'SG','restaurant',NULL,12.0,NULL,'jaan par andre restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q6896187','Molinari''s','Molinari''s|Molinari',37.798455,-122.407859,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Molinari''s','molinari''s delicatessen in california united states delicatessen molinari delicatessen is a delicatessen in san francisco california''s north beach established in 1896 making it one of the oldest delis in the united states they make their own brand of salami as p g molinari and sons inc which is sold nationwide and which won a gold medal award in italy',datetime('now')),('Q6897186','Moments','Moments',41.391219,2.166611,'ES','restaurant',2009,19.02,'Moments (restaurant)','moments restaurant in barcelona spain restaurant moments is a michelin starred restaurant in barcelona spain',datetime('now')),('Q6898005','Owl Diner','Owl Diner|Monarch Diner',42.639167,-71.313889,'US','restaurant',1940,22.85,'Monarch Diner','owl diner historic diner in lowell massachusetts united states diner the owl diner formerly known as the monarch diner is a historic diner at 246 appleton street in lowell massachusetts the diner was built by worcester lunch car company as 749 in 1940 and was originally located in waltham massachuse