ing company brew pub and restaurant in savannah georgia restaurant brewpub moon river brewing company was a brew pub restaurant bar and brewing facility located at 21 west bay street in savannah georgia united states',datetime('now')),('Q6908690','Moosewood Restaurant','Moosewood Restaurant',42.441353,-76.498747,'US','restaurant',1973,12.0,'Moosewood Restaurant','moosewood restaurant american restaurant in ithaca new york restaurant moosewood restaurant is an american natural foods restaurant in ithaca new york founded in 1973 in 1978 the founders sold the restaurant to the staff who became the moosewood collective',datetime('now')),('Q6908771','Mopa Breweries, Ltd.','Mopa Breweries, Ltd.',8.136084,5.894589,'NG','brewery',1980,19.02,'Mopa Breweries','mopa breweries ltd mopa breweries ltd is a nigerian brewery founded in 1980 by chief j adewale bello in kogi state nigeria brewery mopa breweries ltd is a nigerian brewery founded in 1980 by chief j adewale bello in kogi state nigeria',datetime('now')),('Q6909177','Moran''s Oyster Cottage','Moran''s Oyster Cottage',53.21094,-8.894935,'IE','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Moran''s Oyster Cottage','moran''s oyster cottage seafood restaurant and pub in kilcolgan ireland restaurant moran''s oyster cottage is a seafood restaurant and pub located at the weir kilcolgan in county galway ireland close to the village of clarinbridge and ten miles south of galway city known for its seafood including oysters and smoked salmon the business has hosted several celebrities',datetime('now')),('Q6915388','Mosca''s','Mosca''s',29.911929,-90.23048,'US','restaurant',1946,15.0,'Mosca''s','mosca''s restaurant in louisiana united states restaurant louisiana creole cuisine mosca''s is a louisiana creole italian restaurant in waggaman louisiana near new orleans operated by the same family since it opened in 1946 it has long been regarded as one of new orleans'' best restaurants known for dishes such as oysters mosca crab salad chicken a la grande and pin