ough alternative yet casual atmosphere with audiences sometimes sitting on the floor while watching bands',datetime('now')),('Q7264737','Pétrus','Pétrus|柏翠莊園餐廳',51.49961,-0.15685,'GB','restaurant',1999,13.17,'Pétrus (restaurant)','pétrus restaurant owned by gordon ramsay restaurant french cuisine pétrus is a restaurant in london which serves modern french cuisine it is located in kinnerton street belgravia and is owned by celebrity chef gordon ramsay''s gordon ramsay restaurants ltd',datetime('now')),('Q7269616','Quay','Quay',-33.8585,151.21,'AU','restaurant',2001,13.17,'Quay (restaurant)','quay restaurant in sydney australia restaurant quay is a restaurant in sydney australia it is owned by leon fink and is run by chef peter gilmore',datetime('now')),('Q7270009','Queen''s Head','Queen''s Head',52.309727,1.518905,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Queen''s Head, Bramfield','queen''s head pub in bramfield suffolk england uk pub the queen''s head is a pub in bramfield suffolk england the pub was formerly known as the skeltons',datetime('now')),('Q7271815','Quidi Vidi Brewing Company','Quidi Vidi Brewing Company|奇地維地釀酒公司',47.581574,-52.676363,'CA','brewery',1996,19.02,'Quidi Vidi Brewing Company','quidi vidi brewing company brewing company in quidi vidi a community enclave in st john''s nl canada brewery business quidi vidi brewing company is a craft brewery in quidi vidi village a neighbourhood of st john''s newfoundland and labrador canada',datetime('now')),('Q7272312','Quinnipiac Brewery','Quinnipiac Brewery',41.303889,-72.893611,'US','brewery',NULL,13.17,'Quinnipiac Brewery','quinnipiac brewery brewery in connecticut united states of america brewery the quinnipiac brewery also known as brewery square is a complex of brick buildings at 19-23 river street in the fair haven neighborhood of new haven connecticut developed beginning in 1892 and operative until the 1930s the complex is a rare example of a late 19th-century large-scale for the time brewery',datetime('now')),('Q727280