urant on the sunset strip in west hollywood california united states adjacent to the border of beverly hills california its address is 9015 sunset boulevard',datetime('now')),('Q7284607','Rainbow Coffee House','Rainbow Coffee House',51.5137,-0.1111,'GB','cafe',NULL,24.0,'Rainbow Coffee House','rainbow coffee house 2nd coffee house in london coffeehouse the rainbow coffee house was a famous coffee house located at 15 fleet street london it was opened by james farr in 1657 becoming london''s second coffee house',datetime('now')),('Q7293657','Rao''s','Rao''s|ラオズ',40.793933,-73.934222,'US','restaurant',1896,22.02,'Rao''s','rao''s restaurant in east harlem new york city restaurant italian cuisine rao''s is an italian-american restaurant founded in 1896 it is located at 455 east 114th street on the corner of pleasant avenue in east harlem or italian harlem new york city',datetime('now')),('Q7295148','Rasoi','Rasoi',51.4916,-0.1615,'GB','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Vineet Bhatia London','rasoi restaurant in london england restaurant vineet bhatia london formerly rasoi was a michelin-starred indian restaurant operated by vineet bhatia in london england as rasoi the restaurant held one star in the michelin guide for 12 years',datetime('now')),('Q7302098','Rebellion Beer Company','Rebellion Beer Company',51.5862,-0.7681,'GB','brewery',NULL,13.17,'Rebellion Beer Company','rebellion beer company british brewery brewery the rebellion beer company in marlow bottom buckinghamshire england is a microbrewery that produces regular and seasonal beers it uses the chalky water of the local chiltern hills which has high levels of minerals and salts',datetime('now')),('Q7303406','Red''s Eats','Red''s Eats',44.0025,-69.6643,'US','restaurant',1938,16.17,'Red''s Eats','red''s eats take-out restaurant in wiscasset maine restaurant red''s eats is a take-out restaurant located in wiscasset maine it is one of the best-known and most-written-about restaurants in the state',datetime('now'));
