s a watermill on the river ver the mill is now powered by a diesel engine',datetime('now')),('Q7305590','Alien Pizza Planet','Alien Pizza Planet',33.810522,-117.916971,'US','restaurant',2018,13.17,'Alien Pizza Planet','alien pizza planet restaurant at disneyland restaurant alien pizza planet is a restaurant located in tomorrowland at disneyland in anaheim california in the united states it is across from the starcade and directly underneath space mountain',datetime('now')),('Q7307975','Regatta Hotel','Regatta Hotel',-27.4825,152.9963,'AU','pub',1874,16.17,'Regatta Hotel','regatta hotel hotel in brisbane australia pub regatta hotel is a heritage-listed hotel at 543 coronation drive on the corner of sylvan road toowong city of brisbane queensland australia it faces the toowong reach of the brisbane river and was named after the rowing regattas held there',datetime('now')),('Q7312396','Renaissance','Renaissance',34.104641,-118.318909,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Renaissance (restaurant)','renaissance restaurant château élysée is a 1920s replica of a 17th-century french-normandy chateau in hollywood california owned by the church of scientology it is the home of celebrity centre international and the manor hotel',datetime('now')),('Q7316080','Restaurant Apicius','Restaurant Apicius|מסעדת אפיקיוס',52.558739,4.656436,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Restaurant Apicius','restaurant apicius dutch michelin-starred restaurant restaurant restaurant apicius is a restaurant located in bakkum castricum in the netherlands it is a fine dining restaurant that is awarded one or two michelin stars from 2002 up until now',datetime('now')),('Q7316081','Restaurant Aquavit','Restaurant Aquavit|Aquavit',40.7608,-73.9722,'US','restaurant',1987,24.0,'Restaurant Aquavit','restaurant aquavit restaurant in the united states restaurant aquavit is a scandinavian restaurant at 65 east 55th street in midtown manhattan new york city in november 2016 an outpost was launched in london by philip hamilton',datetime('now')),('Q7316085','Restaurant Gordon Ramsay','Restaurant Gordon Ramsay|戈登·拉姆齊餐廳',51.4855,-0.162,'GB','restaurant',1998,33.69,'Restaurant Gordon Ramsay','restaurant gordon ramsay restaurant in london united kingdom restaurant french cuisine restaurant gordon ramsay also known as gordon ramsay at royal hospital road is the signature restaurant of the british celebrity chef gordon ramsay at royal hospital road in chelsea london it opened in 1998 and was ramsay''s first solo restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q7316090','Restaurant Nathan Outlaw','Restaurant Nathan Outlaw',50.5942,-4.8287,'GB','restaurant',2007,12.0,'Restaurant Nathan Outlaw','restaurant nathan outlaw restaurant in the united kingdom restaurant seafood restaurant nathan outlaw is a two michelin star restaurant owned and operated by nathan outlaw it has previously been located in marina villa hotel in fowey cornwall and in the st enodoc hotel in rock cornwall',datetime('now')),('Q7316091','Restaurant Nora','Restaurant Nora',38.912806,-77.047389,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Restaurant Nora','restaurant nora restaurant in washington d c restaurant restaurant nora was a restaurant owned by chef nora pouillon in the dupont circle neighborhood of washington d c that opened in 1979 and closed in 2017 it has been reported as america''s first certified organic restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q7316098','Restaurant Vermeer','Restaurant Vermeer|Vermeer',52.376544,4.900633,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,27.86,'Restaurant Vermeer','restaurant vermeer restaurant in amsterdam netherlands restaurant french cuisine restaurant vermeer is a restaurant located in the nh barbizon palace hotel at the prins hendrikkade in amsterdam netherlands it is a fine dining restaurant that received its first michelin star in 1993',datetime('now')),('Q7316104','Restaurante Arroyo','Restaurante Arroyo',19.2875,-99.175556,'MX','restaurant',1940,15.0,'Restaurante Arroyo','restaurante arroyo restaurant in mexico city mexico restaurant mexican c