staurant the royal mail restaurant is a modern australian restaurant in rural dunkeld victoria connected to the royal mail hotel the chef de cuisine is robin wickens who took over from dan hunter in 2013',datetime('now')),('Q7374621','Royal Oak Hotel','Royal Oak Hotel',-33.8557,151.181,'AU','pub',1878,16.17,'Royal Oak Hotel, Balmain','royal oak hotel pub and hotel in balmain australia pub the royal oak hotel is a pub located in balmain a suburb in the inner west region of sydney in the state of new south wales australia the pub has historical links with the union movement and is one of a number of buildings which formed an integral part of the shipbuilding and industrial history of the local area',datetime('now'));
