,datetime('now')),('Q7381088','Russ & Daughters','Russ & Daughters',40.722616,-73.988296,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Russ & Daughters','russ & daughters fine food purveyor appetizing store russ & daughters is an appetizing store that opened in 1914 it is located at 179 east houston street on the lower east side of manhattan new york city',datetime('now')),('Q7382489','Rustic Inn','Rustic Inn',26.06853,-80.169,'US','restaurant',1955,12.0,'Rustic Inn','rustic inn fort lauderdale restaurant restaurant the rustic inn is a restaurant in fort lauderdale florida in the united states it was established in 1955 by henry oreal and his brother-in-law burton wayne mcdonald',datetime('now')),('Q7383537','Rutt''s Hut','Rutt''s Hut',40.827,-74.1237,'US','restaurant',1928,15.0,'Rutt''s Hut','rutt''s hut restaurant in new jersey united states restaurant rutt''s hut is a restaurant in clifton new jersey known for its ripper a deep-fried hot dog customers can also order the dogs ''in-and-out'' style which is only in the hot oil briefly in addition to the weller where the sausage is well-done and the ''cremator'' which is charred black',datetime('now')),('Q73928901','Blue Hill at Stone Barns','Blue Hill at Stone Barns',41.10401,-73.828954,'US','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'Blue Hill at Stone Barns','blue hill at stone barns restaurant in pocantico hills new york restaurant blue hill at stone barns is a restaurant at the stone barns center for food & agriculture in pocantico hills new york the hudson valley restaurant is owned by dan david and laureen barber who also own the new york city family meal at blue hill restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q7398485','SafeHouse','SafeHouse',43.040611,-87.910278,'US','restaurant',1966,12.0,'SafeHouse (restaurant)','safehouse restaurant in milwaukee wisconsin restaurant the safehouse is an american theme-restaurant that was established in 1966 in milwaukee wisconsin filled wall-to-wall with spy memorabilia collected by the founder owner david j baldwin',datetime('now')),('Q7404089','Salem Diner','Salem Diner',42.501111,-70.896389,'US','restaurant',1941,22.85,'Salem Diner','salem diner diner the salem diner is a historic diner in salem massachusetts it is one of two sterling streamliner diners left in massachusetts and still stands at its original location',datetime('now')),('Q7405017','Sally''s Apizza','Sally''s Apizza',41.303,-72.9199,'US','restaurant',1938,16.17,'Sally''s Apizza','sally''s apizza restaurant in new haven connecticut pizzeria italian cuisine sally''s apizza is a new haven style pizzeria chain based in connecticut established in april 1938 their flagship location is in the wooster square neighborhood of new haven connecticut',datetime('now')),('Q7405688','Salon de thé François','Salon de thé François|フランソア喫茶室',35.003333,135.770278,'JP','restaurant',1934,22.85,'Salon de thé François','salon de thé françois cafe in kyoto japan kissaten salon de thé françois is a café in kyoto japan located at nishikiyamachi-dōri-shijō-kudaru shimogyō-ku kyoto the building is one of japan''s registered tangible cultural properties',datetime('now')),('Q7406291','Salumeria Rosi Parmacotto','Salumeria Rosi Parmacotto',40.7721,-73.965,'US','restaurant',2012,12.0,'Salumeria Rosi Parmacotto','salumeria rosi parmacotto italian restaurant in new york city restaurant italian cuisine salumeria rosi is an italian restaurant located at 283 amsterdam avenue near west 73nd street on the upper west side in manhattan in new york city it offers imported meats and cheeses handcrafted pastas classic italian wine and cocktails',datetime('now')),('Q7406293','Salumi','Salumi',47.5997,-122.331,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Salumi (Seattle)','salumi salumeria and restaurant in seattle washington restaurant italian cuisine salumi is a salumeria and restaurant in the pioneer square neighborhood of downtown seattle washington',datetime('now')),('Q7407202','Sam Bond''s Garage','Sam Bond''s Garage',44.0552,-123.109,'US','restaurant',1995,12.0,'Sam Bond''s Garage','sam bond''s garage music venue and pub in whiteaker eugene restaurant sam bonds garage is a music venue and pub in the whiteaker neighborhood of eugene oregon united states it has been voted as one of america''s best bars by esquire',datetime('now')),('Q7409131','Samcheonggak','Samcheonggak|삼청각|三清閣',37.59732,126.98416,'KR','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Samcheonggak','samcheonggak resort in seoul south korea restaurant resort samcheonggak korean 삼청각 is a small korean-style mountainside resort in seongbuk-dong seongbuk district seoul samcheonggak is near cheong wa dae the official residence of the president of south korea so the surrounding forest remained undeveloped during korea''s miraculous economic growth',datetime('now')),('Q74127954','Spazio Pirandello','Spazio Pirandello',-23.551118,-46.651205,'BR','restaurant',NULL,12.0,NULL,'spazio pirandello restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q7420080','Santarpio''s Pizza','Santarpio''s Pizza',42.3727,-71.0353,'US','restaurant',1903,15.0,'Santarpio''s Pizza','santarpio''s pizza pizza shop pizzeria santarpio''s pizza is a restaurant on chelsea street in east boston massachusetts united states established in 1903 as a bakery by frank santarpio it began selling pizza in 1933',datetime('now')),('Q7423790','Sardi''s','Sardi''s|サーディーズ',40.757849,-73.987583,'US','restaurant',1921,31.39,'Sardi''s','sardi''s famous upscale new york restaurant restaurant sardi''s is a continental restaurant located at 234 west 44th street between broadway and eighth avenue in the theater district of manhattan new york city sardi''s opened at its current location on march 5 1927',datetime('now')),('Q7424960','Sasabune','Sasabune|佐々舟',40.7684,-73.9551,'US','restaurant',2006,12.0,'Sasabune','sasabune japanese restaurant in new york city sushi-ya japanese cuisine sasabune is a japanese sushi restaurant located at 401 east 73rd street between first avenue and york avenue on the upper east side of manhattan in new york city the décor of the tiny simple spartan bright restaurant consists of white walls that as the new york times put it have an almost severe lack of adornment',datetime('now')),('Q7429211','Sayers','Sayers',53.569639,-2.425361,'GB','bakery',1912,15.0,'Sayers (bakery)','sayers largest independent retail baker in the north-west of england brick and mortar business bakery sayers the bakers is the largest independent retail baker in the north west of england established in 1912 in liverpool the retailer sells savouries sandwiches and bakery products across over 150 stores from fleetwood in lancashire down to wrexham in wales',datetime('now')),('Q7429453','Saüc','Saüc',41.386975,2.174267,'ES','restaurant',2002,19.02,'Saüc','saüc spanish restaurant restaurant saüc was a michelin starred restaurant in barcelona spain',datetime('now')),('Q7429966','Scandinavian Kitchen','Scandinavian Kitchen',51.5189,-0.1406,'GB','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'ScandiKitchen','scandinavian kitchen restaurant in london england restaurant scandikitchen is a scandinavian delicatessen and grocery store at 61 great titchfield street in the west end of london its menu is based on the smörgåsbord and the danish smørrebrød open sandwich and draws on the scandinavian tradition of uncomplicated food served on rye bread',datetime('now')),('Q7431841','Schmohz','Schmohz',42.91605,-85.54855,'US','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Schmohz','schmohz michigan-based brewery and taproom brewery schmohz brewing company is a brewery and taproom located in grand rapids michigan jim schwerin owner brewer and gabi palmer head brewer until august 2021 are responsible for brewing the beer',datetime('now')),('Q7432744','Schooner Hotel','Schooner Hotel',55.387215,-1.612412,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Schooner Hotel','schooner hotel historic coaching inn in alnmouth northumberland england uk pub hotel the schooner hotel & bar is a grade ii listed 17th century coaching inn and hotel located at 8 northumberland street in the coastal village of alnmouth northumberland england the hotel lies on the main high street and is recognizable by its whitewashed walls and black painted shutters',datetime('now')),('Q7433122','Schwa','Schwa',41.908945,-87.667861,'US','restaurant',2005,12.0,'Schwa (restaurant)','schwa restaurant in chicago illinois usa restaurant schwa is an upscale restaurant run by chef-owner michael carlson and chef de cuisine caleb trahan it is located on ashland avenue in wicker park chicago and is known for its unconventional approach to foodservice',datetime('now')),('Q7434345','Sconyers Bar-B-Que','Sconyers Bar-B-Que',33.40965,-82.033738,'US','restaurant',1956,12.0,'Sconyers Bar-B-Que','sconyers bar-b-que restaurant in augusta georgia united states restaurant sconyers bar-b-que also known as sconyers inc is a southern food and barbecue restaurant located in augusta georgia',datetime('now')),('Q7435526','Scotch Piper Inn','Scotch Piper Inn',53.5364,-2.96,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Scotch Piper Inn','scotch piper inn pub in lydiate merseyside england uk thatched pub the scotch piper inn in lydiate merseyside england is the oldest pub in the historic county of lancashire the building dates from 1320 and is a grade ii listed building',datetime('now')),('Q7439915','Sea Horse','Sea Horse|海马餐馆',60.158889,24.946389,'FI','restaurant',1933,22.02,'Sea Horse (restaurant)','sea horse restaurant in helsinki finland restaurant sea horse is a restaurant in ullanlinna helsinki finland founded in 1934 since its founding it has paid attention to the traditional finnish restaurant culture with both its interior and its menu',datetime('now')),('Q7440791','Sean''s Bar','Sean''s Bar|Sean’s Bar|ショーンズ・バー',53.4228,-7.9422,'IE','pub',900,41.34,'Sean''s Bar','sean''s bar claimed oldest pub in ireland irish pub sean''s bar is a pub in athlone ireland notable for its reputed establishment in ad 900 and claim to being the oldest extant bar in ireland however architectural and archaeological records including the record of monuments and places and the national inventory of architectural heritage date the building to the 17th or 18th century',datetime('now')),('Q7443041','Second Avenue Deli','Second Avenue Deli|מעדניית השדרה השנייה|セカンド・アヴェニュー・デリ',40.7295,-73.9867,'US','restaurant',1954,19.85,'2nd Avenue Deli','second avenue deli restaurant in new york county united states jewish delicatessen the 2nd ave deli is a certified-kosher jewish delicatessen in manhattan new york city it was located in the east village until december 2007 when it relocated to 162 east 33rd street between lexington avenue and third avenue in kips bay',datetime('now')),('Q7446860','Seinpost','Seinpost',52.109103,4.275536,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Seinpost','seinpost restaurant in scheveningen netherlands restaurant french cuisine seinpost is a restaurant located in scheveningen netherlands it is a fine dining restaurant that was awarded one michelin star in the periods 1985-1989 and 2006 present',datetime('now')),('Q7448800','Selsdon Park Hotel','Selsdon Park Hotel',51.3391,-0.0615,'GB','pub',1924,22.02,'Birch Selsdon Hotel','selsdon park hotel pub in south croydon uk pub hotel birch selsdon was a luxury hotel located in selsdon london england it was housed in a country house',datetime('now')),('Q7449501','Seminole Cafe and Hotel','Seminole Cafe and Hotel',25.469361,-80.476389,'US','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'Seminole Cafe and Hotel','seminole cafe and hotel restaurant theatre building seminole cafe and hotel is an historic building located at 55 south flagler avenue in homestead florida united states a mission revival-style and wood-frame vernacular building with one- and two-story sections the structure was originally built in miami in the early 1910s and served as a theater',datetime('now')),('Q7450876','Colonial Gardens','Colonial Gardens|Senning''s Park',38.161306,-85.778805,'US','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'Colonial Gardens','colonial gardens building in w kenwood drive restaurant building colonial gardens is a restaurant complex and local landmark located in the kenwood hill neighborhood of louisville kentucky across new cut road from iroquois park it was formerly an entertainment complex and in its earliest existence a part of senning''s park the site of the first zoo in louisville',datetime('now')),('Q7458172','Seward Community Cafe','Seward Community Cafe',44.962596,-93.241155,'US','cafe|restaurant',1974,19.85,'Seward Community Cafe','seward community cafe collectively run restaurant and cafe in minneapolis minnesota united states restaurant worker cooperative café vegan cuisine the seward community cafe is a collectively run cooperative restaurant in the seward neighborhood of minneapolis minnesota notable for being the oldest worker-run restaurant in the united states since its founding the cafe has been owned and managed by a worker-owner collective of about 10-16 people all of whom start at the same wage and are given the option of becoming a co-owner within six months of starting work',datetime('now')),('Q7459744','Sfäär','Sfäär',59.439722,24.751389,'EE','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Sfäär','sfäär restaurant in tallinn estonia restaurant sfäär meaning sphere was a restaurant and store located at mere puiestee 6e in tallinn estonia it was noted for its nordic cuisine and new estonian cuisine with italian influence using fresh ingredients',datetime('now')),('Q7460891','Shady Glen','Shady Glen',41.7856,-72.4851,'US','restaurant',1948,16.17,'Shady Glen','shady glen historic restaurant in manchester connecticut united states restaurant shady glen officially shady glen dairy stores is a restaurant in manchester connecticut john and bernice rieg opened the first shady glen store near the manchester bolton town line in 1948 and a second store in the manchester parkade shopping center in 1965',datetime('now')),('Q7462808','Shakespeare Public House, Bristol','Shakespeare Public House, Bristol',51.45,-2.5972,'GB','pub',1725,16.17,'The Shakespeare, Bristol','shakespeare public house bristol public house in bristol england pub the shakespeare is a historic pub on prince street in bristol england built in 1725 by the bristol builder john strahan as a pair of attached georgian-style houses it was converted into a pub in 1777 at which time it supplied refreshment to dock workers at the adjoining port',datetime('now'));
