ingston edinburgh scotland there has reputedly been an inn on this site since 1360 although the core of the current building appears to date from the 18th century with later additions and alterations',datetime('now')),('Q7497944','Ship Tavern, London','Ship Tavern, London',51.5172,-0.118889,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Ship Tavern, Holborn','ship tavern london pub in london uk pub the ship tavern is an inn at the western corner of lincoln''s inn fields at the corner of gate street and the little turnstile in london established in 1549 at the height of the english reformation when catholicism became illegal it was used to shelter catholic priests and hold secret catholic services',datetime('now')),('Q7498152','Shipwright''s Arms Hotel','Shipwright''s Arms Hotel',-33.857243,151.195477,'AU','pub',1844,15.0,'Shipwright''s Arms Hotel','shipwright''s arms hotel historic pub in new south wales australia pub the shipwright''s arms is an historic de-licensed pub located in balmain east a suburb in the inner west region of sydney in the state of new south wales australia the former pub looks out across sydney harbour to the sydney harbour bridge and currently houses luxury apartments',datetime('now')),('Q7500236','Sholl''s Colonial Cafeteria','Sholl''s Colonial Cafeteria',38.902222,-77.044444,'US','restaurant',1928,15.0,'Sholl''s Colonial Cafeteria','sholl''s colonial cafeteria restaurant sholl''s colonial cafeteria was a 20th-century washington d c cafeteria-style restaurant that was famous for its popularity among tourists and government workers the restaurant served everyone from united states presidents to the homeless',datetime('now')),('Q7501257','Shopsin''s','Shopsin''s',40.7189,-73.9878,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Shopsin''s','shopsin''s diner formerly located in new york city''s greenwich village diner shopsin''s general store is a diner in new york city known for its extensive menu and the personality of its namesake chef owner kenny shopsin it first opened in the 1970s in the city''s greenwich village neighborhood but is now located in essex market on the lower east side',datetime('now')),('Q7501259','Shopsy''s','Shopsy''s',43.65114,-79.38438,'CA','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Shopsy''s','shopsy''s delicatessen restaurant chain in the greater toronto area and a brand name restaurant shopsy''s is a jewish delicatessen restaurant chain in the greater toronto area and a brand name owned by maple leaf foods for a line of meat products originally a deli in the former toronto jewish area on spadina avenue from 1921 to 1983 it moved to toronto''s entertainment and business districts on yonge and front streets in 1983',datetime('now')),('Q7502273','Shorty''s Lunch','Shorty''s Lunch',40.1722,-80.2467,'US','restaurant',1932,16.17,'Shorty''s Lunch','shorty''s lunch restaurant in washington pennsylvania restaurant hot dog shorty''s lunch is a washington pennsylvania-based hot dog lunch counter a local landmark shorty''s lunch was opened by shorty contorakes it s been owned by the alexas family since the 1930s',datetime('now')),('Q7505014','Shun Lee Palace','Shun Lee Palace|シュン・リー・パレス',40.7594,-73.9691,'US','restaurant',1971,12.0,'Shun Lee Palace','shun lee palace restaurant in new york city new york restaurant shun lee palace is a chinese restaurant located at 155 east 55th street between lexington avenue and third avenue in midtown manhattan in new york city it claims to be the birthplace of orange beef',datetime('now')),('Q7507429','Sichuan Food','Sichuan Food|四川饭店',52.366478,4.890547,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,24.0,'Sichuan Food (restaurant)','sichuan food restaurant in amsterdam netherlands restaurant sichuan food is a sichuan cuisine restaurant in amsterdam netherlands it was a fine dining restaurant that was awarded one michelin star in 1993 and retained that rating until 2005',datetime('now')),('Q7508492','Sidetrack Bar & Grill','Sidetrack Bar & Grill',42.245826,-83.608838,'US','restaurant',1850,16.17,'Sidetrack Bar & Grill','sidetrack bar & grill bar & restaurant in ypsilanti michigan restaurant sidetrack bar and grill is a restaurant on the east end of depot town in ypsilanti michigan at 56 east cross street it is just down the road from eastern michigan university and is a popular hangout for students and faculty',datetime('now')),('Q7512579','Sign of the Kiwi','Sign of the Kiwi',-43.6064,172.645,'NZ','cafe',NULL,13.17,'Sign of the Kiwi','sign of the kiwi rest house café house the sign of the kiwi originally called toll house is a small café and shop at dyers pass on the road between christchurch and governors bay it was built in 1916 17 by harry ell as a staging post and opened as a tearoom and rest house',datetime('now')),('Q7512860','Signatures Restaurant','Signatures Restaurant',38.894,-77.0235,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Signatures (restaurant)','signatures restaurant restaurant formerly owned by washington lobbyist jack abramoff restaurant signatures was a restaurant in washington d c opened by jack abramoff in february 2002 expensive and lavishly appointed with expensive memorabilia villeroy & boch chargers and christofle flatware signatures was used by abramoff in coordination with his skyboxes and foreign trips to spend money primarily given by indian tribes on politicians',datetime('now')),('Q751293','Café Procope','Café Procope|Καφέ Λε Προκόπ|café Procope|קפה פרוקופ|カフェ・プロコップ|Кафе Прокоп|普罗可布咖啡馆|카페 프로코프',48.853056,2.33875,'FR','cafe|restaurant',1686,57.41,'Café Procope','café procope restaurant in rue de l''ancienne comédie 6th arrondissement of paris restaurant café the café procope french pronunciation kafe pʁokɔp also known as le procope lə pʁokɔp on the rue de l''ancienne comédie is a café in the 6th arrondissement of paris the original café was opened in 1686 by the sicilian chef procopio cutò also known by his italian name francesco procopio dei coltelli and his french name françois procope it became a hub of the parisian artistic and literary community in 18th and 19th centuries',datetime('now')),('Q7516379','Silver Star Cafe','Silver Star Cafe',-20.311945,118.576667,'AU','restaurant',2010,13.17,'Silver Star Cafe','silver star cafe restaurant in port hedland australia restaurant the silver star cafe is a restaurant in the west end of port hedland western australia its kitchen and lounge area are housed within a historic preserved railway carriage and it has an alfresco deck alongside',datetime('now')),('Q75227536','Flo''s V8 Cafe','Flo''s V8 Cafe',33.805495,-117.919011,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,NULL,'flo''s v8 cafe restaurant at disney california adventure park restaurant cuisine of the united states',datetime('now')),('Q752482','Gundel','Gundel|Гундель|restaurant Gundel|Gundel étterem|Restaurant Gundel|贡德勒餐厅|מסעדת גונדל',47.517417,19.077306,'HU','restaurant',1910,46.25,'Gundel','gundel restaurant in budapest restaurant gundel is a well-known restaurant located in the budapest city park hungary',datetime('now')),('Q7526265','Sir Charles Napier Inn','Sir Charles Napier Inn',51.6789,-0.896667,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Sir Charles Napier Inn','sir charles napier inn pub in spriggs alley oxfordshire uk pub gastropub gastropub the sir charles napier inn commonly known as the sir charles napier or simply the charles napier is a gastropub in spriggs alley about 1 5 miles 2 4 km south of chinnor oxfordshire england it was built in the early 19th century and is named along with several other english pubs after general sir charles james napier 1782-1853',datetime('now')),('Q7529814','Sir William Wallace Hotel','Sir William Wallace Hotel|威廉·華萊士爵士飯店',-33.8534,151.182,'AU','pub',1879,16.17,'Sir William Wallace Hotel','sir william wallace hotel historic pub in the suburb of balmain new south wales australia pub the sir william wallace hotel is a heritage-listed pub building in the suburb of birchgrove on the balmain peninsula in the inner west of sydney new south wales australia the pub itself closed for restoration and redevelopment in 2019 and remains closed as of may 2026',datetime('now')),('Q7533033','Sixteen','Sixteen',41.888972,-87.626583,'US','restaurant',2008,19.85,'Sixteen (restaurant)','sixteen restaurant on the sixteenth floor of the trump international hotel and tower chicago restaurant cuisine of the united states sixteen was an american restaurant on the sixteenth floor of the trump international hotel and tower in the near north side community area of chicago it was one of three food and dining options in the hotel''s room service offering',datetime('now')),('Q7537148','SkyBar','SkyBar|スカイバー',34.09442,-118.3742,'US','bar',NULL,12.0,'SkyBar','skybar bar and lounge inside the mondrian hotel in los angeles california bar nightclub the skybar or skybar is a bar and lounge inside the mondrian hotel in los angeles california it was opened in december 1996 by rande gerber',datetime('now')),('Q7540896','Slippery Noodle Inn','Slippery Noodle Inn|Posada de fideos resbaladizos',39.7617,-86.1586,'US','bar|restaurant',1850,22.85,'Slippery Noodle Inn','slippery noodle inn music venue and bar in indianapolis indiana restaurant bar music venue the slippery noodle inn is a large blues bar and restaurant with two performance stages in downtown indianapolis indiana it also has the distinction of being the oldest continuously operating bar in the state of indiana having opened in 1850 as the tremont house',datetime('now')),('Q7541375','Sloppy Joe''s Bar, Havana','Sloppy Joe''s Bar, Havana|Sloppy Joe''s Bar (La Habana)|Sloppy Joe''s Bar',23.139499,-82.35803,'CU','pub',1917,31.39,'Sloppy Joe''s Bar, Havana','sloppy joe''s bar havana historic drinking establishment in havana cuba pub historic building sloppy joe''s bar is a historic bar located in havana cuba the bar reopened in 2013 after being closed for 48 years',datetime('now')),('Q7541933','Slow''s Bar BQ','Slow''s Bar BQ',42.3316,-83.0759,'US','restaurant',2005,12.0,'Slows Bar BQ','slow''s bar bq restaurant in michigan united states restaurant slows bar bq is a barbecue