ion hall and maxey block is a brewery established in 1867 in bozeman montana by two german immigrants jacob spieth and charles krug the current building was built in 1882',datetime('now')),('Q7580322','Sprenger Brewery','Sprenger Brewery',40.038611,-76.302778,'US','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Sprenger Brewery','sprenger brewery brewery in pennsylvania united states of america brewery the sprenger brewery also known as the excelsior brewery complex is an historic brewery complex in lancaster lancaster county pennsylvania united states it was listed on the national register of historic places in 1979',datetime('now')),('Q7581512','Spumoni Gardens','Spumoni Gardens',40.5947,-73.9812,'US','restaurant',1939,16.17,'L&B Spumoni Gardens','spumoni gardens new york restaurant restaurant l&b spumoni gardens is an italian-american pizzeria-restaurant in the gravesend neighborhood of brooklyn in new york city originally conceived as an ice and spumoni stand prior to world war ii it grew during the mid-1950s into a full-scale pizzeria known primarily today for its sicilian pizza and ices',datetime('now')),('Q7587862','St. Elmo Steak House','St. Elmo Steak House',39.764817,-86.159645,'US','restaurant',1902,16.17,'St. Elmo Steak House','st elmo steak house restaurant in indianapolis indiana u s steakhouse st elmo steak house is a restaurant in the wholesale district of indianapolis indiana united states',datetime('now')),('Q7587890','St. Erhard','St. Erhard|Пиво St. Erhard|St. Erhard (bière)|圣艾德（啤酒）',49.908889,10.871667,'DE','brewery',NULL,36.34,'St. Erhard (brewery)','st erhard brewery and trademark in bamberg germany beer brand brewery st erhard officially typeset st',datetime('now')),('Q7588869','St. John','St. John|סנט ג''ון (מסעדה)',51.5203,-0.101389,'GB','restaurant',1994,19.85,'St. John (restaurant)','st john restaurant in smithfield london restaurant st john is an english restaurant on st john street in smithfield london',datetime('now')),('Q7595412','St Radegund','St Radegund',52.