borders glasgow and newcastle',datetime('now')),('Q7620542','Stoudt''s Brewery','Stoudt''s Brewery',40.2384,-76.0727,'US','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Stoudt''s Brewery','stoudt''s brewery microbrewery and restaurant in pennsylvania us brewery stoudt''s brewery was a microbrewery and restaurant located in the lancaster county borough of adamstown it was one of the commonwealth''s first microbreweries having been started in 1987 by ed and carol stoudt',datetime('now')),('Q7621234','Strand Palace Hotel','Strand Palace Hotel|ストランド・パレス・ホテル',51.51072,-0.12108,'GB','pub',1909,37.07,'Strand Palace Hotel','strand palace hotel hotel on the strand london england pub hotel the strand palace hotel is a large hotel on the north side of the strand london england positioned close to covent garden aldwych trafalgar square and the river thames',datetime('now')),('Q7621574','Strangers'' Bar','Strangers'' Bar',51.4997,-0.124167,'GB','bar',NULL,12.0,'Strangers'' Bar','strangers'' bar bar in the palace of westminster london england bar the strangers'' bar is one of several bars in the palace of westminster the home of the parliament of the united kingdom situated near the house of commons it is open to members of parliament and officers of parliament their guests and members of parliamentary staff',datetime('now')),('Q7622304','Straub Brewery','Straub Brewery',41.4276,-78.5529,'US','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Straub Brewery','straub brewery brewery in st marys pennsylvania brewery straub brewery is a historic brewery in st marys pennsylvania',datetime('now')),('Q7624069','Strip House','Strip House',40.7343,-73.9934,'US','restaurant',2000,12.0,'Strip House','strip house restaurant strip house is a privately owned american fine-dining chain of steakhouses with locations in new york city and las vegas',datetime('now')),('Q7628208','Studio One','Studio One',34.082671,-118.385907,'US','bar',NULL,19.02,'Studio One (nightclub)','studio one nightclub in west hollywood united states lgbtq nightclub studio one 