,'US','restaurant',1952,12.0,'Summit Inn','summit inn historic u s route 66 roadside diner restaurant the summit inn was a historic u s route 66 roadside diner built in 1952 located at the summit of cajon pass in san bernardino county california the building was destroyed by the blue cut fire on august 16 2016',datetime('now')),('Q7638342','Sun Inn','Sun Inn',52.35972,-2.874333,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Sun Inn','sun inn pub in leintwardine herefordshire england uk pub the sun inn is a grade ii listed parlour pub in leintwardine herefordshire england it is on the campaign for real ale''s national inventory of historic pub interiors',datetime('now')),('Q7639923','Sunee Plaza','Sunee Plaza',12.922654,100.87291,'TH','bar',NULL,24.0,'Sunee Plaza','sunee plaza area of pattaya thailand venue lgbtq nightclub sunee plaza is an area in pattaya known for gay nightlife it is just off soi v c which intersects second road in south pattaya',datetime('now')),('Q7641264','Sunset Grill','Sunset Grill',34.098056,-118.351944,'US','restaurant',1957,12.0,'Sunset Grill (American restaurant)','sunset grill restaurant in west hollywood california restaurant the sunset grill is a restaurant at 7439 sunset boulevard in los angeles california the burger joint neighbors the rock walk at the guitar center and gained fame from the don henley song sunset grill',datetime('now')),('Q7646444','Surly Brewing Company','Surly Brewing Company',45.0429,-93.3242,'US','brewery',2005,13.17,'Surly Brewing Company','surly brewing company brewery in brooklyn center mn usa brewery the surly brewing company is an american craft brewery with facilities in minneapolis and brooklyn center minnesota and initially stood out for primarily canning beers rather than bottling initially available only in and around the minneapolis saint paul metropolitan area the company expanded distribution to include all of minnesota and at least 12 states and several international markets',datetime('now')),('Q7648919','Sushi Saito','Sushi Saito|Sushi Saitō|鮨さいとう',35.6658,139.7394,'JP','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'Sushi Saito','sushi saito japanese cuisine restaurant in minato tokyo sushi-ya japanese cuisine sushi saito 鮨さいとう sushi saitō is a japanese cuisine restaurant in minato tokyo primarily known for serving sushi it had three michelin stars until it chose to stop accepting reservations from the general public',datetime('now')),('Q7648923','Sushi Seki','Sushi Seki|すし石',40.762,-73.9605,'US','restaurant',2002,19.02,'Sushi Seki','sushi seki restaurant in new york united states sushi-ya japanese cuisine sushi seki formerly sushihatsu is a japanese sushi restaurant located at 1143 first avenue between east 62nd street and east 63rd street on the upper east side in manhattan new york city it was established in 2002',datetime('now')),('Q7648927','Sushi Yasuda','Sushi Yasuda|SUSHI YASUDA',40.7512,-73.9736,'US','restaurant',1999,12.0,'Sushi Yasuda','sushi yasuda restaurant in new york united states sushi-ya japanese cuisine sushi yasuda is a japanese sushi restaurant located at 204 east 43rd street between second avenue and third avenue in the midtown east area of manhattan new york city the restaurant was founded in 1999 by its former chef naomichi yasuda of chiba prefecture who returned to japan in january 2011 to open a new restaurant in tokyo sushi bar yasuda',datetime('now')),('Q7648933','Sushi of Gari','Sushi of Gari|スシ・オブ・ガリ',40.7714,-73.9527,'US','restaurant',1997,12.0,'Sushi of Gari','sushi of gari japanese sushi restaurant in new york city sushi-ya japanese cuisine sushi of gari is a japanese sushi restaurant located at 402 east 78th street between first avenue and york avenue on the upper east side of manhattan in new york city it is considered to be a hallmark destination for sushi enthusiasts and is also known as the restaurant frequented by characters max and sean in the 2019 comedy the car crash',datetime('now'));
INSERT INTO institutions VALUES ('Q7653450','Swan Inn','Swan Inn',51.511673,-0.177061,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'Swan Inn, Westminster','swan inn pub in bayswater london pub house the swan inn formerly thought to have been called the saracen''s head is a grade ii listed pub dating back several centuries it is located in the city of westminster at 66 bayswater road london w2',datetime('now')),('Q7654098','E. S. Swayze Drugstore','E. S. Swayze Drugstore',43.166667,-83.524167,'US','restaurant',1874,16.17,'E. S. Swayze Drugstore','e s swayze drugstore building in otisville michigan pharmacy restaurant masonic lodge church building the e s swayze drugstore in otisville michigan united states also known as otisville mason lodge no 401 is a building from 1874',datetime('now')),('Q7655783','Sweetwater Brewery','Sweetwater Brewery',41.528889,-109.468056,'US','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Sweetwater Brewery','sweetwater brewery brewery in wyoming united states of america brewery the sweetwater brewery also known as the green river brewery was built in 1900 in green river wyoming the present structure is the surviving remnant of a three-building complex comprising an office saloon engine house and the present brewery building',datetime('now')),('Q7660869','Sylvia''s Restaurant of Harlem','Sylvia''s Restaurant of Harlem|シルビアズ・レストラン|西爾維亞餐廳',40.808611,-73.9445,'US','restaurant',1962,19.85,'Sylvia''s Restaurant of Harlem','sylvia''s restaurant of harlem restaurant in manhattan new york city restaurant soul food sylvia''s restaurant of harlem often called sylvia''s soul food or just sylvia''s is a soul food restaurant located at 328 malcolm x boulevard between 126th and 127th streets in harlem manhattan new york city founded in 1962 by sylvia woods it sells a line of prepared foods beauty and skin care items cookbooks and a children''s book written by woods',datetime('now')),('Q7674616','Tadich Grill','Tadich Grill',37.7934,-122.399,'US','restaurant',1849,27.64,'Tadich Grill','tadich grill restaurant in san francisco restaurant the tadich grill is an american seafood restaurant located in san francisco california founded in 1849 it is the oldest running restaurant in california',datetime('now')),('Q7680368','Talula''s Table','Talula''s Table',39.8467,-75.7118,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Talula''s Table','talula''s table restaurant talula''s table is a small gourmet market and restaurant in kennett square pennsylvania during the day talula''s table is a gourmet coffee shop and market',datetime('now')),('Q7680476','Tam O''Shanter Inn','Tam O''Shanter Inn|タム・オ・シャンター・イン',34.12547,-118.2642,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Tam O''Shanter Inn','tam o''shanter inn restaurant in los angeles california u s restaurant the tam o''shanter inn colloquially known as the tam is one of los angeles'' oldest restaurants established in 1922 it serves hearty pub fare with a touch of scottish flair and is known for its prime rib and yorkshire pudding',datetime('now')),('Q76834628','Décarie Hot Dogs','Décarie Hot Dogs',45.513611,-73.681389,'CA','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'Décarie Hot Dogs','décarie hot dogs hot dog restaurant in montreal quebec canada restaurant décarie hot dogs founded in 1969 is a diner counter restaurant located on décarie boulevard in the saint-laurent district of montreal quebec canada it specializes in hot dogs and french fries',datetime('now')),('Q7686852','Tartine','Tartine|타르틴',37.7617,-122.424,'US','bakery|restaurant',2002,19.85,'Tartine','tartine american bakery chain restaurant bakery tartine is a small us-based bakery chain as of february 2022 it operates three locations in the san francisco bay area five in los angeles and six in seoul capital area south korea',datetime('now')),('Q7687721','Tastee Diner','Tastee Diner',38.9879,-77.0955,'US','restaurant',1935,16.17,'Tastee Diner','tastee diner franchise of diners in suburban washington d c restaurant tastee diner is a small franchise of diners in the suburban washington d c area established in 1935 there are two tastee diner locations in the us state of maryland bethesda and laurel',datetime('now')),('Q7687751','Tasty Sandwich Shop','Tasty Sandwich Shop',42.3734,-71.1194,'US','restaurant',1916,16.17,'Tasty Sandwich Shop','tasty sandwich shop restaurant in cambridge massachusetts restaurant the tasty sandwich shop often called the tasty was a restaurant that operated from 1916 to 1997 near the intersection of jfk street and brattle street at the center of harvard square in cambridge massachusetts it was housed in the read block building on the site of the home of colonial poet anne bradstreet',datetime('now')),('Q7689027','Restaurante Tavares','Restaurante Tavares|Tavares|タヴァレス',38.711345,-9.143161,'PT','restaurant',1784,22.85,'Tavares (restaurant)','restaurante tavares historic restaurant in lisbon portugal restaurant cultural heritage the tavares is a historic restaurant located in lisbon portugal that has operated continuously since 1784 it is the oldest restaurant in lisbon having operated in the same location though not the same building since this time',datetime('now')),('Q7690498','Taïm','Taïm',40.722,-73.9962,'US','restaurant',2012,12.0,'Taïm','taïm restaurant in new york united states restaurant taïm is a mediterranean fast casual restaurant chain its oldest location is at 45 spring street on the corner of mulberry street in nolita in manhattan new york city',datetime('now')),('Q7691971','Teatro ZinZanni','Teatro ZinZanni',37.805,-122.403,'US','restaurant',1998,13.17,'Teatro ZinZanni','teatro zinzanni circus dinner theater restaurant teatro zinzanni is a circus dinner theater that began in the neighborhood of lower queen anne in seattle washington it has since expanded its operations to san francisco and chicago',datetime('now')),('Q7692929','Ted''s Diner','Ted''s Diner|Ted’s Diner',42.142778,-71.518056,'US','restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Ted''s Diner','ted''s diner diner ted''s diner was a historic diner at 67 main street in milford massachusetts',datetime('now')),('Q7692932','Ted''s Restaurant','Ted''s Restaurant',41.5468,-72.7832,'US','restaurant',1959,12.0,'Ted''s Restaurant','ted''s restaurant hamburger restaurant in meriden connecticut usa restaurant ted''s restaurant is a hamburger restaurant established in 1959 that is known for its steamed cheeseburger its original location is in meriden connecticut in the united states',datetime('now')),('Q7693596','Ted Peters Famous Smoked Fish','Ted Peters Famous Smoked Fish',27.756111,-82.736944,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Ted Peters Famous Smoked Fish','ted peters famous smoked fish restaurant in florida usa restaurant ted peters famous smoked fish is a historic smoked fish and hamburger restaurant in south pasadena florida',datetime('now')),('Q7697201','Telford''s Warehouse','Telford''s Warehouse',53.1933,-2.8987,'GB','pub',1790,16.17,'Telford''s Warehouse','telford''s warehouse grade ii listed pub in chester uk pub telford''s warehouse is a pub and music venue located between raymond street and tower wharf chester cheshire england alongside the shropshire union canal it is recorded in the national heritage list for england as a designated grade ii listed building',datetime('now')),('Q76984918','Greene Man','Greene Man',51.52373,-0.14323,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Greene Man','greene man public house in london pub the greene man is a public house in london''s euston road it was formerly known as the green man and porters bar and before that the farthing pie house or pye house as mutton pies could be bought there for a farthing',datetime('now')),('Q7700028','Tennessee Brewery','Tennessee Brewery',35.133908,-90.062686,'US','brewery',NULL,13.17,'Tennessee Brewery','tennessee brewery brewery in memphis united states of america brewery the tennessee brewery building stands at the intersection of butler and tennessee streets in memphis tennessee it is directly on the bluff overlooking the mississippi river',datetime('now')),('Q7711951','The 5 Point Cafe','The 5 Point Cafe',47.6182,-122.348,'US','restaurant',1929,16.17,'The 5 Point Cafe','the 5 point cafe bar and restaurant in seattle washington u s restaurant the 5 point cafe is a bar and 24-hour cafe in the belltown neighborhood of seattle washington owned by dave meinert it is located by tilikum place and is open since 1929',datetime('now')),('Q7713162','The Alley','The Alley',37.8131,-122.247,'US','bar',1933,15.0,'The Alley (Oakland, California)','the alley american piano bar piano bar the alley is a restaurant and piano bar located in the lake merritt neighborhood of oakland california in the united states it is known for nightly singing by patrons who take the microphone accompanied by a live pianist who also sometimes sings',datetime('now')),('Q7714013','The Apple Pan','The Apple Pan',34.0407,-118.428,'US','restaurant',1947,16.17,'The Apple Pan','the apple pan one of los angeles'' oldest continuing operating restaurants fast-food hamburger restaurant pie shop the apple pan is a restaurant in los angeles opened in 1947 that is locally famous for its hamburgers apple pies served with vanilla ice cream and banana cream pie',datetime('now')),('Q7715644','The Barley Mow, Clifton Hampden','The Barley Mow, Clifton Hampden',51.653675,-1.208877,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Barley Mow, Clifton Hampden','the barley mow clifton hampden pub in long wittenham south oxfordshire england uk thatched pub the barley mow is a historic public house just south of the river thames near the bridge at clifton hampden oxfordshire england',datetime('now')),('Q7715679','The Baron of Beef','The Baron of Beef',52.20895,0.118156,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Baron of Beef','the baron of beef pub in cambridge cambridgeshire england uk pub the baron of beef is a pub in bridge street cambridge england owned by bob jones michael peacock columnist of the town crier gave his former paper the daily mirror a story about chris curry and clive sinclair having a fight there',datetime('now')),('Q7716157','Beaufort Hotel','Beaufort Hotel|The Beaufort Hotel',51.642153,-2.674401,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Beaufort Hotel, Chepstow','beaufort hotel hotel in chepstow monmouthshire wales pub hotel the beaufort hotel in chepstow wales is located at the southeast corner of beaufort square in the town centre it was designated a grade ii listed building in 1975',datetime('now')),('Q7716394','The Bell Inn','The Bell Inn|ベル・イン',52.9536,-1.15237,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Bell Inn, Nottingham','the bell inn grade ii listed pub in nottingham united kingdom pub the bell inn is a pub in nottingham england completed from around 1437 it claims along with ye olde trip to jerusalem and ye olde salutation inn to be the oldest pub in the city',datetime('now')),('Q7716395','The Bell Inn, Long Hanborough','The Bell Inn, Long Hanborough',51.825514,-1.384504,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Bell Inn, Long Hanborough','the bell inn long hanborough pub in hanborough west oxfordshire england uk pub inn the bell inn long hanborough is a former restaurant and public house in the village of long hanborough oxfordshire england the bell borders the grounds of blenheim palace woodstock where sir winston churchill was born',datetime('now')),('Q7716549','The Berghoff','The Berghoff',41.8793,-87.6284,'US','restaurant',1898,16.17,'The Berghoff (restaurant)','the berghoff restaurant restaurant the berghoff restaurant at 17 west adams street near the center of the chicago loop was opened in 1898 by herman joseph berghoff and has become a chicago landmark in 1999 the berghoff won a james beard foundation award in the america''s classics category which honors legendary family-owned restaurants across the country',datetime('now')),('Q7717822','The Big Texan Steak Ranch','The Big Texan Steak Ranch|Big Texan Steak Ranch',35.1941,-101.754,'US','restaurant',1960,28.39,'Big Texan Steak Ranch','the big texan steak ranch restaurant and motel in amarillo texas united states steakhouse the big texan steak ranch is a large steakhouse restaurant and motel located in amarillo texas it is a roadside attraction known for competitive eating',datetime('now')),('Q7718023','The Bingley Arms','The Bingley Arms|ビングリー・アームズ',53.8816,-1.4483,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Bingley Arms','the bingley arms pub in leeds england pub the bingley arms is a public house in bardsey leeds west yorkshire england and claims to be both the oldest surviving business and oldest surviving pub in the united kingdom the current building dates from the 18th century',datetime('now')),('Q7718301','The Black Dog','The Black Dog',41.45439,-70.60011,'US','restaurant',1971,12.0,'The Black Dog (restaurant)','the black dog restaurant restaurant the black dog is a restaurant and tavern in vineyard haven on the island of martha''s vineyard the restaurant was founded in 1971 and became well known for its souvenir t-shirts featuring the logo of the eponymous black dog',datetime('now')),('Q7718526','The Bladebone Inn','The Bladebone Inn',51.4233,-1.1806,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Bladebone Inn','the bladebone inn building in berkshire united kingdom pub the bladebone inn is a public house at chapel row in the civil parish of bucklebury in the english county of berkshire',datetime('now')),('Q7718589','The Blind Beggar','The Blind Beggar',51.52,-0.0569,'GB','pub',NULL,28.39,'The Blind Beggar','the blind beggar pub in whitechapel london pub the blind beggar is a pub in whitechapel road in the east end of london england at the junction with cambridge heath road owing to its location close to whitechapel station the pub is often described as being in whitechapel',datetime('now')),('Q7718721','The Blue Anchor Inn','The Blue Anchor Inn',51.39096,-3.388271,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Blue Anchor Inn','the blue anchor inn public house in wales pub the blue anchor inn is a grade ii listed inn in aberthaw vale of glamorgan south wales',datetime('now')),('Q7719374','The Boot','The Boot',51.5276,-0.124016,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Boot, Cromer Street','the boot public house on cromer street holborn london wc1 pub cromer street is a road in st pancras london in central london england it starts in the west at judd street then goes east ending at gray''s inn road',datetime('now')),('Q7719469','The Botanic Inn','The Botanic Inn',54.58104,-5.93857,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'The Botanic Inn','the botanic inn pub in belfast county antrim northern ireland pub the botanic inn affectionately known as the bot is a bar nightclub situated near botanic gardens in the queen''s quarter of belfast northern ireland owned by the moony hotel group formerly the botanic inn group as of 2016',datetime('now')),('Q7719487','The Bottle Inn','The Bottle Inn',50.79393,-2.883769,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Bottle Inn','the bottle inn pub in marshwood west dorset england uk thatched pub the bottle inn is a 16th-century public house at marshwood in dorset england which hosts the world nettle eating championship it is grade ii listed',datetime('now')),('Q7719582','The Box Tree','The Box Tree|เดอะบอกซ์ทรี|黃楊餐廳',53.9261,-1.82556,'GB','restaurant',1962,24.64,'The Box Tree','the box tree restaurant in ilkley west yorkshire england restaurant french cuisine the box tree is a restaurant in ilkley west yorkshire england it is owned by yorkshire businessman adam frontal',datetime('now')),('Q7719863','The Brass Rail','The Brass Rail',40.738611,-74.030278,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'The Brass Rail (Hoboken, New Jersey)','the brass rail restaurant in new jersey united states restaurant the brass rail is a restaurant in hoboken new jersey united states',datetime('now'));
INSERT INTO institutions VALUES ('Q7720233','The Brocket Arms','The Brocket Arms',51.837464,-0.265942,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Brocket Arms','the brocket arms pub in ayot st lawrence welwyn hatfield hertfordshire england uk pub the brocket arms is a country inn in ayot st lawrence hertfordshire england',datetime('now')),('Q7720472','The Bucket of Blood','The Bucket of Blood',50.1954,-5.414,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Bucket of Blood','the bucket of blood public house in cornwall england uk pub the bucket of blood is a public house in phillack hayle cornwall owned by st austell brewery and currently tenanted by nick and tanya swanson it is thought to be named after an incident where the landlord brought up a bucket of blood from the building''s well',datetime('now')),('Q7720543','The Bull''s Head','The Bull''s Head',51.473788,-0.25106,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Bull''s Head, Barnes','the bull''s head pub in richmond upon thames london england uk pub the bull''s head also known as the bull is a pub in barnes in the london borough of richmond upon thames england it hosts live music in an attached music room that has a seated capacity of 70 people',datetime('now')),('Q7720553','The Bull Hotel','The Bull Hotel',52.5747,-0.2425,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Bull Hotel, Peterborough','the bull hotel hotel in peterborough cambridgeshire england uk pub hotel the bull hotel is a 17th-century aa 4-star hotel in the westgate neighbourhood of peterborough cambridgeshire opposite the queensgate shopping centre the bull hotel a grade ii listed building is the premier hotel in peterborough and is the only aa recognised 4 star hotel in the city centre',datetime('now')),('Q7720554','The Bull Hotel','The Bull Hotel',54.32358,-2.52773,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Bull Hotel, Sedbergh','the bull hotel hotel in sedbergh united kingdom pub hotel the bull hotel formerly the black bull hotel is a 17th-century coaching inn in sedbergh cumbria it is located in a narrow passage parallel with the main street of sedbergh and contains 14 rooms',datetime('now')),('Q7720719','The Bush Inn','The Bush Inn',51.4519,-3.41889,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Bush Inn','the bush inn grade ii listed pub in the united kingdom pub the bush inn is a grade ii listed public house in st hilary near cowbridge vale of glamorgan south wales the current inn dates to the 16th century',datetime('now')),('Q7721243','The Capital Restaurant','The Capital Restaurant',51.5,-0.1616,'GB','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'The Capital Restaurant','the capital restaurant restaurant in london england restaurant the capital restaurant was a restaurant located in the capital hotel in knightsbridge london england the restaurant was established in 1971 and earned a star from the michelin guide under chefs richard shepherd and brian turner',datetime('now')),('Q7721277','The Captain''s Wife','The Captain''s Wife',51.4,-3.19806,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Captain''s Wife','the captain''s wife pub in swanbridge wales pub the captain''s wife is a public house in the former fishing hamlet of swanbridge in sully between barry and penarth vale of glamorgan south wales the pub was established in 1977 from a row of three sea houses',datetime('now')),('Q7721382','The Carlu','The Carlu',43.660929,-79.383302,'CA','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'The Carlu','the carlu auditorium and national historic site in toronto restaurant auditorium the carlu is an historic event space in toronto ontario canada opened in 1930 and known as the eponymous eaton''s seventh floor the venue was restored and reopened in 2003 renamed for its original architect',datetime('now')),('Q7721580','The Castle Inn','The Castle Inn',50.626416,-2.246225,'GB','pub',1600,16.17,'Castle Inn','the castle inn public house in west lulworth dorset england which dates from the 16th century thatched pub inn the castle inn is a public house in west lulworth dorset england which dates from the 16th century it was originally called the green man and later the jolly sailor',datetime('now')),('Q7721614','The Cat''s Whisker','The Cat''s Whisker',51.5121,-0.138611,'GB','cafe',NULL,12.0,'The Cat''s Whisker','the cat''s whisker coffee bar in kingly street soho london café the cat''s whisker was a coffee bar situated at 1 kingly street soho london during the mid-late 1950s the venue was a hub of excitement for london''s young people offering a vibrant mix of spanish dancing live rock ''n roll and skiffle music',datetime('now')),('Q7722052','The Champion of the Thames','The Champion of the Thames',52.207292,0.124412,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Champion of the Thames','the champion of the thames pub in king street cambridge england pub champion of the thames is a pub in king street cambridge england the pub''s name derives from an oarsman who won a sculling race on the thames before moving to cambridge in 1860',datetime('now')),('Q7722189','The Charlotte','The Charlotte',52.6313,-1.1372,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Charlotte','the charlotte leicester pub and concert venue supermarket pub the charlotte was a pub and concert venue in leicester england on the edge of the city centre on oxford street opposite de montfort university it was a nationally recognised music venue on the uk''s ''toilet circuit'' hosting bands such as blur oasis coldplay radiohead the arctic monkeys and kasabian before they found widespread acclaim',datetime('now')),('Q7722295','The Cheese Shop, Louth','The Cheese Shop, Louth',53.36703,-0.00613,'GB','restaurant',2007,12.0,'The Cheese Shop, Louth','the cheese shop louth artisan delicatessen based in louth lincolnshire business delicatessen the cheese shop louth is an artisan delicatessen situated in louth england known for its large selection of artisan foods especially cheese the cheese shop has been featured in national newspapers such as the daily telegraph and its magazine and the guardian local radio and television on bbc lincolnshire and bbc look north and national television episodes in the hairy bikers'' food tour of britain',datetime('now')),('Q7725384','Ye Olde Cock Tavern','Ye Olde Cock Tavern|ジ・オウルディ・コック・タヴァーン',51.5137,-0.110556,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'Ye Olde Cock Tavern','ye olde cock tavern public house on london''s fleet street pub ye olde cock tavern is a grade ii listed public house at 22 fleet street london ec4 it is part of the greene king group',datetime('now')),('Q7726506','The Cluny','The Cluny',54.975006,-1.591658,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Cluny','the cluny live music venue and pub in newcastle upon tyne england warehouse pub music venue the cluny is a 300-capacity live music venue pub and café on lime street in the ouseburn valley area of newcastle upon tyne england based in a former flax spinning mill the cluny occupies part of the wider building at 36 lime street sharing the space with artists offices and recording studios',datetime('now')),('Q7726607','The Coffee Pot','The Coffee Pot',37.2536,-79.9869,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'The Coffee Pot (Roanoke, Virginia)','the coffee pot historic commercial building in virginia united states roadhouse the coffee pot is a historic roadhouse listed on the national register of historic places located in the grandin court neighborhood of the independent city of roanoke virginia u s a completed in 1936 the coffee pot is an example of novelty architecture as its distinctive feature is that of a stucco coffee pot structure that is situated on the roof of the building today this remains as the only active roadhouse located within the roanoke valley',datetime('now')),('Q7726826','The Colony Room','The Colony Room',51.5133,-0.1322,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Colony Room Club','the colony room private member''s drinking club in soho london 1948 2008 pub the colony room club was a private members'' drinking club at 41 dean street soho london it was founded and presided over by muriel belcher from its inception in 1948 until her death in 1979',datetime('now')),('Q7727294','The Concorde Club','The Concorde Club',50.9557,-1.3715,'GB','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'The Concorde Club','the concorde club jazz club in southampton england jazz club the concorde club was launched in 1957 in southampton by jazz aficionado cole mathieson and is the oldest jazz club under the same management in the united kingdom its standing in the uk jazz world has been recognised by the august 2009 award of the inaugural kind of blue plaque following a nationwide vote among jazz followers and musicians organised by the brecon jazz festival',datetime('now')),('Q7727649','The Coronation Tap','The Coronation Tap',51.4552,-2.6227,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Coronation Tap','the coronation tap building in clifton bristol pub the coronation tap is a ciderhouse a pub that specialises in serving cider in the clifton suburb of the english city of bristol the coronation tap or cori to regulars has existed under that name for at least two hundred years',datetime('now')),('Q7727918','The Crab Claw Restaurant','The Crab Claw Restaurant',38.786944,-76.220555,'US','restaurant',1965,12.0,'The Crab Claw Restaurant','the crab claw restaurant restaurant in st michaels maryland restaurant the crab claw is an independently owned restaurant located in st michaels maryland',datetime('now')),('Q7728222','The Crown, Bristol','The Crown, Bristol',51.454167,-2.592778,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Crown, Bristol','the crown bristol pub in city of bristol england uk pub the crown is a historic pub in bristol england near to st nicholas market an area known as the old city the crown was built in the 18th century and is a grade ii listed building',datetime('now')),('Q7728225','The Whitebrook','The Whitebrook',51.7594,-2.68639,'GB','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'The Whitebrook','the whitebrook restaurant in the united kingdom restaurant british cuisine the whitebrook formerly known as the crown at whitebrook is a restaurant with rooms in whitebrook 6 miles 9 7 km south-south-east of monmouth monmouthshire wales near the river wye and the border with england the building is thought to date from the 17th century and by the 19th century it was used as a roadside inn',datetime('now')),('Q7730657','The Donut Hole','The Donut Hole|ザ・ドーナツ・ホール',34.0371,-117.952,'US','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'The Donut Hole','the donut hole landmark bakery in california restaurant the donut hole is a bakery and landmark in la puente california an example of programmatic architecture the building is shaped like two giant donuts through which customers drive to place their orders',datetime('now')),('Q7730896','The Drayton Court','The Drayton Court',51.51412,-0.31941,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Drayton Court','the drayton court hotel and pub in ealing london pub hotel the drayton court is a boutique hotel and pub in ealing west london the former vietnamese revolutionary and statesman hồ chí minh worked in the kitchens in 1914',datetime('now')),('Q7731334','The Eagle','The Eagle|老鹰酒吧',52.204129,0.117954,'GB','pub',NULL,28.39,'The Eagle, Cambridge','the eagle pub in cambridge england pub the eagle formerly known as the eagle and child is a grade ii listed public house in cambridge england which opened in 1667 as a coaching inn it is the second oldest pub in cambridge after the pickerel inn on magdalene street',datetime('now')),('Q7732041','The EndUp','The EndUp',37.777278,-122.403778,'US','bar',NULL,12.0,'The EndUp','the endup nightclub in san francisco california united states lgbtq nightclub the endup is a nightclub in san francisco california opened in 1973 the club is located at 6th street and harrison in the south of market district',datetime('now')),('Q7733163','The Falcon','The Falcon',53.1883,-2.891,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Falcon, Chester','the falcon grade i listed pub in chester cheshire west and chester cheshire england uk pub the falcon is a public house in chester cheshire england it stands on the west side of lower bridge street at its junction with grosvenor road',datetime('now')),('Q7734240','The Fisherman''s Cot','The Fisherman''s Cot',50.8581,-3.51361,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Fisherman''s Cot','the fisherman''s cot pub in bickleigh devon uk pub the fisherman''s cot is an inn on the a3072 road to the northwest of bickleigh near tiverton in northeastern devon it is operated by marston''s inns and lies on the river exe',datetime('now')),('Q7734874','The Fort','The Fort',39.62885,-105.192627,'US','restaurant',1963,19.85,'The Fort (Morrison, Colorado)','the fort listed on the national register of historic places in jefferson county colorado restaurant the fort is a historic restaurant in morrison colorado construction of the structure started in 1961 and was inspired by bent''s fort',datetime('now')),('Q7734981','The Four''s','The Four''s',42.365331,-71.060836,'US','restaurant',1976,12.0,'The Fours','the four''s sports bar restaurant the fours is a sports bar with locations in quincy and norwell massachusetts the now-closed boston location was voted the best sports bar in the united states by sports illustrated in 2005',datetime('now')),('Q7734991','Elevens','Elevens',51.480987,-3.181649,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'The Four Bars Inn','elevens pub in cardiff wales pub the four bars inn was a jazz club and public house in cardiff wales later known as ''dempseys'' and since 2017 ''elevens'' a sports bar and grill the pub was originally called the globe and dates back to 1731',datetime('now')),('Q7735253','The French House','The French House',51.513,-0.132,'GB','pub|restaurant',1910,27.64,'The French House, Soho','the french house pub and dining room at 49 dean street soho london restaurant pub the french house is a pub and dining room at 49 dean street soho london it was previously known as the york minster but was informally called the french pub or the french house by its regulars',datetime('now')),('Q7735292','The Fridge','The Fridge',51.4602,-0.1169,'GB','bar',1981,13.17,'The Fridge (nightclub)','the fridge nightclub in brixton lambeth london england formerly a cinema movie theater lgbtq nightclub the fridge was a nightclub in the brixton area of south london england founded in 1981 by andrew czezowski and susan carrington who had run the roxy during punk music''s heyday in 1977 the fridge closed on 17 march 2010 and has no link with electric brixton which opened in september 2011 and now occupies the building',datetime('now')),('Q7735397','The Fry Bread House','The Fry Bread House',33.494613,-112.060628,'US','restaurant',1992,12.0,'The Fry Bread House','the fry bread house a restaurant in phoenix arizona restaurant the fry bread house is a restaurant in phoenix arizona serving fry bread a native american dish of dough fried in lard crisco or oil which the restaurant serves with various toppings or fillings exact recipes and ingredients vary but those typical of frybread are flour salt and lard reflecting the commodities doled out on the reservations by the u s federal government',datetime('now')),('Q7736161','The George','The George|ذي جورج، دبلن',53.3436,-6.26444,'IE','bar',NULL,24.64,'The George, Dublin','the george lgbt bar in dublin gay bar lgbtq nightclub the george is a lgbtq bar and nightclub on south great george''s street in the city centre of dublin ireland it is one of ireland''s oldest and biggest gay bars and is regarded as the best known gay bar in ireland',datetime('now')),('Q7736175','The George Inn','The George Inn',51.30092,-2.32471,'GB','pub',NULL,24.64,'The George Inn, Norton St Philip','the george inn grade i listed pub in norton st philip somerset united kingdom pub hotel the george inn is a historic establishment in norton st philip in somerset england built in the 14th or 15th century the inn has been designated as a grade i listed building and is one of a number of establishments that claims to be britain''s oldest tavern',datetime('now')),('Q7736887','The Gobbler','The Gobbler',43.0844,-88.7702,'US','restaurant',1967,19.02,'The Gobbler','the gobbler roadside attraction in johnson creek wisconsin supper club hotel the gobbler is a motel supper club and roadside attraction in johnson creek wisconsin united states it was designed in the late 1960s by fort atkinson architect helmut ajango for local poultry processor clarence hartwig and opened in 1967',datetime('now')),('Q7737322','The Goof','The Goof',43.6725,-79.2873,'CA','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'The Goof','the goof restaurant in toronto canada restaurant the goof officially the garden gate restaurant is a well known eatery in the beaches neighbourhood of toronto founded in 1952 it serves canadian chinese cuisine as well as diner fare such as breakfast and hamburgers',datetime('now')),('Q7738264','The Grenadier','The Grenadier',51.5014,-0.1549,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Grenadier','the grenadier tavern in belgravia london england united kingdom pub the grenadier is a public house in belgravia london it was originally built in 1720 as the officers'' mess for the senior infantry regiment of the british army the 1st regiment of foot guards and located in a courtyard of their barracks',datetime('now'));
INSERT INTO institutions VALUES ('Q7738323','The Griswold Inn','The Griswold Inn',41.3516,-72.3868,'US','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Griswold Inn','the griswold inn historic inn in essex connecticut inn hotel the griswold inn is located in essex connecticut and is one of the oldest continuously run inns in the united states it was founded by three brothers in the late 18th century and named after the griswold family of the area and it has been under the stewardship of only six families',datetime('now')),('Q7738651','The Half Moon','The Half Moon',51.4672,-0.220278,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Half Moon, Putney','the half moon putney music venue venue pub music venue the half moon is a public house and music venue in putney london it is one of the city''s longest running live music venues and has hosted live music every night since 1963',datetime('now')),('Q7738677','The Hamburger Wagon','The Hamburger Wagon',39.6417,-84.2889,'US','restaurant',1913,15.0,'The Hamburger Wagon','the hamburger wagon a hamburger joint located on the sidewalk of the market square in miamisburg ohio fast-food hamburger restaurant the hamburger wagon is a hamburger restaurant located on the sidewalk of the market square in miamisburg ohio the establishment was opened in 1913 by sherman cocky porter to help feed red cross workers and residents of miamisburg rebuilding from the great flood',datetime('now')),('Q7738706','The Hand & Flowers','The Hand & Flowers|Hand and Flowers',51.569893,-0.783169,'GB','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'The Hand & Flowers','the hand & flowers restaurant in marlow wycombe buckinghamshire england uk restaurant gastropub british cuisine the hand & flowers is a gastropub in marlow buckinghamshire england that opened in 2005 owned and operated by tom kerridge and his wife beth cullen-kerridge it gained its first michelin star within a year of opening and a second in the 2012 list making it the first pub to hold two michelin stars',datetime('now')),('Q7739428','The Herbfarm','The Herbfarm',47.7331,-122.147,'US','restaurant',1986,12.0,'The Herbfarm','the herbfarm american restaurant restaurant the herbfarm is an american restaurant serving pacific northwest cuisine and an early practitioner of local food this is a philosophy that promotes the growing enjoyment and consumption of foods from a limited region',datetime('now')),('Q7739452','The Heritage Hotel Rockhampton','The Heritage Hotel Rockhampton',-23.3797,150.515,'AU','pub',NULL,12.0,'The Heritage Hotel Rockhampton','the heritage hotel rockhampton in queensland australia pub the heritage hotel is a heritage-listed hotel at 230 quay street rockhampton rockhampton region queensland australia it was designed by john william wilson and built in 1898 by john kerslake evans',datetime('now')),('Q7739721','The Hinds Head','The Hinds Head',51.508231,-0.702145,'GB','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'The Hind''s Head','the hinds head gastropub in bray windsor and maidenhead berkshire england restaurant hotel british cuisine the hind''s head is a gastropub in bray berkshire england dating from the 15th century the building was converted into a restaurant in the 1920s',datetime('now')),('Q7739860','The Hitching Post','The Hitching Post',34.8383,-120.53,'US','restaurant',1952,13.17,'The Hitching Post','the hitching post steakhouse restaurant restaurant steakhouse the hitching post and the hitching post ii are upscale american steakhouse restaurants located in santa barbara county california in california''s central coast region they are best known for their santa maria-style barbecue restaurants popular in the area',datetime('now')),('Q7739906','The Hobbit','The Hobbit',50.9187,-1.3951,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Hobbit, Southampton','the hobbit hobbit themed pub in southampton pub the hobbit is a pub in the bevois valley area of southampton england previously the portswood hotel it was named after j r r tolkien''s book the hobbit in 1989',datetime('now')),('Q7739924','The Hoito','The Hoito',48.432286,-89.23002,'CA','restaurant',1918,22.02,'The Hoito','the hoito restaurant in ontario canada restaurant finnish cuisine the hoito restaurant often referred to as the hoito by locals is a finnish-canadian restaurant in thunder bay ontario canada established in 1918 and housed in the bottom floor of the historic finnish labour temple the hoito operated continuously on 314 bay street in the historic bay & algoma neighbourhood for more than a century until closing due to the covid-19 pandemic in march 2020',datetime('now')),('Q7742075','The Inn at Little Washington','The Inn at Little Washington',38.7135,-78.1595,'US','pub|restaurant',1978,19.85,'The Inn at Little Washington','the inn at little washington award-winning restaurant and inn in washington virginia restaurant inn the inn at little washington is a luxury country inn and restaurant located in washington virginia patrick o''connell and reinhardt lynch founded the inn in a former garage in 1978',datetime('now')),('Q7742782','The Ivy','The Ivy|常春藤餐厅',51.513,-0.128402,'GB','restaurant',1929,16.17,'The Ivy (United Kingdom)','the ivy restaurant in london england fine dining restaurant the ivy is a british restaurant founded in 1917 known for its popularity with celebrities its location in the west end opposite the ambassadors and st martin''s theatres made it popular with actors and theatregoers',datetime('now')),('Q7744069','The Kegs Drive-In','The Kegs Drive-In',47.93,-97.044342,'US','restaurant',1946,15.0,'The Kegs Drive-In','the kegs drive-in restaurant the kegs is a historic drive-in located in grand forks north dakota the restaurant takes the form of two large wooden barrels',datetime('now')),('Q7744453','The Kings Head Hotel','The Kings Head Hotel',53.408803,-4.344717,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The King''s Head, Amlwch','the kings head hotel public house in amlwch wales pub the king''s head amlwch is a public house situated in salem street one of the main streets in amlwch anglesey wales the pub name is one of many king''s heads found all over the united kingdom',datetime('now')),('Q7744782','The Kitchin','The Kitchin|Kitchin',55.977,-3.173,'GB','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'The Kitchin','the kitchin restaurant in edinburgh scotland uk restaurant french cuisine the kitchin is a fine dining restaurant in edinburgh scotland run by tom kitchin and his wife michaela née berseilus it serves fresh scottish produce in a french style from kitchin''s time spent with alain ducasse and guy savoy',datetime('now')),('Q7745280','The Lamb','The Lamb',51.523105,-0.119017,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'The Lamb, Bloomsbury','the lamb pub in bloomsbury london pub the lamb is a grade ii listed pub at 94 lamb''s conduit street in the london borough of camden london the lamb was built in the 1720s and the pub and the street were named after william lamb who repaired the holborn conduit later renamed lamb''s conduit in his honour a few metres to the south in 1577',datetime('now')),('Q7746592','The Ledbury','The Ledbury|Ledbury',51.5167,-0.2001,'GB','pub|restaurant',2005,19.85,'The Ledbury','the ledbury restaurant in the united kingdom restaurant pub british cuisine the ledbury is a restaurant located on ledbury road notting hill london england it held two michelin stars from 2010 until 2021 when it lost them as it shut due to covid-19 restrictions being impractical for the restaurant making it ineligible for assessment by michelin inspectors',datetime('now')),('Q7746900','The Lembeck and Betz Eagle Brewing Company','The Lembeck and Betz Eagle Brewing Company',40.728333,-74.041389,'US','brewery',NULL,13.17,'The Lembeck and Betz Eagle Brewing Company','the lembeck and betz eagle brewing company brewery in jersey city new jersey brewery the lembeck and betz eagle brewing company was founded in 1869 by henry b lembeck and john f betz in jersey city in hudson county new jersey united states the brewery bounded by 9th 10th grove and henderson streets in downtown jersey city developed into one of the most famous best-equipped and financially successful breweries on the east coast of the united states',datetime('now')),('Q7747229','The Lifeboat Inn, Thornham','The Lifeboat Inn, Thornham',52.9611,0.573333,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Lifeboat Inn, Thornham','the lifeboat inn thornham pub in thornham hunstanton uk pub the lifeboat inn is a public house and inn in ship lane thornham norfolk england it lies near the wooded grounds of thornham manor',datetime('now')),('Q7748422','The Lord Crewe Arms Hotel','The Lord Crewe Arms Hotel',54.8481,-2.05455,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Lord Crewe Arms Hotel','the lord crewe arms hotel hotel in blanchland northumberland england uk pub hotel the lord crewe arms hotel is a medieval hotel in blanchland northumberland england it is dated to 1165 and was used as a hiding hole by monks of nearby blanchland abbey for centuries and contains hidden stairways and stone flagged floors',datetime('now')),('Q775071','Arany Kéz Fogadó','Arany Kéz Fogadó',47.494167,19.051667,'HU','pub',NULL,12.0,NULL,'arany kéz fogadó inn',datetime('now')),('Q7751082','The Mermaid Inn','The Mermaid Inn|Posada Mermaid|ザ・マーメイド・イン|美人魚旅館',50.95,0.731389,'GB','pub',NULL,24.64,'The Mermaid Inn, Rye','the mermaid inn inn located in rye east sussex england uk pub inn the mermaid inn is a grade ii listed historical inn located on mermaid street in the ancient town of rye east sussex southeastern england one of the best-known inns in southeast england it was established in the 12th century and has a long turbulent history',datetime('now')),('Q7751278','The Middle East','The Middle East|ذا ميدل إيست',42.3638,-71.1014,'US','restaurant',1970,19.85,'The Middle East (nightclub)','the middle east nightclub and restaurant in cambridge massachusetts u s restaurant music venue the middle east is an entertainment complex consisting of five adjacent dining and live music venues in the central square neighborhood of cambridge massachusetts its three dedicated concert spaces upstairs downstairs and sonia sit alongside zuzu and the corner two restaurants that also host live music',datetime('now')),('Q7752163','The Moon Under Water','The Moon Under Water',53.4828,-2.2469,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Moon Under Water, Manchester','the moon under water pub in manchester england formerly a cinema pub movie theater the moon under water is a pub in manchester city centre england in the building of the former deansgate picture house cinema an abc cinema on deansgate it is one of the largest public houses in the united kingdom the pub is 8 800 square feet 820 m2 and can hold 1 700 customers',datetime('now')),('Q7752602','The Mug House','The Mug House',52.227302,-2.219517,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Mug House','the mug house pub in claines worcestershire england uk pub the mug house is a traditional public house located in the village of claines worcestershire england which dates back to the 15th century',datetime('now')),('Q7752795','The Mustard Seed','The Mustard Seed',52.4755,-8.8668,'IE','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'The Mustard Seed (restaurant)','the mustard seed irish restaurant located in ballingarry county limerick restaurant the mustard seed is an irish restaurant located in ballingarry county limerick it specialises in growing its own ingredients and the proprietor of this restaurant is the celebrity chef and television personality dan mullane',datetime('now')),('Q7753629','The New Inn, Gloucester','The New Inn, Gloucester',51.8654,-2.245,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The New Inn, Gloucester','the new inn gloucester grade i listed pub in the united kingdom pub the new inn 16 northgate street gloucester england is a timber framed building used as a public house hotel and restaurant it is the most complete surviving example of a medieval courtyard inn with galleries in britain and is a grade i listed building',datetime('now')),('Q7754130','The Night and Day Café','The Night and Day Café',53.4825,-2.23528,'GB','bar',1991,13.17,'Night and Day Café','the night and day café café bar music venue in manchester england bar music venue the night and day café is a café bar and live music venue on oldham street in the northern quarter area of manchester city centre england opened in 1991 in a former chip shop it became known for supporting emerging bands and has hosted early performances by several artists who later achieved national and international success',datetime('now')),('Q7754407','The Nosh Bar','The Nosh Bar',51.5112,-0.1343,'GB','restaurant',1944,15.0,'The Nosh Bar','the nosh bar restaurant in london uk restaurant the nosh bar was a salt beef bar at 42 great windmill street london for over forty years opening in 1944 and finally closing in the late 1980s it re-opened in 2008 at 39 great windmill street after an absence of almost 20 years and closed again in september 2012',datetime('now')),('Q7754804','The Old Bell Hotel and Restaurant','The Old Bell Hotel and Restaurant',51.58473,-2.09923,'GB','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'The Old Bell, Malmesbury','the old bell hotel and restaurant grade i listed hotel in malmesbury england restaurant hotel the old bell is a hotel and restaurant in the cotswold market town of malmesbury in wiltshire england the hotel is in the centre of the town immediately next to the 12th-century remains of malmesbury abbey',datetime('now')),('Q7754805','The Old Bell','The Old Bell|ジ・オールド・ベル',51.5385,-0.904551,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Old Bell, Henley on Thames','the old bell pub in henley-on-thames united kingdom pub the old bell is a pub in henley-on-thames oxfordshire it was built in 1325 and is the oldest building in henley',datetime('now')),('Q7754806','The Old Bell Inn','The Old Bell Inn|Posada The Old Bell Inn|The Olde Bell|ジ・オールド・ベル',50.950556,0.731389,'GB','pub',NULL,24.64,'The Olde Bell, Rye','the old bell inn pub in rye rother east sussex england uk pub the olde bell inn also known as ye olde bell is a grade ii listed historical inn in rye east sussex it was built in 1390',datetime('now')),('Q7754813','The Old Bull and Bush','The Old Bull and Bush|オールド・ブル・アンド・ブッシュ',51.567542,-0.182582,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Old Bull and Bush','the old bull and bush pub in hampstead london pub gastropub the old bull and bush is a grade ii listed public house at north end near hampstead heath in london which gave its name to the music hall song down at the old bull and bush sung by florrie forde it is located on north end way',datetime('now')),('Q7754815','The Old Cannon Brewery','The Old Cannon Brewery',52.249612,0.714797,'GB','beer_hall',1999,13.17,'The Old Cannon Brewery','the old cannon brewery pub in bury st edmunds st edmundsbury suffolk england uk brewpub the old cannon brewery is a brewpub in bury st edmunds suffolk uk they have a roster of regular cask ales that are produced year round as well as several popular seasonal beers that are produced at certain times of the year it is one of two breweries in bury st edmunds the other being the greene king brewery',datetime('now')),('Q7754826','The Old Crown','The Old Crown|ジ・オールド・クラウン',52.4747,-1.8836,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Old Crown, Birmingham','the old crown pub in digbeth birmingham west midlands england uk pub the old crown a pub in deritend claims to be one of the oldest extant secular buildings in birmingham england it is grade ii listed and claims to date back to c',datetime('now')),('Q7754838','The Old Duke','The Old Duke',51.452197,-2.59327,'GB','pub',1780,16.17,'The Old Duke, Bristol','the old duke pub in city of bristol england uk pub the old duke is a jazz and blues venue and pub in the english city of bristol live music is played every night of the week admission is free and it hosts an annual jazz festival',datetime('now')),('Q7754896','The Old Queens Head','The Old Queens Head',51.5373,-0.100447,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Old Queens Head','the old queens head grade ii listed pub in the united kingdom pub the old queen''s head is a pub on essex road in islington london n1 its shopfront is scheduled as to be retained by islington council',datetime('now')),('Q7754934','The Old Wellington Inn','The Old Wellington Inn|老惠灵顿客栈',53.484677,-2.244015,'GB','pub',NULL,28.39,'The Old Wellington Inn','the old wellington inn grade ii listed pub in manchester united kingdom pub the old wellington inn is a historic public house in manchester city centre england it is part of shambles square which was created in 1999 and is near manchester cathedral',datetime('now')),('Q7754948','The Olde Bell','The Olde Bell|ジ・オールド・ベル',51.5462,-0.809961,'GB','pub',1500,22.85,'The Olde Bell, Hurley','the olde bell historic hotel and pub in hurley berkshire england uk pub hotel the olde bell is a hotel and public house in hurley berkshire england on the bank of the river thames it is claimed to be the oldest hotel in the uk and one of the oldest hotels in the world',datetime('now')),('Q7754962','The Olive Branch and Beech House','The Olive Branch and Beech House',52.7341,-0.5645,'GB','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'The Olive Branch and Beech House','the olive branch and beech house public house in clipsham rutland england restaurant the olive branch is a public house and restaurant located in the rutland village of clipsham clipsham is close to the a1 near stamford lincolnshire',datetime('now'));
INSERT INTO institutions VALUES ('Q7755341','The Oriental Hotel','The Oriental Hotel',-33.6995,150.568,'AU','pub',1891,16.17,'The Oriental Hotel','the oriental hotel pub in new south wales australia pub the oriental hotel also known as the ori and formerly known as the springwood hotel is a heritage-listed pub located in springwood a suburb of the blue mountains west of sydney new south wales australia',datetime('now')),('Q7755783','The Oxford Bar','The Oxford Bar',55.953,-3.20468,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Oxford Bar','the oxford bar pub in city of edinburgh scotland uk pub the oxford bar is a public house situated on young street in the new town of edinburgh scotland the pub is notable for having been featured in sir ian rankin''s inspector rebus series of novels and its adaptations in which it is protagonist john rebus'' favourite pub',datetime('now')),('Q7755878','The Paddock Club','The Paddock Club',35.6085,-77.3807,'US','bar',NULL,12.0,'The Paddock Club','the paddock club lgbtq nightclub in greenville north carolina lgbtq nightclub the paddock club was a dance night club located at 1008-b dickinson avenue in greenville north carolina that catered primarily to the gay and lesbian community of greenville and all of eastern north carolina the club was in operation for 30 years and 6 months from june 1973 until december 23 2003 and was at the time it closed the oldest continuously operating lgbt club in the state',datetime('now')),('Q7755959','The Palm','The Palm|ザ・パーム',40.7516,-73.9711,'US','restaurant',1926,15.0,'The Palm (restaurant)','the palm restaurant chain originating in new york city restaurant the palm is an international chain of american fine-dining steakhouses that began in 1926 the original location was in new york city at 837 second avenue between east 44th street and east 45th street in manhattan',datetime('now')),('Q7756442','The Peak Lookout','The Peak Lookout|舊山頂餐廳',22.271111,114.149444,'CN','restaurant',1888,27.64,'The Peak Lookout','the peak lookout restaurant in hong kong restaurant fusion cuisine the peak lookout is a restaurant located in a heritage house at victoria gap near the summit of victoria peak on hong kong island hong kong it is housed in a 19th-century grade ii historic building',datetime('now')),('Q7756670','The Perch','The Perch',51.765713,-1.28723,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Perch, Binsey','the perch grade ii listed pub in binsey oxfordshire england uk thatched pub inn the perch is a historic public house in the village of binsey oxfordshire england northwest of oxford and close to the river thames overlooking port meadow',datetime('now')),('Q7757303','The Pitman Vegetarian Hotel','The Pitman Vegetarian Hotel',52.4829,-1.89392,'GB','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'The Pitman Vegetarian Hotel','the pitman vegetarian hotel hotel in birmingham england hotel vegetarian restaurant the pitman vegetarian hotel was a hotel that operated from 1898 until the 1930s in the county buildings now grade ii listed 159 corporation street birmingham england as an expansion of the pitman vegetarian restaurant established in 1896 on the same site',datetime('now')),('Q7757526','The Plough and Stars','The Plough and Stars',42.368222,-71.108844,'US','bar',1969,12.0,'The Plough and Stars','the plough and stars bar and music venue in cambridge massachusetts bar music venue the plough and stars is a bar and music venue in cambridge massachusetts it was founded in 1969 by brothers peter and padraig o''malley named after the play of the same name by seán o''casey',datetime('now')),('Q7758051','The Premises Studios','The Premises Studios',51.5312,-0.071583,'GB','cafe',1986,12.0,'The Premises Studios','the premises studios recording studio and café in haggerston london uk café recording studio the premises studios is a music studio complex based near haggerston in hackney london the studio complex contains 10 commercial rehearsal studio spaces one acoustic recording studio one mixing studio and various private long-let rooms and office spaces',datetime('now')),('Q7758738','The Punch Bowl','The Punch Bowl',51.509104,-0.149458,'GB','pub',1750,16.17,'The Punch Bowl, Mayfair','the punch bowl pub in mayfair london pub the punch bowl at 41 farm street mayfair is a public house dating from circa 1750 it is listed as grade ii by english heritage',datetime('now')),('Q7759129','The Quorum','The Quorum',29.9631,-90.0592,'US','cafe',NULL,12.0,'The Quorum (coffee house)','the quorum new orleans coffee house famous for being a seat of racial integration during the 60s café the quorum was a coffee house in new orleans known as a model for multicultural exchange in the politically and racially charged atmosphere of the 1960s it became a frequent target of segregationist harassment in new orleans after it opened to persons from all racial backgrounds in 1963',datetime('now')),('Q7759245','The Radium Beerhall','The Radium Beerhall',-26.162639,28.08425,'ZA','pub',NULL,12.0,'The Radium Beerhall','the radium beerhall bar in south africa pub the radium beerhall is the oldest surviving bar and grill house in johannesburg it is located on the corner of louis botha avenue and 9th street in orange grove',datetime('now')),('Q7759907','The Red Onion','The Red Onion',39.1881,-106.819,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'The Red Onion','the red onion restaurant opened in 1892 in aspen colorado restaurant the red onion is a restaurant located on east cooper avenue in aspen colorado united states it is the oldest restaurant in the city housed in a three-story red brick italianate building dating to the late 19th century',datetime('now')),('Q7759935','The Red Shoe','The Red Shoe',46.072519,-61.391017,'CA','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'The Red Shoe','the red shoe restaurant in mabou nova scotia canada restaurant the red shoe pub is a restaurant located in mabou nova scotia canada open seasonally it has been operated by canadian musical group the rankin family since may 2005 and is a regular host to both local and visiting celtic musicians',datetime('now')),('Q7760021','The Refinery','The Refinery',27.994,-82.4594,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'The Refinery','the refinery restaurant in florida restaurant the refinery was a restaurant in seminole heights florida in the united states it was owned by michelle and greg baker who offer a weekly menu that includes molecular gastronomy and regional fare using ingredients such as tangerine juice fennel fish acorn squash with bacon and beurre blanc',datetime('now')),('Q776004','U zlatého tygra','U zlatého tygra|Aranytigris söröző|Gyllene tigern|U Zlatého Tygra|U Zlatého tygra',50.085898,14.418005,'CZ','pub',NULL,28.39,NULL,'u zlatého tygra building in prague pub house',datetime('now')),('Q7760329','The Restaurant at Meadowood','The Restaurant at Meadowood',38.5222,-122.467,'US','restaurant',1979,12.0,'The Restaurant at Meadowood','the restaurant at meadowood michelin guide 3-star restaurant located in napa valley california restaurant the restaurant at meadowood was a michelin guide 3-star restaurant at the meadowood napa valley resort in napa valley california which specialized in local sustainable california cuisine the restaurant applied a slightly more modern approach with the use of emulsifiers gelling agents and stabilizers',datetime('now')),('Q7760991','The River Café','The River Café|דה ריבר קפה|مقهى النهر لندن|リバー・カフェ (ロンドン)',51.4839,-0.224167,'GB','restaurant',1987,24.64,'The River Cafe (London)','the river café italian restaurant in london england restaurant italian cuisine the river café is a restaurant in the borough of hammersmith and fulham london specialising in italian cuisine it was owned and run by chefs ruth rogers and rose gray until gray''s death in 2010 since then rogers has been the sole owner and has run the restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q7761046','The Rivoli','The Rivoli',43.6493,-79.3949,'CA','restaurant',1982,13.17,'The Rivoli','the rivoli restaurant club in toronto ontario canada restaurant the rivoli is a bar restaurant and performance space established in 1982 on queen street west in toronto ontario canada the club originally earned a reputation as one of canada''s hippest music clubs and many major canadian comedy and musical performers have played on its stage including the kids in the hall gord downie the frantics and sean cullen',datetime('now')),('Q7761267','The Rock Store','The Rock Store',34.1096,-118.788,'US','restaurant',1963,13.17,'The Rock Store','the rock store restaurant in the us restaurant the rock store is a restaurant in cornell on mulholland highway in the santa monica mountains los angeles california it is popular with motorcyclists and celebrities',datetime('now')),('Q7761482','The Elephant','The Elephant|The Room in the Elephant',50.4587,-3.5246,'GB','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'The Room in the Elephant','the elephant restaurant located in torquay devon england restaurant british cuisine the room in the elephant is a restaurant in torquay devon england as of 2008 the restaurant holds one star in the michelin guide',datetime('now')),('Q7761571','The Rosebud','The Rosebud',42.39439,-71.12087,'US','restaurant',1941,22.85,'Rosebud (diner)','the rosebud historic diner in massachusetts united states diner rosebud is a historic diner building at 381 summer street in somerville massachusetts near davis square the diner was built in 1941 by the worcester lunch car company for the nichols and perivolaris families',datetime('now')),('Q7761864','The Running Horse','The Running Horse',51.2944,-0.332086,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Running Horse','the running horse pub in leatherhead surrey england uk pub the running horse is a grade ii listed pub in the town of leatherhead surrey england dating back to 1403 on the bank of the river mole the running horse is located in one of the oldest buildings in leatherhead',datetime('now')),('Q7761921','The Ryland Inn','The Ryland Inn',40.618,-74.742,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'The Ryland Inn','the ryland inn historic house in hunterdon county new jersey restaurant the ryland inn is a restaurant in readington township new jersey that won the james beard mid-atlantic region top prize it won several awards and was visited by then-president ronald reagan',datetime('now')),('Q7762051','The Saint','The Saint|ザ・セイント',40.7275,-73.9885,'US','bar',NULL,12.0,'The Saint (New York City)','the saint american gay superclub lgbtq nightclub the saint was an american gay nightclub located in the east village neighborhood of manhattan new york city it operated from 1980 to 1988',datetime('now')),('Q7762114','The Salisbury','The Salisbury',51.58226,-0.09942,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'The Salisbury','the salisbury pub in harringay london pub the salisbury is a grade ii listed pub on grand parade in harringay north london england',datetime('now')),('Q7762125','The Salt Lick','The Salt Lick',30.1317,-98.0132,'US','restaurant',1969,13.17,'The Salt Lick','the salt lick texas barbecue restaurant restaurant the salt lick bar-b-que is a u s barbecue restaurant chain based in driftwood texas',datetime('now')),('Q7762629','The Spice of Life','The Spice of Life|スコッツ・フーズ',51.514987,-0.122074,'GB','pub',1759,16.17,'The Spice of Life, London','the spice of life pub in london pub the spice of life is a pub at cambridge circus in london''s charing cross road the pub was founded as the george & thirteen cantons in or before 1759 and later became the scots hoose',datetime('now')),('Q7763460','The Seven Stars Inn','The Seven Stars Inn',50.9858,0.474655,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Seven Stars Inn','the seven stars inn pub in robertsbridge uk pub inn the seven stars inn is a 14th-century public house in robertsbridge east sussex a well-preserved example of a medieval building and a typical sussex village pub it is associated with historical events both real and rumoured',datetime('now')),('Q7764177','The Signal Box Inn','The Signal Box Inn',53.5436,-0.0095,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Signal Box Inn','the signal box inn pub in cleethorpes uk pub the signal box inn is a public house in the seaside resort of cleethorpes united kingdom it was opened in august 2006 and is a contender for the smallest pub in the world',datetime('now')),('Q7764647','The Skirrid Mountain Inn','The Skirrid Mountain Inn',51.880465,-2.980683,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Skirrid Inn','the skirrid mountain inn pub in llanvihangel crucorney monmouthshire wales pub inn the skirrid inn also called the skirrid mountain inn is a public house in the small village of llanvihangel crucorney approximately 4 miles 6 km north of abergavenny monmouthshire wales',datetime('now')),('Q7764843','The Sloop Inn','The Sloop Inn',50.215278,-5.479444,'GB','pub',1312,16.17,'The Sloop Inn','the sloop inn pub in st ives cornwall england uk pub the sloop inn is an inn in st ives cornwall england located on the wharf it is one of the oldest inns in cornwall the public house is dated to circa 1312 although the present building was built in the 17th or 18th century',datetime('now')),('Q7766054','The Spotted Pig','The Spotted Pig|スポッテッド・ピッグ',40.7356,-74.0067,'US','pub',2004,12.0,'The Spotted Pig','the spotted pig gastropub in new york city pub the spotted pig was a gastropub at 314 west 11th street at greenwich street in the west village in manhattan new york city it was owned by ken friedman',datetime('now')),('Q7766158','The Stables','The Stables',52.026745,-0.676147,'GB','pub',1970,13.17,'The Stables','the stables music venue situated in wavendon venue pub the stables also known as the stables theatre is a music venue situated in wavendon a small village in south-east milton keynes the stables hosts over 400 concerts and around 250 education events a year including the national youth music camps which take place over the summer',datetime('now')),('Q7766177','The Stagg Inn','The Stagg Inn',52.2322,-2.9831,'GB','pub|restaurant',NULL,13.17,'The Stagg Inn','the stagg inn restaurant in herefordshire england restaurant pub the stagg inn is a restaurant located in titley herefordshire england as of 2015 the restaurant holds one star in the michelin guide',datetime('now')),('Q7766278','The Star Inn','The Star Inn|Star Inn at Harome',54.230932,-1.010199,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Star Inn','the star inn pub in harome north yorkshire england uk thatched pub the star inn is a gastropub restaurant on high street in harome a village near helmsley in north yorkshire england the pub has been in the village since the 19th century and the building is thought to have been constructed in the 17th century with earlier origins',datetime('now')),('Q7766549','The Stinking Rose','The Stinking Rose',34.066667,-118.376667,'US','restaurant',1991,12.0,'The Stinking Rose','the stinking rose restaurant in california united states restaurant italian cuisine the stinking rose is a californian restaurant known for including garlic in all its dishes including its garlic ice cream the first location opened in san francisco in 1991 followed by a second location in beverly hills in 1996',datetime('now')),('Q77670554','Östermalmskällaren','Östermalmskällaren',59.335861,18.080028,'SE','restaurant',NULL,13.17,NULL,'östermalmskällaren restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q7768962','The Three Chimneys','The Three Chimneys',57.4434,-6.642,'GB','restaurant',1985,12.0,'The Three Chimneys','the three chimneys restaurant in colbost on the isle of skye highland scotland uk restaurant the three chimneys is a restaurant in colbost isle of skye scotland while in operation beforehand the restaurant came to prominence after being taken over around 1985 by eddie and shirley spear',datetime('now')),('Q7768971','The Three Crowns Hotel','The Three Crowns Hotel',50.672604,-3.840132,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Three Crowns Hotel','the three crowns hotel pub in chagford devon england uk pub hotel the three crowns hotel also three crowns chagford is a historical hotel in chagford devon england the hotel noted for its granite facade and 13th century features has 21 rooms',datetime('now'));
INSERT INTO institutions VALUES ('Q7769759','The Towers','The Towers',41.430556,-71.456111,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'The Towers (Narragansett, Rhode Island)','the towers restaurant in rhode island united states of america restaurant the towers is a historic structure located at 35 ocean road in narragansett rhode island it is the only remnant of the narragansett pier casino built in the 1880s',datetime('now')),('Q7770212','The Trident','The Trident',37.8536,-122.479,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'The Trident (restaurant)','the trident restaurant in sausalito california usa restaurant the trident was a restaurant in sausalito california opened in 1966 as a bar-restaurant-music venue by the kingston trio it is noted for its psychedelic murals dating to the 1960s and its ties to the music counterculture of that era',datetime('now')),('Q7770502','The Trout Inn','The Trout Inn',51.78,-1.29944,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'The Trout Inn, Lower Wolvercote','the trout inn grade ii listed pub in the united kingdom pub the trout inn often simply referred to as the trout is a historic pub in lower wolvercote north of oxford close to godstow bridge directly by the river thames',datetime('now')),('Q777211','Borsteler Mühle','Borsteler Mühle|Aurora',53.5397,9.69279,'DE','restaurant',1856,16.17,NULL,'borsteler mühle restaurant windmill',datetime('now')),('Q7773693','The Water Club','The Water Club',40.7404,-73.9724,'US','restaurant',1982,13.17,'The Water Club (restaurant)','the water club restaurant in new york united states restaurant the water club was a restaurant and event venue on two barges moored on the east river at east 30th street in kips bay in manhattan new york city located on the stretch of waterfront between the east 34th street heliport and waterside plaza the venue served classic american cuisine and seafood it overlooked long island city queens and greenpoint brooklyn across the river',datetime('now')),('Q7773713','The Water Rats','The Water Rats',51.529,-0.11965,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Water Rats','the water rats live music venue lodon theatre building pub venue the water rats is a live music venue at 328 grays inn road kings cross london england until 1992 it was known as the pindar of wakefield and was famous for its regular all time comedy music hall entertainment provided by the aba daba company',datetime('now')),('Q7773745','The Waterside Inn','The Waterside Inn|Waterside Inn',51.5092,-0.699,'GB','restaurant',1972,13.17,'The Waterside Inn','the waterside inn restaurant in bray berkshire england restaurant french cuisine the waterside inn in bray berkshire england is a restaurant founded by the brothers michel and albert roux after the success of their london restaurant le gavroche it is currently run by michel''s son alain',datetime('now')),('Q7773960','The WayOut Club','The WayOut Club|The Wayout Club',51.5117,-0.076528,'GB','bar',NULL,12.0,'The WayOut Club','the wayout club lgbtq nightclub the wayout club is a nightclub venue currently in zodiac bar 119 hampstead rd london nw1 3ee formed in 1993 it is one of london''s best known transgender venues and was the first to hold a regular saturday night event',datetime('now')),('Q7774108','The Week International','The Week International|The Week (bar gay)',-23.5225,-46.6889,'BR','bar',2004,19.02,'The Week International','the week international brazilian lgbt nightclub lgbtq nightclub the week international brazilian portuguese ˈdɛ ˈwik i ˌĩteʁˈnɛʃõnaw often just referred to as the week is an after hours lgbtq nightclub located in the city of são paulo brazil it opened in september 2004',datetime('now')),('Q7774242','Wenlock Arms','Wenlock Arms',51.5314,-0.094,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Wenlock Arms','wenlock arms pub in hoxton london pub the wenlock arms is a public house in hoxton in east london which began trading in 1787 the pub is located halfway between old street and angel just off the city road and the city road basin and wenlock basin on the regent''s canal',datetime('now')),('Q7774275','The West House','The West House',51.11522,0.64235,'GB','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'The West House','the west house restaurant in biddenden ashford kent england restaurant the west house is a family restaurant located in biddenden kent england the restaurant was founded in 2002 and is operated by chef graham garrett',datetime('now')),('Q7774508','The White Horse','The White Horse',51.4744,-0.200278,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The White Horse, Fulham','the white horse pub in fulham london pub the white horse is a pub in parsons green fulham london known colloquially by many as the sloaney pony a reference to the sloane rangers who frequent it it is a popular and busy pub which is featured in many good guides',datetime('now')),('Q7775090','The Windmill','The Windmill',40.298,-73.9793,'US','restaurant',1963,12.0,'The Windmill (restaurant)','the windmill restaurant in new jersey united states restaurant the windmill stylized as windmill is a chain of restaurants located mostly near the jersey shore known for its hot dogs and other fast food the original location a windmill-shaped building in long branch new jersey was built and opened in 1963',datetime('now')),('Q7775304','The Witchery','The Witchery',55.9488,-3.1956,'GB','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'The Witchery','the witchery a restaurant on the royal mile near edinburgh castle which also provides bed and breakfast accommodation restaurant the witchery also known as the witchery by the castle is a restaurant on the royal mile edinburgh adjacent to the esplanade of edinburgh castle the restaurant was founded in 1979',datetime('now')),('Q7775324','The Witchwood','The Witchwood',53.4867,-2.09861,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Witchwood','the witchwood pub in ashton-under-lyne uk pub the witchwood is a pub and live music venue in ashton-under-lyne greater manchester england located in ashton''s town centre the witchwood has been a hub for live indie and rock music since the 1960s and features on north west england''s pub music circuit',datetime('now')),('Q7775450','The Wolseley','The Wolseley|沃爾斯利餐廳|וולסלי',51.5074,-0.141,'GB','restaurant',2003,19.85,'The Wolseley','the wolseley restaurant located at 160 piccadilly london restaurant the wolseley is a restaurant located at 160 piccadilly in westminster england next to the ritz london designed by the architect william curtis green the grade ii listed building was erected by wolseley motors in 1921 as their regional offices with a ground floor showroom',datetime('now')),('Q7775871','The World''s End','The World''s End',51.5392,-0.142222,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The World''s End, Camden','the world''s end pub and music venue in camden town london england pub music venue the world''s end is a pub and music venue at 174 camden high street in camden town london england just south of camden town tube station with an additional branch at finsbury park 23 stroud green rd london it is a long established business formerly known as mother red cap or mother damnable''s',datetime('now')),('Q7777238','Theakston Brewery','Theakston Brewery',54.2223,-1.65975,'GB','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Theakston Brewery','theakston brewery brewery in masham england brewery t&r theakston is a british brewery in masham north yorkshire and the sixteenth largest brewer in the united kingdom by market share it is the second largest under family ownership after shepherd neame and is known for its old peculier beer',datetime('now')),('Q7786476','Thisted Bryghus','Thisted Bryghus|Thisted-Brauerei',56.9528,8.6811,'DK','brewery',1902,27.64,'Thisted Bryghus','thisted bryghus danish brewery brewery thisted brewery danish thisted bryghus is a regional brewery in thisted in the north of denmark founded in 1902 the brewery supplies the local market with pilsner beer and has gained recognition internationally for beers like porse guld spiced with bog myrtle and limfjords porter a baltic porter',datetime('now')),('Q778904','Stein Castle','Stein Castle|Schloss Stein an der Traun',47