ad','throstles nest hotel pub on scotland road in liverpool merseyside england pub hotel the throstles nest hotel is a pub with guesthouse on scotland road in vauxhall liverpool adjacent to st anthony''s church opened in 1804 the throstles nest is the last remaining pub of more than 200 on scotland road formerly the main artery of a crowded tenement area with a heavily irish population',datetime('now')),('Q77984975','The Air Balloon','The Air Balloon',51.843333,-2.096667,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Air Balloon, Birdlip','the air balloon pub in birdlip gloucestershire england uk pub the air balloon is a road junction and former pub in birdlip gloucestershire england the junction is on the a417 at a significant congestion point',datetime('now')),('Q7802817','Tilley''s','Tilley''s',-35.2519,149.124,'AU','cafe',1984,19.85,'Tilley''s','tilley''s café in lyneham in canberra australia café tilley''s devine café gallery is a well-known café in the suburb of lyneham in canberra australia it was named after matilda ''tilly'' devine an english australian gangster and madame from sydney',datetime('now')),('Q78062179','Restaurant 55:an','Restaurant 55:an',59.333636,18.061486,'SE','restaurant',1863,16.17,NULL,'restaurant 55 an restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q7808383','Tinner''s Arms','Tinner''s Arms',50.191646,-5.567852,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Tinner''s Arms','tinner''s arms pub in zennor cornwall england uk pub the tinner''s arms is a grade ii-listed traditional cornish pub in zennor cornwall the name is derived from the tinners with records of tin extraction in the area dating back to tudor times',datetime('now')),('Q7810429','Tivoli Brewery Company','Tivoli Brewery Company',39.745278,-105.004722,'US','brewery',NULL,13.17,'Tivoli Brewery Company (building)','tivoli brewery company brewery in colorado united states of america brewery the tivoli brewery now the tivoli student union is a historic building originally home to the tivoli brewing company it was designed by prominent denver architect frederick c eberley',datetime('now')),('Q7814320','Toll House Inn','Toll House Inn|トール・ハウス・イン',42.0709,-70.9482,'US','restaurant',1930,27.64,'Toll House Inn','toll house inn hotel in whitman massachusetts restaurant the toll house inn was an inn located in whitman massachusetts established in 1930 by kenneth and ruth graves wakefield the toll house chocolate chip cookies are named after the inn',datetime('now')),('Q7814752','Tom Aikens','Tom Aikens',51.4916,-0.167727,'GB','pub|restaurant',2003,13.17,'Tom Aikens Restaurant','tom aikens restaurant in london england restaurant pub french cuisine tom aikens restaurant officially titled tom aikens was a london michelin-starred fine dining restaurant operated by the eponymous chef from april 2003 opening to january 2014 closure the restaurant received mostly positive critical reception',datetime('now')),('Q7814945','Tom Bergin''s','Tom Bergin''s',34.06003,-118.36263,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Tom Bergin''s','tom bergin''s restaurant in los angeles california united states restaurant tom bergin''s tavern is one of the oldest restaurant bars in continuous operation in los angeles california originally opened at 6110 wilshire boulevard in 1936 by lawyer tom bergin as the old horseshoe tavern it has been at its current location at 840 south fairfax avenue just south of wilshire since 1949',datetime('now')),('Q7816468','Tom King''s Coffee House','Tom King''s Coffee House',51.5119,-0.122222,'GB','cafe',NULL,13.17,'Tom King''s Coffee House','tom king''s coffee house 18th century coffee house in covent garden london coffeehouse tom king''s coffee house later known as moll king''s coffee house was a notorious establishment in covent garden london in the mid-18th century open from the time the taverns shut until dawn it was ostensibly a coffee house but in reality served as a meeting place for prostitutes and their customers',datetime('now')),('Q78189364','S:ta Clara Bierhaus','S:ta Clara Bierhaus',59.323472,18.069306,'SE','restaurant',NULL,13.17,NULL,'s ta clara bierhaus restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q78190159','Sushi Sho','Sushi Sho|すし匠',59.341222,18.049806,'SE','restaurant',2014,12.0,NULL,'sushi sho restaurant in sweden sushi-ya japanese cuisine',datetime('now')),('Q7820969','Tonga Room','Tonga Room',37.7921,-122.41,'US','bar|restaurant',1945,16.17,'Tonga Room','tonga room 1940s tiki bar inside fairmont san francisco hotel restaurant tiki bar the tonga room & hurricane bar is a restaurant and tiki bar in the fairmont san francisco hotel in nob hill san francisco california named after the south pacific nation of tonga this dining and entertainment venue opened in 1945',datetime('now')),('Q7824131','Toomey''s Mills','Toomey''s Mills',43.853611,-104.206389,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Toomey''s Mills','toomey''s mills restaurant in wyoming united states of america restaurant toomey''s mills in newcastle wyoming began in 1905 as the newcastle milling company and electric light plant later the newcastle rolling mills toomey''s mills processed locally produced wheat until 1965',datetime('now')),('Q7824677','Top of the Hill Restaurant & Brewery','Top of the Hill Restaurant & Brewery',35.913056,-79.055417,'US','beer_hall|restaurant',1994,12.0,'Top of the Hill Restaurant & Brewery','top of the hill restaurant & brewery restaurant in chapel hill nc distillery restaurant event venue brewpub top of the hill topo is a brewpub restaurant event space and distillery located in downtown chapel hill north carolina the restaurant and brewery opened in 1994 at the intersection of franklin and columbia streets adjacent to the university of north carolina at chapel hill',datetime('now')),('Q7824679','Top of the Mark','Top of the Mark',37.7916,-122.41,'US','restaurant',1939,16.17,'Top of the Mark','top of the mark restaurant in california united states restaurant the top of the mark is a penthouse level bar located on the nineteenth floor of the mark hopkins hotel on nob hill at california and mason streets in san francisco california located at the highest point of downtown san francisco on fog-free days the top of the mark has views of the financial district chinatown north beach the san francisco bay and of grace cathedral and huntington park',datetime('now')),('Q7824690','Top of the Stairs','Top of the Stairs',37.2298,-80.4167,'US','restaurant',1978,12.0,'Top of the Stairs','top of the stairs bar and restaurant in blacksburg virginia restaurant top of the stairs popularly known as tots and for a period of time in the mid-1980s and early 1990s was called the balcony is a bar and restaurant in blacksburg virginia near the virginia tech campus established in 1978 and located at 217 west college ave tots is popular among virginia tech students and alumni due to its history proximity to campus signature mixed drink known as the rail and tuesday night karaoke',datetime('now')),('Q7828399','Totonno''s','Totonno''s',40.5789,-73.9837,'US','restaurant',1924,22.02,'Totonno''s','totonno''s pizzeria in brooklyn new york restaurant totonno''s is an american pizzeria located at 1524 neptune avenue between west 15th street and west 16th street in coney island in brooklyn new york it was established in 1924 by antonio totonno pero',datetime('now')),('Q7828685','Beastro & Barley','Beastro & Barley',43.5325,-90.009167,'US','pub|restaurant',1886,16.17,'125 East Main (Reedsburg, Wisconsin)','beastro & barley small town bar & grill restaurant pub hotel building a historic hotel building in the second empire style is at 125 east main street in reedsburg wisconsin united states the building was originally built as roper''s city hotel',datetime('now')),('Q7829940','Town Crier','Town Crier',53.19637,-2.88084,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Town Crier, Chester','town crier grade ii listed pub in chester uk pub hotel the town crier is a public house located on the corner of city road and station road chester cheshire england it stands opposite chester general station',datetime('now')),('Q7829944','Town Diner','Town Diner',42.370833,-71.158611,'US','restaurant',1947,22.02,'Town Diner','town diner historic diner in watertown massachusetts united states diner the deluxe town diner is a historic diner in watertown massachusetts',datetime('now')),('Q78307682','Will Rogers Archway','Will Rogers Archway|McDonald''s (Will Rogers Turnpike)',36.62331,-95.14803,'US','restaurant',NULL,24.64,'Will Rogers Archway','will rogers archway service station in vinita oklahoma united states fast food restaurant truck stop the will rogers archway originally named the glass house restaurant and today nicknamed as the glass house is a 29 135-square-foot 2 706 7 m2 service station that spans the will rogers turnpike section of interstate 44 i-44 near vinita oklahoma originally operating solely as a mcdonald''s restaurant it was notable as the first bridge restaurant opened over a u s highway and as an example of a u s roadside restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q78355345','Shine Distillery and Grill','Shine Distillery and Grill',45.5544,-122.6663,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Shine Distillery and Grill','shine distillery and grill restaurant and distillery in portland oregon restaurant shine distillery and grill is a distillery which previously operated a bar and restaurant in portland oregon''s boise neighborhood in the united states',datetime('now')),('Q78366989','Cafè Espanyol','Cafè Espanyol',41.375111,2.16945,'ES','bar',NULL,19.85,NULL,'cafè espanyol bar',datetime('now')),('Q7840055','Triangle Brewing Company','Triangle Brewing Company',35.9966,-78.8893,'US','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Triangle Brewing Company','triangle brewing company microbrewery brewery triangle brewing co tbc was a microbrewery owned and operated entirely by business partners and high-school friends rick the brewer tufts and andy the bloke miller who in 2005 resettled in durham north carolina from connecticut',datetime('now')),('Q7840059','Triangle Diner','Triangle Diner',39.1786,-78.17,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Triangle Diner','triangle diner historic commercial building in virginia united states diner the triangle diner is an american diner in winchester virginia it was built in 1948 by the jerry o''mahony diner company of elizabeth new jersey',datetime('now')),('Q7840381','Tribeca Grill','Tribeca Grill',40.7195,-74.0101,'US','restaurant',1990,12.0,'Tribeca Grill','tribeca grill restaurant in new york city restaurant tribeca grill was a new american restaurant at 375 greenwich street at franklin street in tribeca manhattan new york city co-owned by robert de niro and drew nieporent celebrity investors include bill murray sean penn christopher walken ed harris and lou diamond phillips among others',datetime('now')),('Q7842351','Tring Brewery Co.','Tring Brewery Co.|Tring Brewery',51.79369,-0.65158,'GB','brewery',1992,12.0,'Tring Brewery','tring brewery co brewery based in tring hertfordshire uk brewery tring brewery co is a brewery in tring hertfordshire united kingdom',datetime('now')),('Q7844808','Trocadero','Trocadero',52.479581,-1.899484,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Trocadero, Birmingham','trocadero pub in birmingham west midlands united kingdom pub the trocadero 17 temple street birmingham england currently a pub is a dazzling demonstration of the use of coloured glazed tile and terracotta in the post-victorian era of architecture formerly the fire engine house for the norwich union insurance company 1846 edge & avery it was altered in 1883 to make the bodega wine bar',datetime('now')),('Q78456938','First Theater','First Theater',36.603082,-121.895504,'US','pub',NULL,13.17,'First Theater','first theater building in monterey state historic park built as a lodging house and tavern used as a theatre in 1850 theatre building pub the first theater also known as the first theater in california is a historic adobe and wood building in monterey california united states it was built in 1846 1847 as a lodging house and tavern for sailors by english seaman and pioneer jack swan',datetime('now')),('Q7849178','Tröegs Brewing Company','Tröegs Brewing Company',40.2972,-76.64302,'US','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Tröegs','tröegs brewing company pennsylvania brewery brewery tröegs is an american brewery located on hersheypark drive in hershey pennsylvania john and chris trogner founded the company in 1996',datetime('now')),('Q785041','Café Gondrée','Café Gondrée|café Gondrée|カフェ・ゴンドレ|مقهى جوندري|קפה גונדרה|Gondrée kávéház',49.242417,-0.274972,'FR','cafe',NULL,36.34,'Café Gondrée','café gondrée café café the café gondrée is a small coffeehouse in the french community of bénouville the cafe is located on the west bank of the caen canal at the northwest end of the bénouville bridge now commonly referred to as the pegasus bridge',datetime('now')),('Q78506000','Safari Brewery','Safari Brewery|Safari pivovar',50.434843,15.79847,'CZ','brewery|restaurant',2018,13.17,NULL,'safari brewery brewery in dvůr králové nad labem czech republic restaurant brewery',datetime('now'));
