and shopping center restaurant highway bridge bridge restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q7862459','Türkbalön','Türkbalön',40.991111,29.026111,'TR','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Türkbalön','türkbalön restaurant kadıköy turkish pronunciation kaˈdɯkøj is a municipality and district in istanbul province turkey its area is 25 km2 and its population is 467 919 2023',datetime('now')),('Q78624745','The Kawabun Nagoya','The Kawabun Nagoya|ザ・カワブン・ナゴヤ',35.175653,136.900469,'JP','restaurant',NULL,13.17,NULL,'the kawabun nagoya restaurant',datetime('now')),('Q7862894','U-Drop Inn','U-Drop Inn',35.226806,-100.248667,'US','restaurant',1936,22.85,'U-Drop Inn','u-drop inn building in shamrock wheeler county texas restaurant filling station the u-drop inn also known as tower station and u-drop inn and tower café was built in 1936 in shamrock texas along the historic route 66 highway in wheeler county inspired by the image of a nail stuck in soil the building was designed by j c berry',datetime('now')),('Q7876695','Uchi','Uchi',30.257501,-97.759588,'US','restaurant',2003,12.0,'Uchi (restaurant)','uchi restaurant in texas united states restaurant uchi is a sushi restaurant in austin texas which opened in 2003 the japanese word uchi translates to house in english',datetime('now')),('Q7881201','Umatilla Masonic Lodge Hall','Umatilla Masonic Lodge Hall',45.741944,-119.195278,'US','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'Umatilla Masonic Lodge Hall','umatilla masonic lodge hall restaurant masonic temple the umatilla masonic lodge hall is a masonic building in echo oregon it is one of the oldest edifices in umatilla county and is listed on the national register of historic places',datetime('now')),('Q7881256','Umberto''s Clam House','Umberto''s Clam House|安伯特的蛤蜊屋|Umbertos Clam House',40.7184,-73.9977,'US','restaurant',1970,24.0,'Umbertos Clam House','umberto''s clam house restaurant in new york city new york restaurant italian cuisine umbertos clam house is an italian seafood restaurant located at 132 mulberry street in little italy in manhattan new york city umbertos became known for its tasty dishes of calamari scungilli and mussels but initially became prominent weeks after opening for being the site of the murder of gangster joe gallo',datetime('now')),('Q7885435','Union Brewery','Union Brewery',41.663333,-91.531667,'US','brewery',NULL,13.17,'Union Brewery (Iowa)','union brewery historic brewery building in iowa city iowa united states brewery the union brewery is a historic brewery building in iowa city iowa the brewery was founded in 1856 by german immigrants anton geiger and simeon hotz',datetime('now')),('Q7886046','Union Square Cafe','Union Square Cafe|יוניון סקוור קפה|聯合廣場咖啡館',40.73679,-73.99106,'US','restaurant',1985,19.02,'Union Square Cafe','union square cafe restaurant in new york united states restaurant new american cuisine union square cafe is an american restaurant featuring new american cuisine with italian influences located at 101 e 19th st between park avenue south and irving place in the union square neighborhood of the manhattan borough of new york city new york it is owned by the union square hospitality group',datetime('now')),('Q7897448','Unser Bier','Unser Bier',47.540606,7.592622,'CH','brewery',1997,12.0,'Unser Bier','unser bier brewery in basel switzerland brewery unser bier is a small local brewery in basel switzerland unser bier is most widely known for its amber beer a simple lager',datetime('now')),('Q79043705','Skedvi Bröd','Skedvi Bröd',60.402806,15.812806,'SE','bakery',2014,12.0,NULL,'skedvi bröd bakery',datetime('now')),('Q7907111','VJ''s Drive Inn','VJ''s Drive Inn',49.8896,-97.1355,'CA','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'VJ''s Drive Inn','vj''s drive inn restaurant in winnipeg canada restaurant vj''s drive inn is a burger joint in winnipeg manitoba canada located at 170 main street',datetime('now')),('Q7910733','Valentin Blatz Brewing Company','Valentin Blatz Brewing Company',43.045019,-87.909008,'US','brewery',1846,22.85,'Valentin Blatz Brewing Company','valentin blatz brewing company trademark in milwaukee united states of america brewery trademark the valentin blatz brewing company was an american brewery based in milwaukee wisconsin it produced blatz beer from 1851 until 1959 when the label was sold to the pabst brewing company',datetime('now')),('Q7913794','Van Zeller','Van Zeller',53.9931,-1.54389,'GB','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Van Zeller','van zeller restaurant in north yorkshire england restaurant van zeller was a restaurant located in the north yorkshire spa town of harrogate it was part-owned by head chef tom van zeller who is in partnership with david moore of london''s two michelin starred pied à terre and michelin starred l autre pied and other private investors',datetime('now')),('Q7913805','Van de Kamp Bakery Building','Van de Kamp Bakery Building',34.1139,-118.247,'US','bakery',1931,16.17,'Van de Kamp Bakery Building','van de kamp bakery building dutch renaissance in fletcher drive los angeles united states bakery the van de kamp bakery building was built in 1930 in the glassell park neighborhood of los angeles it served as the headquarters of the chain of bakeries and coffee shops known for their distinctive windmill architecture',datetime('now')),('Q7918202','Veeraswamy','Veeraswamy|ヴィーラスワミー',51.51,-0.138056,'GB','restaurant',1926,27.64,'Veeraswamy','veeraswamy indian restaurant in london restaurant indian cuisine veeraswamy is an indian restaurant in london at 99 101 regent street it was opened in 1926 by edward palmer a retired anglo-indian officer in the british indian army',datetime('now')),('Q7918382','Veggie Galaxy','Veggie Galaxy',42.363424,-71.101296,'US','restaurant',2011,12.0,'Veggie Galaxy','veggie galaxy restaurant in massachusetts united states restaurant diner veggie galaxy is a diner-style vegetarian restaurant located in the central square section of cambridge massachusetts the establishment was founded by adam penn in 2011 after his first vegetarian restaurant veggie planet in harvard square had operated for more than ten years',datetime('now')),('Q7919410','Velvet Lounge','Velvet Lounge',41.883333,-87.633333,'US','restaurant',NULL,24.0,'Velvet Lounge','velvet lounge nightclub in chicago illinois u s jazz club the velvet lounge was a nightclub in the south loop of chicago it started as a jazz club and was called the dusty epicenter of the midwest''s free form jazz scene it was located at 2128 1 2 s indiana avenue before moving to 67 e cermak when the original building was scheduled for demolition',datetime('now')),('Q7919630','Vendôme','Vendôme',50.9662,7.1606,'DE','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Vendôme (restaurant)','vendôme restaurant in bergisch gladbach de restaurant vendôme is a michelin 2-star restaurant in bergisch gladbach near cologne germany the restaurant is led by chef de cuisine joachim wissler and is part of the grandhotel schloss bensberg',datetime('now')),('Q7919737','Venetian Theatre','Venetian Theatre',45.5228,-122.987,'US','restaurant',1925,16.17,'Venetian Theatre','venetian theatre movie theater performing arts venue and restaurant in hillsboro oregon united states restaurant theatre building movie theater venetian hillsboro last known as the venetian theatre & bistro is a former movie theater and performing arts venue in downtown hillsboro oregon united states which since 2022 has been in use by a venue named venetian hillsboro formerly the town theater the building re-opened in 2008 after more than a decade of inactivity and revitalization plans',datetime('now')),('Q7920014','Veniero''s','Veniero''s|베니에로스',40.7294,-73.9845,'US','restaurant',1894,22.02,'Veniero''s','veniero''s italian bakery restaurant italian cuisine veniero''s pasticceria & caffè is an italian bakery that was established in 1894 and is located at 342 east 11th street between first avenue and second avenue in the east village neighborhood of manhattan new york city founded by antonio veniero of sorrento the bakery was opened as a pool emporium and caffè where veniero served his baked products to customers',datetime('now')),('Q7922622','Versailles restaurant','Versailles restaurant|凡爾賽餐廳|Versailles (restaurante)',25.7651,-80.2526,'US','restaurant',1971,19.85,'Versailles (restaurant)','versailles restaurant restaurant in little havana miami florida restaurant versailles is a cafeteria restaurant and bakery located on calle ocho 8th st in little havana miami the large restaurant seats 370 people and has ornate etched glass and statuettes and features a bakery a takeout area a counter window and the ability to host banquets and parties',datetime('now')),('Q7923183','Veselka','Veselka',40.729,-73.9871,'US','restaurant',1954,24.64,'Veselka','veselka ukrainian restaurant in new york city restaurant veselka is a ukrainian restaurant at 144 second avenue in the east village neighborhood of manhattan in new york city it was established in 1954 by wolodymyr darmochwal ukrainian володимир дармохвал and his wife olha darmochwal ukrainian ольга дармохвал post world war ii ukrainian refugees',datetime('now')),('Q7923521','Vesuvio Cafe','Vesuvio Cafe|Vesuvio Cafe (San Francisco)',37.797535,-122.406407,'US','restaurant',1948,39.34,'Vesuvio Cafe','vesuvio cafe bar in san francisco restaurant vesuvio cafe is a historic bar in san francisco california united states located at 255 columbus avenue across an alley from city lights bookstore the building was designed and built in 1913 by italian architect italo zanolini and remodeled in 1918',datetime('now')),('Q7924401','Via Veneto','Via Veneto',41.3925,2.1392,'ES','restaurant',1967,19.02,'Via Veneto (restaurant)','via veneto restaurant in spain restaurant via veneto is a michelin starred restaurant in barcelona catalonia spain',datetime('now')),('Q7926561','Victoria Arms, Marston','Victoria Arms, Marston',51.777,-1.2474,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'Victoria Arms, Marston','victoria arms marston pub in oxford uk pub the victoria arms known locally as the vicky arms and formerly as the ferry inn is a pub on the eastern bank of the river cherwell at the end of mill lane close to old marston northeast of oxford england there was once a ford across the cherwell here in use since the 12th century',datetime('now')),('Q7930483','Villa Rozenrust','Villa Rozenrust|Raimondi''s Villa Rozenrust',52.092,4.40897,NULL,'restaurant',1968,12.0,'Villa Rozenrust','villa rozenrust restaurant in the netherlands restaurant villa rozenrust is a restaurant in leidschendam netherlands it is a fine dining restaurant that was awarded one michelin star in 1976 and retained that rating until 1989',datetime('now')),('Q7930489','Villa San Michele Hotel','Villa San Michele Hotel',43.802778,11.298333,'IT','restaurant',1401,31.39,'Belmond Villa San Michele','villa san michele hotel building in tuscany italy restaurant villa hotel the belmond villa san michele is a hotel situated on the hill of fiesole overlooking florence italy it is named after the church of st michael the archangel',datetime('now')),('Q79310993','United Manawatu Lodge','United Manawatu Lodge',-40.35269,175.61685,'NZ','restaurant',1931,16.17,'United Manawatu Lodge','united manawatu lodge building on 186 broadway avenue palmerston north new zealand restaurant masonic temple the united manawatu lodge also known as aqaba restaurant is a heritage-listed art deco building at 186 broadway avenue in palmerston north new zealand the building is a former masonic temple dedicated by the united manawatu lodge on 24 july 1931',datetime('now')),('Q7932885','Thieves Kitchen','Thieves Kitchen',50.811602,-0.369149,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Thieves Kitchen','thieves kitchen pub in worthing west sussex england uk pub the thieves'' kitchen formerly vintner''s parrot and before that thieves kitchen is a pub in the centre of the town and borough of worthing west sussex established as a public house in the late 20th century it occupies two early 19th-century listed buildings in the oldest part of the town a greek revival-style former wine merchants premises and a neoclassical chapel built for wesleyan methodists in 1839',datetime('now')),('Q7934164','Virginia Cafe','Virginia Cafe',45.51892,-122.68246,'US','restaurant',1914,16.17,'Virginia Cafe','virginia cafe restaurant and bar in portland oregon u s restaurant virginia cafe sometimes known colloquially as vc is a restaurant and bar in portland oregon',datetime('now')),('Q7941919','Vortex Jazz Club','Vortex Jazz Club|ヴォルテックス・ジャズクラブ',51.549,-0.076,'GB','restaurant',2006,19.85,'Vortex Jazz Club','vortex jazz club jazz club in london borough of hackney uk jazz club the vortex jazz club is a music venue in london it was founded by david mossman in 1988',datetime('now')),('Q795132','b-flat','b-flat|B-flat',52.523547,13.406987,'DE','restaurant',1995,19.02,'B-flat (jazz club)','b-flat jazz club in berlin jazz club b-flat full name b-flat acoustic music & jazzclub is a jazz club in berlin germany',datetime('now')),('Q7961283','Walasi-Yi Interpretive Center','Walasi-Yi Interpretive Center',34.7353,-83.9177,'US','pub',NULL,19.85,'Walasi-Yi Interpretive Center','walasi-yi interpretive center inn in union county united states of america inn the walasi-yi interpretive center is a small stone building located along us 19 129 at neels gap georgia united states on the eastern side of blood mountain it is notable as the only place where the 2 175-mile-long appalachian trail passes through a man-made structure',datetime('now')),('Q7962277','Walker House','Walker House',42.859,-90.176,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Walker House (Mineral Point, Wisconsin)','walker house inn and restaurant in mineral point wisconsin united states restaurant the walker house is an inn and restaurant in mineral point in iowa county wisconsin it is one of the oldest inns in the state',datetime('now'));
INSERT INTO institutions VALUES ('Q7962595','Wall Drug','Wall Drug|沃尔药',43.993231,-102.241795,'US','restaurant',1931,22.85,'Wall Drug','wall drug tourist attraction and shopping mall in wall south dakota restaurant art gallery shopping center pharmacy wall drug store often called simply wall drug is a roadside attraction and tourist stop located in the town of wall south dakota united states adjacent to badlands national park wall drug consists of a collection of cowboy-themed stores including a drug store gift shop several restaurants and various other stores as well as an art gallery and an 80-foot 24 m brontosaurus sculpture',datetime('now')),('Q7963274','Wally''s Cafe','Wally''s Cafe|ウォーリーズ・カフェ',42.3407,-71.0822,'US','restaurant',1947,22.85,'Wally''s Cafe','wally''s cafe jazz club in boston jazz club wally s cafe located on 427 massachusetts avenue in boston massachusetts u s originally opened across the street on january 1 1947 by joseph l walcott formerly wally s paradise the institution is recognized as one of boston s oldest and longest-operating jazz clubs',datetime('now')),('Q7964102','Walter''s Hot Dog Stand','Walter''s Hot Dog Stand',40.9431,-73.7469,'US','restaurant',1919,16.17,'Walter''s Hot Dog Stand','walter''s hot dog stand historic business restaurant walter''s hot dog stand is a national register of historic places designated landmark located in mamaroneck in westchester county new york',datetime('now')),('Q7966752','Walton Hall','Walton Hall|Walton Hall, West Yorkshire|Walton Hall (West Yorkshire)',53.6416,-1.45125,'GB','pub',NULL,24.64,'Walton Hall, West Yorkshire','walton hall grade ii listed house in walton wakefield west yorkshire england uk pub house hotel hotel building walton hall is a country house in walton near wakefield in west yorkshire england it was built on the site of a former moated medieval hall in the palladian style in 1767 on an island in a 26-acre 11 ha lake',datetime('now')),('Q7968287','Wapping Hydraulic Power Station','Wapping Hydraulic Power Station',51.5067,-0.0525,'GB','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Wapping Hydraulic Power Station','wapping hydraulic power station hydraulic power station in the london borough of tower hamlets england uk restaurant hydraulic power station the wapping hydraulic power station built 1890 was originally run by the london hydraulic power company in wapping london england originally it operated using steam and was later converted to use electricity',datetime('now')),('Q7970276','Warren House Inn','Warren House Inn',50.613056,-3.875,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Warren House Inn','warren house inn pub in postbridge devon uk pub the warren house inn is a remote and isolated public house in the heart of dartmoor devon england it is the highest pub in southern england at 1 425 feet 434 m above sea level and is the second highest pub in all england',datetime('now')),('Q7970924','Warsaw ballroom','Warsaw ballroom',25.7869,-80.1305,'US','bar',NULL,12.0,'Warsaw Ballroom','warsaw ballroom gay night club lgbtq nightclub the warsaw ballroom or more commonly referred to simply as warsaw was a gay night club located in south beach florida at collins avenue and espanola way it had previously borne that name when it was a dance club for seniors',datetime('now')),('Q7972209','Washington Square Bar and Grill','Washington Square Bar and Grill',37.8004,-122.411,'US','restaurant',1973,12.0,'Washington Square Bar and Grill','washington square bar and grill san francisco restaurant restaurant the washington square bar & grill was a landmark restaurant adjoining washington square in san francisco''s north beach neighborhood powell at union streets known widely as the washbag so named by columnist herb caen as a play on words it was a favorite gathering place for writers politicians musicians and social elite',datetime('now')),('Q7972618','Washoe House','Washoe House',38.3143,-122.736,'US','restaurant',1859,16.17,'Washoe House','washoe house historic roadhouse in california roadhouse washoe house is a historic roadhouse in sonoma county california in the united states it is located west of cotati california at the juncture of stony point road and roblar road',datetime('now')),('Q7975867','Waybury Inn','Waybury Inn',43.971769,-73.092042,'US','pub',NULL,12.0,'Waybury Inn','waybury inn inn in middlebury united states of america inn the waybury inn is an inn at 457 east main street in middlebury vermont united states the inn was built in 1810 and is one of the oldest operating traveler''s accommodations in the state',datetime('now')),('Q7978771','Webers','Webers',44.694,-79.3988,'CA','restaurant',1963,13.17,'Webers','webers canadian hamburger restaurant restaurant webers also known as webers hamburgers is a hamburger restaurant on ontario highway 11 located 15 kilometres north of orillia ontario that opened in july 1963 webers grills their burgers over charcoal with a grill man said to be able to flip up to 800 patties an hour',datetime('now')),('Q7979817','Weidmann''s Restaurant','Weidmann''s Restaurant',32.363,-88.699,'US','restaurant',1870,16.17,'Weidmann''s Restaurant','weidmann''s restaurant restaurant weidmann''s restaurant is a historic restaurant in meridian mississippi united states established in 1870 it was originally listed as a contributing property to the meridian urban center historic district listed on the national register of historic places in 1979',datetime('now')),('Q7981959','Welsh Oak','Welsh Oak',51.6022,-3.07412,'GB','pub',NULL,12.0,'Welsh Oak','welsh oak pub in pontymister monmouthshire wales united kingdom pub the welsh oak is a pub located in pontymister caerphilly county borough wales in recent years due to a decline in trade the pub has ceased trading',datetime('now')),('Q798198','Bachlalm','Bachlalm',47.4553,13.5761,'AT','pub',NULL,12.0,NULL,'bachlalm mountain pasture inn',datetime('now')),('Q798406','Backes','Backes',50.668,7.33743,'DE','restaurant',NULL,12.0,NULL,'backes bakehouse',datetime('now')),('Q798408','Backhaus','Backhaus|Backes (Kahl a. M.)',50.0679,9.00833,'DE','restaurant',NULL,12.0,NULL,'backhaus cultural heritage monument d-6-71-134-9 0 in kahl am main bavaria bakehouse',datetime('now')),('Q798433','bakehouse (Irresheim)','bakehouse (Irresheim)|Backhaus (Irresheim)',50.7907,6.61931,'DE','restaurant',NULL,12.0,NULL,'bakehouse irresheim bakehouse',datetime('now')),('Q798440','bakehouse (Hermannstein)','bakehouse (Hermannstein)|Backhaus des Oberdorfes (Hermannstein)',50.5304,8.49203,'DE','restaurant',NULL,13.17,NULL,'bakehouse hermannstein bakehouse',datetime('now')),('Q798441','bakehouse (Hermannstein)','bakehouse (Hermannstein)|Backhaus des Unterdorfes',50.5792,8.48938,'DE','restaurant',NULL,13.17,NULL,'bakehouse hermannstein bakehouse',datetime('now')),('Q7989343','Weston''s Cider','Weston''s Cider|ווסטונס סיידר',51.9951,-2.5133,'GB','brewery',NULL,12.0,'Weston''s Cider','weston''s cider cider and perry producer based in herefordshire england brewery cider mill h weston & sons limited weston''s cider is a cider and perry producer based in much marcle herefordshire england the family-owned company founded by henry weston has been making cider in the same location since 1880 and the managing director helen thomas is a fourth generation member of the weston family',datetime('now')),('Q799015','Badhotel Niederlößnitz','Badhotel Niederlößnitz',51.1144,13.6357,'DE','pub',NULL,13.17,NULL,'badhotel niederlößnitz gasthaus',datetime('now')),('Q799152','Badischer Hof','Badischer Hof',49.6213,9.65877,'DE','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'Badischer Hof (Tauberbischofsheim)','badischer hof hotel and restaurant in tauberbischofsheim germany restaurant hotel the badischer hof in english court of baden is the oldest hotel in tauberbischofsheim in 1733 it was built as the former adelshof by the knight anton phillip von fleischmann',datetime('now')),('Q7994094','Whit''s Diner','Whit''s Diner|Whit’s Diner',42.275348,-71.43309,'US','restaurant',1942,22.02,'Lloyd''s Diner','whit''s diner diner lloyd''s diner is a historic diner at 184a fountain street in framingham massachusetts formerly whit''s diner in orange massachusetts it was moved its present location in 1990',datetime('now')),('Q7994467','White Bear Theatre','White Bear Theatre|ホワイト・ベア・シアター',51.486802,-0.107923,'GB','pub',NULL,19.85,'White Bear Theatre','white bear theatre pub theatre in kennington london england pub theatre building the white bear theatre is a fringe theatre founded in 1988 at the white bear pub in kennington london and run by artistic director and founder michael kingsbury it is one of london''s leading pub theatres as well as one of the longest established dedicated since inception to both new writing and to its lost classics project which focuses on productions of obscure historical works',datetime('now')),('Q7994683','White Fence Farm','White Fence Farm',41.6739,-88.0576,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'White Fence Farm','white fence farm restaurant chain with locations in the chicago metropolitan area and lakewood colorado restaurant white fence farm is the name of a restaurant chain with locations in the chicago metropolitan area the original location is in romeoville illinois',datetime('now')),('Q7994832','White Horse Tavern','White Horse Tavern',41.491111,-71.313055,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'White Horse Tavern (Newport, Rhode Island)','white horse tavern tavern in newport rhode island restaurant the white horse tavern is a tavern in newport rhode island the building was constructed before 1673 and is believed to be the oldest tavern building in the united states',datetime('now')),('Q7995037','White Manna','White Manna',40.747222,-74.061667,'US','restaurant',1946,16.17,'White Manna','white manna american fast food restaurant restaurant white manna and white mana are the names of two fast food diners in the u s state of new jersey named after manna the biblical food the restaurants were ranked on america''s best burgers list along with white rose hamburgers another new jersey burger joint',datetime('now')),('Q7997481','Whoa Nellie Deli','Whoa Nellie Deli',37.9473,-119.113,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Whoa Nellie Deli','whoa nellie deli restaurant in california restaurant the whoa nellie deli is a casual gourmet restaurant located in lee vining california east of yosemite national park and just west of mono lake the juxtaposition of its cuisine with its location in a gas station the tioga gas mart has been widely considered to be unusual and surprising',datetime('now')),('Q7998090','Wich Stand','Wich Stand|ウィッチ・スタンド',33.9886,-118.354,'US','restaurant',1957,12.0,'Wich Stand','wich stand building in los angeles restaurant wich stand was a ''50s-style coffee shop restaurant and diner in los angeles california featuring a tilting blue roof and 35-foot spire 11 m designed by architect eldon davis the wich stand had two locations in the los angeles area',datetime('now')),('Q8001601','Wilensky''s','Wilensky''s|Wilensky',45.5233,-73.5949,'CA','restaurant',1932,22.85,'Wilensky''s','wilensky''s lunch-counter restaurant in montreal restaurant lunch counter wilensky''s light lunch also known as wilensky''s is a kosher-style lunch counter located on fairmount avenue west in montreal quebec canada opened in 1932 by moe wilensky the restaurant is widely believed to have inspired scenes in mordecai richler''s novel the apprenticeship of duddy kravitz as either eddy''s cigar & soda or moe''s cigar store',datetime('now')),('Q800176','Birdland','Birdland',53.5784,9.9624,'DE','restaurant',1985,19.85,'Birdland (Hamburg jazz club)','birdland jazz club in hamburg germany jazz club music venue birdland is a jazz club in hamburg the basement club is located in the eimsbüttel district on gärtnerstraße',datetime('now')),('Q8002053','Wilgenplas','Wilgenplas',52.1466,5.06141,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Wilgenplas','wilgenplas restaurant in maarssen the netherlands restaurant restaurant wilgenplas is a defunct restaurant in maarssen in the netherlands it was a fine dining restaurant that was awarded one michelin star in both 1972 and 1973',datetime('now')),('Q80120943','Evel Pie','Evel Pie',36.169244,-115.140084,'US','restaurant',2016,13.17,'Evel Pie','evel pie pizzeria in las vegas nevada restaurant evel pie is a pizzeria in las vegas nevada in the united states the restaurant is named after evel knievel and features memorabilia related to the entertainer',datetime('now')),('Q80160987','Kbelský pivovar','Kbelský pivovar',50.130574,14.548028,'CZ','brewery',2016,12.0,NULL,'kbelský pivovar brewery business',datetime('now')),('Q8019615','William Ulmer Brewery','William Ulmer Brewery',40.699167,-73.936667,'US','brewery',NULL,12.0,'William Ulmer Brewery','william ulmer brewery new york city landmark brewery the william ulmer brewery is a brewery complex in the bushwick neighborhood of brooklyn in new york city it consists of four buildings an office a brew house an engine machine house and a stable storage house all constructed between 1872 and 1890 in the german round-arch style',datetime('now')),('Q8022916','Wilson''s Diner','Wilson''s Diner|Wilson’s Diner',42.386111,-71.231389,'US','restaurant',1949,22.85,'Wilson''s Diner','wilson''s diner diner wilson''s diner is a historic diner at 507 main street us route 20 in waltham massachusetts the diner was built by the worcester lunch car company as 819 and was delivered to this site by the company in march 1949',datetime('now')),('Q8030339','Wollerich','Wollerich',51.5621,5.45974,NULL,'restaurant',NULL,19.02,'Wollerich','wollerich restaurant in sint-oedenrode netherlands restaurant french cuisine wollerich was a restaurant located in sint-oedenrode in the netherlands it is a fine dining restaurant that was awarded one michelin star in the period 1997 2007 and 2010 present',datetime('now')),('Q8032675','Woodforde''s Brewery','Woodforde''s Brewery',52.6831,1.4431,'GB','brewery',1981,12.0,'Woodforde''s Brewery','woodforde''s brewery uk brewery brewery business woodforde''s brewery is a brewery located on slad lane in the village of woodbastwick in the county of norfolk england the brewery produced its first commercial brew in 1981 from original brewery in the village of drayton north east of norwich',datetime('now')),('Q8033075','Woodman''s of Essex','Woodman''s of Essex',42.6303,-70.7746,'US','restaurant',1914,16.17,'Woodman''s of Essex','woodman''s of essex restaurant in essex restaurant seafood woodman''s of essex is a seafood restaurant in essex massachusetts approximately 26 miles 42 km north of boston a local favorite it is also known internationally for its fried clams and new england clam bakes',datetime('now')),('Q8033616','Woody''s','Woody''s',43.6644,-79.3802,'CA','bar',1989,12.0,'Woody''s (Toronto)','woody''s one of the world''s most famous gay bars in toronto ontario gay bar woody''s on church is a gay bar located at 467 church street at the gay village in toronto ontario canada',datetime('now'));
