,'Yankee Doodle Coffee Shop','Yankee Doodle Coffee Shop',41.3115,-72.9309,'US','restaurant',1950,12.0,'Yankee Doodle Coffee Shop','yankee doodle coffee shop restaurant in connecticut united states restaurant the yankee doodle coffee shop also known as the doodle was a diner in new haven connecticut that catered to the yale university community for 58 years before closing on january 28 2008 the narrow restaurant with only 12 stools arranged opposite a counter that ran the length of shop was a favorite among students faculty and employees of the university',datetime('now')),('Q8050323','Yauatcha','Yauatcha',51.5138,-0.135167,'GB','restaurant',2004,13.17,'Yauatcha','yauatcha chinese restaurant in soho london restaurant yauatcha is a chinese restaurant in broadwick street soho london england specialising in dim sum the restaurant was created in 2004 by alan yau who previously created the japanese wagamama and thai busaba eathai restaurant chains as well as the more expensive hakkasan restaurant also in london',datetime('now')),('Q8050594','Yazdani Bakery','Yazdani Bakery',18.933,72.833,'IN','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'Yazdani Bakery','yazdani bakery indian food & products company restaurant yazdani bakery is an irani cafe and persian style bakery in mumbai india as of 2023 it was a take-out establishment with the sit-down service closed',datetime('now')),('Q8050740','Ye Cracke','Ye Cracke|イー・クラック|叶·克拉克',53.4004,-2.97196,'GB','pub',NULL,24.64,'Ye Cracke','ye cracke pub in liverpool uk pub ye cracke is a 19th-century public house in liverpool england it stands on rice street a narrow offshoot of hope street and takes its name from a liverpudlian word for an alleyway',datetime('now')),('Q8050759','Ye Olde Fighting Cocks','Ye Olde Fighting Cocks|ジ・オールド・ファイティングコックス',51.748977,-0.34689,'GB','pub',NULL,28.39,'Ye Olde Fighting Cocks','ye olde fighting cocks pub in st albans hertfordshire england uk pub ye olde fighting cocks is a pub in st albans hertfordshire england it is one of several pubs that lay claim to being the oldest in england claiming to have been in business since 793 ad its claim to that date is somewhat uncertain the building is described by historic england as being of 16th-century appearance and the earliest date for which it might have been licensed is 1756',datetime('now')),('Q8050761','Ye Olde Man & Scythe','Ye Olde Man & Scythe',53.5796,-2.4263,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Ye Olde Man & Scythe','ye olde man & scythe grade ii listed pub in the united kingdom pub ye olde man & scythe is a grade ii listed public house on churchgate in bolton greater manchester england the earliest recorded mention of its name appears in a charter from 1251 making it one of the ten oldest pubs in britain and the oldest in bolton',datetime('now')),('Q8050762','Ye Olde Salutation Inn','Ye Olde Salutation Inn|ジ・オールドサルテーション・イン',52.95115,-1.151704,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Ye Olde Salutation Inn','ye olde salutation inn pub in nottingham pub ye olde salutation inn nicknamed the sal is a grade ii listed public house in nottingham with parts dating from around 1240 it lays claim along with ye olde trip to jerusalem and the bell inn to being the oldest pub in the city',datetime('now')),('Q8050764','Ye Olde Tavern','Ye Olde Tavern',43.1782,-73.0513,'US','restaurant',1790,16.17,'Ye Olde Tavern, Vermont','ye olde tavern restaurant in vermont united states restaurant ye olde tavern is a restaurant in manchester center vermont us that is listed on the vermont register of historic places it was built by aaron sheldon from dorset vermont in 1790 making it the oldest inn in the state of vermont',datetime('now')),('Q805208','Ballermann 6','Ballermann 6',39.51558,2.745059,'ES','restaurant',NULL,19.85,NULL,'ballermann 6 restaurant eating and lodging beach club',datetime('now')),('Q805254','Ballhaus Watzke','Ballhaus Watzke',51.0775,13.7157,'DE','brewery|pub',1898,22.85,'Ballhaus Watzke','ballhaus watzke ballroom and restaurant in dresden germany brewery inn ballhaus watzke self-designation ball- & brauhaus watzke is a late 19th-century restaurant with a ballroom on the upper floor and an in-house brewery under monument protection',datetime('now')),('Q8054887','Yonah Schimmel''s Knish Bakery','Yonah Schimmel''s Knish Bakery|מאפיית הקניש של יונה שימל|Yonah Schimmel Knish Bakery',40.7231,-73.9901,'US','restaurant',NULL,24.64,'Yonah Schimmel''s Knish Bakery','yonah schimmel''s knish bakery bakery and restaurant located in manhattan restaurant yonah schimmel''s knish bakery is a bakery and restaurant located at 137 east houston street between first avenue and second avenue on the lower east side of manhattan that has been selling knishes since 1890 its current location on houston street opened in 1910',datetime('now')),('Q8055623','Yorke Arms','Yorke Arms',54.134674,-1.819278,'GB','pub|restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Yorke Arms','yorke arms english restaurant and hotel restaurant pub hotel the yorke arms is a luxury events venue in ramsgill nidderdale in the yorkshire dales in northern england the building began life as a shooting lodge for the yorke family',datetime('now')),('Q80582162','Tafarn Sinc','Tafarn Sinc',51.930446,-4.800717,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Tafarn Sinc','tafarn sinc pub in rosebush wales pub tafarn sinc zinc tavern is a pub in rosebush pembrokeshire wales the building is constructed of corrugated metal which was commonly used in the second half of the nineteenth century in britain for industrial buildings but is rare for pubs',datetime('now')),('Q80582173','Y Cross Cas-lai','Y Cross Cas-lai',51.8862,-5.0345,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Y Cross Cas-lai','y cross cas-lai pub in hayscastle pembrokeshire wales uk pub y cross cas-lai english the cross inn is a community-owned pub in hayscastle cross welsh cas-lai pembrokeshire wales as the cross inn it was owned by the phillips family for 160 years and is the only pub in an isolated area',datetime('now')),('Q80583549','Tafarn y Fic','Tafarn y Fic',52.96056,-4.447832,'GB','pub',NULL,13.