ork ireland it was awarded a michelin star for 2020',datetime('now')),('Q85746004','Bavel','Bavel',34.041428,-118.232707,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,'Bavel (restaurant)','bavel israeli restaurant in los angeles california united states restaurant israeli cuisine bavel is a middle eastern restaurant in the arts district neighborhood of los angeles the restaurant defines itself as middle eastern showcasing the cuisines of israel morocco turkey and egypt though some critics characterize it as israeli',datetime('now')),('Q85746774','Aanaar','Aanaar',68.906111,27.006667,'FI','restaurant',NULL,24.0,'Aanaar (restaurant)','aanaar restaurant in inari finland restaurant restaurant aanaar is a restaurant in inari finland at the hotel kultahovi which was on the list of the 50 best restaurants in finland in 2019 the finnish gastronomical society has named it as the restaurant of the year in finland in 2020',datetime('now')),('Q85753023','Club Café','Club Café',42.34839,-71.07247,'US','bar',1983,12.0,'Club Café','club café gay bar and restaurant in boston massachusetts u s gay bar music venue club café is a gay bar restaurant and nightclub in boston''s back bay neighborhood in the u s state of massachusetts the bar was established in 1983',datetime('now')),('Q85758835','El Tepeyac Café','El Tepeyac Café',34.047778,-118.197639,'US','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'El Tepeyac Café','el tepeyac café mexican restaurant in los angeles ca us restaurant mexican cuisine el tepeyac café or simply el tepeyac is a longstanding mexican restaurant in the boyle heights neighborhood of east los angeles',datetime('now')),('Q85760389','Falcon Inn','Falcon Inn',52.05621,1.15275,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'Falcon Inn, Ipswich','falcon inn pub in ipswich suffolk england united kingdom pub the falcon inn is a public house located at the junction of queen street and falcon street in ipswich suffolk located at 1 falcon street it was owned by the falcon brewery located next door at 5 falcon street',datetime('now')),