ouse house the old rectory is a grade ii listed georgian building on churchgate in stockport greater manchester england built in the mid-18th century for reverend samuel stead to replace an earlier parsonage it was later used as an army billet during the second world war and from 1951 to 1965 was the residence of david saunders-davies the second bishop of stockport',datetime('now')),('Q96111504','Lem''s Bar-B-Q','Lem''s Bar-B-Q',41.758201,-87.617635,'US','restaurant',1954,13.17,'Lem''s Bar-B-Q','lem''s bar-b-q restaurant in chicago illinois barbecue restaurant cuisine of the southern united states lem''s bar-b-q is a barbecue restaurant in the chatham community of chicago illinois in the united states the restaurant is known for its rib tips which eater has described as chicago''s most famous rib tips in 2025 it was named one of america''s classics by the james beard foundation',datetime('now')),('Q96142375','Kantishna Roadhouse','Kantishna Roadhouse',63.525278,-150.960833,'US','restaurant',NULL,13.17,NULL,'kantishna roadhouse roadhouse',datetime('now')),('Q96279959','Wuth’sche Brauerei','Wuth’sche Brauerei',50.04359,8.25635,'DE','brewery',NULL,13.17,NULL,'wuth sche brauerei building in germany brewery',datetime('now')),('Q96291343','Café Loos','Café Loos',51.909167,4.478889,NULL,'cafe',1988,13.17,NULL,'café loos grand cafe restaurant café',datetime('now')),('Q96371855','Alpha Michigan Brewing Company','Alpha Michigan Brewing Company',46.047056,-88.377167,'US','brewery',2018,12.0,'Alpha Michigan Brewing Company','alpha michigan brewing company brewery in alpha michigan united states brewery the alpha michigan brewing company ambc is a nanobrewery in the village of alpha in the upper peninsula of michigan',datetime('now')),('Q96374129','Burger Brewing Company','Burger Brewing Company',39.1031,-84.512,NULL,'brewery',NULL,12.0,'Burger Brewing Company','burger brewing company american brewery brewery the burger brewing company was an american brewery based in cincinnati