','restaurant',NULL,12.0,'Nom Wah Tea Parlor','nom wah tea parlor restaurant in new york ny restaurant nom wah tea parlor chinese 南華茶室 cantonese yale nàahm wàh chàhsāt lit ''south china tea house'' opened in 1920 is the oldest continuously running restaurant in the chinatown of manhattan in new york city',datetime('now')),('Q963973','Frank Pepe Pizzeria Napoletana','Frank Pepe Pizzeria Napoletana|프랭크 페페 피체리아 나폴레타나',41.302889,-72.916889,'US','restaurant',1925,27.64,'Frank Pepe Pizzeria Napoletana','frank pepe pizzeria napoletana restaurant restaurant italian cuisine frank pepe pizzeria napoletana commonly known as frank pepe''s or simply pepe''s is a new haven style pizzeria chain based in connecticut with their flagship restaurant in the wooster square neighborhood of new haven connecticut at 163 wooster street and originator of new haven-style pizza opened in 1925 it is one of the oldest and best known pizzerias in the united states',datetime('now')),('Q96406341','St. Lawrence','St. Lawrence',49.283306,-123.097945,'CA','restaurant',NULL,19.85,'St. Lawrence (restaurant)','st lawrence restaurant in vancouver restaurant st lawrence is a french-canadian restaurant in the japantown neighbourhood of vancouver british columbia',datetime('now')),('Q96408519','The Cartford Inn','The Cartford Inn',53.86058,-2.88046,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Cartford','the cartford inn public house and hotel in little eccleston lancashire united kingdom pub inn hotel the cartford formerly cartford hotel and cartford arms and cartford inn is a boutique hotel and restaurant with rooms in little eccleston-with-larbreck lancashire england the property comprises a restaurant holding 2 aa rosettes and a listing in the michelin guide thirteen individually designed bedrooms an on-site deli and an art gallery',datetime('now')),('Q96408896','The Green Man at Inglewhite','The Green Man at Inglewhite',53.853586,-2.689769,'GB','pub',NULL,13.17,'The Green Man at Inglewhite','the green man at inglewhite pu